1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mrs. Victoria Mary Cento, 79, died Tuesday afternoon about 5:30 in her home, 1109 1/2 Broadway.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Cento was born in Italy in March 1870, a daughter of Mr. and Mrs. Santo Riggitano, and came to the United States and Quincy about fifty years ago. Her husband, Vincent Cento, died in 1929.
2 CONT
2 CONT [Left to mourn] besides her sister are two brothers: Anthony Riggitano of Rome, Italy; and John Riggitano of Chicago.
2 CONT
2 CONT - Quincy Herald Whig, Wednesday, December 28, 1949; page 4.
