2 CONT ** “According to the Alien Registration, dated 24 September 1940, John Riggitano Prevost arrived in the United States at New York in May 1905 [sic: 1903] on the SS Perugia. Surprisingly, John gave his name on his alien registratio
2 CONC n at arrival as Salvatore Giovanni Riggitano Alioto (Giovanni is the Italian equivalent of the English name John). His birthplace was listed as Milazzo, Province of Messina, Italy, and he was born on 24 June 1876 – an exact match 
2 CONC to the date of birth listed on John R. Prevost’s death certificate.” (''Ancestry blog, 15 May 2025''.)
