2 CONT When Elizabeth Christina Bachmann was born on 2. juni 1895, in Quincy, Adams, Illinois, Amerikas Forenede Stater, her father, Lorenz Bachmann, was 65 and her mother, Elizabeth Kihm, was 31. She married Charles Leslie Pugh * ( div)
2 CONC  on 29. maj 1918. She lived in Riverside Township, Adams, Illinois, Amerikas Forenede Stater in 1900. She died on 22. februar 1992, at the age of 96.
