1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT === Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Joseph N. Martinez''' was a naturalized citizen of the United States, born 08 January 1864 to Jacques and Marie Martinez in Santo Domingo, Dominican Republic (at the time occupied by Haiti).  He died 31 July 1926 in Chicago, Co
2 CONC ok County, Illinois, and was buried in the All Saints Catholic Cemetery and Mausoleum in Des Plaines, Illinois. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Nerval Martinez, age 23,  native of Haiti, son of James Martinez and Rosa Ramos, married Louise Baquie, age 19, native of New Orleans, in New Orleans on 17 Sep 1887.  She was the daughter of Ferdinand Baquié and Eugenie Gra
2 CONC mbois.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children were  Irma, Marguerite, Lydia, Louise, Hilda, Ethel, born in New Orleans, and  Mildred, born in Chicago; they had moved from New Orleans to Chicago about 1911.  Death certificate says buried in Chicago, but wife's r
2 CONC ecord says she is buried in Des Plaines.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
