2 CONC inez of New Orleans and his wife Louise Baquie. Joseph Martinez 1864-1926 of New Orleans grandfather of Pope Leo, was the son of Jacques (II) and the grandson of Jacques Martino of Italy. He left New Orleans for Chicago in 1910. T
2 CONC he name changed from Martino to Martinez in New Orleans.
