2 CONC nytimes.com] > The records show that couple [Joseph Martinez and Louise Baquié]  married at Our Lady of the Sacred Heart in New Orleans. Until it was destroyed by a hurricane in 1915, the church’s building was on Annette Street in
2 CONC  the city’s Seventh Ward, a historic center of Louisiana’s Afro-Creole culture.
