2 CONT *''The Chicago Tribune via Yahoo! News''.  “Pope Leo XIV’s family: What to know about his parents and their deep Chicago ties.” (8 May 2025) < [https://www.yahoo.com/news/pope-leo-xiv-family-know-003800595.html link] > Sr. Mary Am
2 CONC arita (aunt) A sister to Mildred Prevost, she was born on Nov. 26, 1906, and took her first vows on Aug. 15, 1928, according to the Sisters of Charity of the Blessed Virgin Mary based in Dubuque, Iowa. Their records show she serve
2 CONC d as a music teacher at schools in Clinton, Iowa, and Tigard, Oregon. She also spent one year as a music teacher at St. Gilbert in Grayslake. She preceded her mother in death in 1945.
