2 CONT ===Marie Rosa Ramos
2 CONT * Gender: 	Female 
2 CONT * Birth: 	September 24, 1826 - New Orleans, Orleans Parish, Louisiana, United States 
2 CONT * Death: 	May 04, 1904 (77) - New Orleans, Orleans Parish, Louisiana, United States  
2 CONT * Parents: George Pantaleon Ramos & Julienne Jacquet Montreuil
2 CONT * Husband: James Jacques Martinez - married July 14 1848  Orleans, Louisiana
2 CONT Children
2 CONT # 	Joseph Martinez
2 CONT # Marie Martinez
2 CONT # Nisida Martinez
2 CONT # Chéne Martinez
2 CONT # James Martinez
2 CONT # Michael Martinez
2 CONT # Gerard Martinez
2 CONT # Joseph Norval Martinez
2 CONT # Adele Martinez
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
2 CONT The family can be found in the 1870 U.S. census in New Orleans with their children, including Michel Martinez and Joseph Norval Martinez (Pope Leo XIV’s maternal grandfather). In the record, Jacques’s occupation is tailor and the 
2 CONC family is identified as “mulatto.”
2 CONT
