2 CONC y 2025. [https://www.geni.com/people/Pope-Leo-XIV/6000000218365400850 Pope Leo XIV]’s maternal grandparents were the Hispaniola-born mixed-race Joseph Martínez, and the New Orleans-born Louise Baquié (also rendered Baquiex), a mix
2 CONC ed-race Black Creole.[18][19][20] Joseph was born to Jacques and Marie Martinez in Santo Domingo, Dominican Republic (at the time occupied by Haiti). Jacques and Marie were registered on the 1910 United States census as Maltese an
2 CONC d Spanish respectively, however they may have done so to pass as white.[21]
