1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Ferdinand David Baquié''' was born on October 10, 1837 in Louisiana, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34843010713 Joseph Aristide Baquié] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34843010987 Celeste (Lemel
2 CONC le) Guimont]. He was a shoemaker
2 CONT
2 CONT Ferdinand married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34843010689 Eugenie Grambois]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34843007609 Louise (Baquie) Martinez]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34843011237 Victoria (Baquie) Levachez].  
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on January 18, 1883 in Orleans Parish, Louisiana, United States. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
