1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT OBITUARY for Charles Edward Shinnick; recent residence: Lexington, KY; published by Milward Funeral Directors:
2 CONT
2 CONT > '''Charles Edward Shinnick June 26, 1930-January 21, 2022 Lexington, Kentucky'''
2 CONT > Charles Edward Shinnick, 91, devoted husband, died Fri., Jan. 21, 2022, at his residence. Born Jun., 26, 1930 in Evanston, IL, He was the son of the Late Frank and Marguerite Shinnick. He was a retired Lieutenant Colonel of the 
2 CONC US Air Force. He was a graduate of the University of Kentucky, and an avid UK Wildcat fan. Survivors include his wife, Delores Shinnick, one son  and one daughter, numerous grandchildren and many great grandchildren. Funeral servi
2 CONC ces will be held Friday, January 28th, at 2:00pm, at Milward-Southland, 391 Southland Dr., Lexington, KY. Burial will follow in Blue Grass Memorial Gardens, Nicholasville, KY. Memorial contributions are suggested to Bluegrass Care
2 CONC  Navigators. milwardfuneral.com
2 CONT
