1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === Aline Louise Martinez  
2 CONT * Gender:	Female   
2 CONT * Birth:	March 01, 1885  - Orleans Parish, Louisiana, United States   
2 CONT * Death:	September 03, 1947 (62) - Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States   
2 CONT * Place of Burial:	Holy Cross Cemetery, Culver City, Los Angeles, California, United States 
2 CONT * Parents: Michel Martinez and Louise Roussel 
2 CONT * Spouse: Joseph Matthews Fauria  - married 10 January 1903, New Orleans, Orleans, Louisiana, United States
2 CONT
2 CONT At the age of 17, Aline married Joseph Matthews Fauria. Their family continued to live in New Orleans before moving to Ontario, Canada where Vernon Louis Fauria, was born. They eventually moved to California.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Note:''' Birth record says Louise Aline Martinez, but consistently went by Aline Louise. Name sometimes misspelled as "Eileen" or other variations.
2 CONT
