1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT
2 CONT When Agnes Martinez was born on 9 January 1886, in Louisiana, United States, her father, Gerard Martinez Ramos, was 26 and her mother, Elizabeth Ernestine Rouzan, was 25. She married Joseph Paul Adolf Sorapuru on 18 April 1908, in
2 CONC  Orleans, Louisiana, United States. She lived in Chicago, Cook, Illinois, United States for about 20 years. She died on 17 November 1968, in Township of Bremen, Cook, Illinois, United States, at the age of 82, and was buried in De
2 CONC s Plaines, Cook, Illinois, United States.
2 CONT
