2 CONT # “Is Pope Leo Jewish? Ask his distant cousins — like me.”  < [https://forward.com/culture/719350/pope-leo-jewish-henry-loeb-family-tree/ forward.com/culture] > By [https://www.geni.com/people/Robin-Washington/6000000045425511989?
2 CONC through=6000000039971096963 Robin Washington] (May 12, 2025) “… our shared connection begins not in the United States but Germany, where my maternal second great-grandmother https://www.geni.com/people/Marianna-Birkenstein/6000000
2 CONC 039971096963?through=6000000039321798656 was born. Her brother married into the Newhouse family, with a descendant marrying one of the progeny of Joseph Aristide Bacquié of France, Guadeloupe and New Orleans. Bacquié’s racially mi
2 CONC xed line is from whom Leo and his mother also descend.“
