1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Celeste was the daughter  of Louis and Celeste Olympe de Grandpre Lemelle.  Wife of (1st) Joseph Aristide Fleury Baquie; (2nd) Michel Frederic Guimont.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT # Célèste was born in Louisiana. She had a plaçage relationship with Joseph Aristide Baquié and they had two sons. Later she married Frederic Guimont and they had at least four children.
