2 CONT On 5 September 1785, Rosalie married SANTIAGO MARTINEZ (originally, JACOB MARTINE), said then to be a native of “Perne in Germany.” Their official witness was Jean Baptiste Saussie of the family discussed at notes 41–42. Rosalie’s
2 CONC  first child, a daughter, was buried as a “Panquinet” in February 1786, five months after the marriage.193
