1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Auguste Baquie was one of the children born to Jean Pierre Baquie and his second wife Marie Thérèse Rancurel.
2 CONT
2 CONT He immigrated from his native France with his wife and son Leopold. He became a naturalized citizen of the US in 1838. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Date of birth and parents courtesy of Contributor: David QUENEHERVE (49252089) 
2 CONT
2 CONT (Suggested edit: Auguste BAQUIE is not the son of Jean Rose Joseph BAQUIE but his half brother. I found his birth record in Pointe-à-Pitre (Guadeloupe). Declaration made by his father, Jean Pierre BAQUIE, on July 28th 1806. He was
2 CONC  born on April 2d 1806. His mother is Thérèse RANCURET, a native of Marseilles. Auguste BAQUIE is a full brother of Aristide BAQUIE, also born in Pointe-à-Pitre (in 1811).
