1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Johnny Fauria, 73, a resident of Carson Valley for the last 18 years, passed away March 1, 2012 in Carson City, Nevada. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Johnny was born December 9, 1938 in Los Angeles, California, to Hilton and Esther Fauria. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was passionate about politics, religion and his family. Johnny spent his entire adult life as a small business owner, his latest being The Screenmobile with his wife and son. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He is survived by his wife, Mary Fauria, of 46 years; sons, Garritt Fauria and Beau Fauria; daughters, Valerie Kruse and Suzanne Lane; brother, Ramon Fauria; and seven grandchildren, Samantha, Skyler, Brett, Mark, Maranatha, Davey
2 CONC  and Zachary. 
2 CONT
2 CONT A memorial service for Johnny will be Saturday, March 10, 2012 at 11:00 a.m. at the High Sierra Fellowship, 1701 Lucerne St, Minden, Nevada, with a burial following at Eastside Memorial Park. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Arrangements entrusted to Walton's Funerals and Cremations.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/97587402/john_leslie-fauria Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''May 10 
