2 CONT Gretchen married Thomas Francis Rouzan Aug. 27, 1955 in NOLA.day, July 11, 2014, at the age of 81. She was born November 15,1932, in New Orleans, Louisiana to the late Joseph Jacob Fabacher and Lucille Tujague Fabacher. Mrs. Rouza
2 CONC n was a lifelong parishioner ofSt. Francis Xavier Catholic Church. She is precede in death by her parents, and her loving husband of 15 years, Thomas F. Rouzan. Gretchen is survived by her daughters, Sharon R. Smith, Laura R. Albi
2 CONC no and Renee R. George. She is also survived by her siblings Elaine, Janice, Carole, Marion and Frederick; and her grandchildren Thomas, Courtney, Kaitlin, Sarah, Mathew, Glyn, Anthony and Gabrielle. The family attended a private 
2 CONC service for Gretchen in Metairie Cemetery.
