2 CONT ==Biography==Jean Savoye was born about 1692. He was the son of [[Savoie-15|GermainSavoie]] and [[Breau-9|Marie Breau]]. He was age 1 on the 1693 censusof Port Royal. 
2 CONT He married Marie Dupius, daughter of Jean Dupuis and Anne Richard. 14 November 1718 at Port Royal.<ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds dela paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-1870 (image 176) htt
2 CONC p://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1869/176?r=0&s=5</ref><ref>An Acadian Parish Remembered The Registers of St. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755 Jean Savoye and MarieDupius</ref>
2 CONT
