2 CONT Louis Joseph Jean Francois Pierre Castel.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Castel-10
2 CONT
2 CONT Also as: Pierre Francois Castel dit Lilois
2 CONT
2 CONT Castel was born in 1692 and died in 1750.[citation needed]
2 CONT
2 CONT Jean Pierre (aka Louis, aka Francois, Castel, twice-widowed and much older than his bride, married by 1738 Cecile Christophe. He had abandoned his German Coast farm for fur trade among the Choctaw and Chickasaw Indians. Christophe
2 CONC  abandoned Castel and their infants in August 1744..." (Although it appears they later lived with/near her.) Castel may have fathered the following children of Christophe (most of whom used the Castel surname):[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT # Catherine Castel (wife of Claude La Forêt of New Orleans);
2 CONT # Louise Castel (wife of Pierre Denis Panquinette/ Pantinette of New Orleans);
2 CONT # Marie Jeanne Castel (wife of Louis La Prairie of the Rapides Post);
2 CONT # Pierre Jacques Castel (died young);
2 CONT # Marie Ursulle Castel (wife of Jacques Rachal of the Natchitoches Post);
2 CONT # Marie Françoise (surname not used) of the Rapides Post (wife of Vicente Bissainte, an Apalache Indian, and Robert McKim);
2 CONT # Jean Gregoire Marchand dit Castel and Varangue (husband of Marie de l’Incarnation Derbanne of Natchitoches);
2 CONT #  ? Marie Barbe Marchand dite Babé Varangue of Rapides and Natchitoches (wife of Solomon, an Apalache Indian);
2 CONT #  ? Nicolas Joseph Sarde, who died young.
2 CONT
