2 CONT
2 CONT JEAN  was born in 1786. He married Catherine Victoire Regnier du Timat on October 11, 1810, in Kingston, Jamaica. They had two children during their marriage. He died on September 27, 1871, in Westmoreland, Jamaica, having lived  
2 CONC 85 years.
