2 CONT !BIRTH: date of Pierre THIBODEAUX was calculated from the death record. !INFORMATION: Pierre THIBODEAUX is listed as the Father of Pedro THIBODEAUX (RIN 958) in "The Opelousas Post" by Gladys DEVILLIER - 976.35 K2 PAGE 140. !MARRI
2 CONC AGE: recorded at St. Landry and St. Martin of Tours Catholic Churches, Opelousas and St. Martinville, La. (OPEL CH) and (SM CH). The marriage of Pierre THIBODEAUX to Francoise SAUNIER in listed in the succession of Francoise SAUNN
2 CONC IER dated 23 Jun 1790, recorded at Louisiana State Archives Record, New Orleans, La. (LSAR: OPEL: 1790 and in the death record of Francoise SAUNNIER dated 1811 (OPEL CH VOL# 1 PAGE 117). !DEATH: recorded at St. Landry Catholic Chu
2 CONC rch, Opelousas, La. (OPEL CH VOL# 1 PAGE 117), which occurred at the age of 84. DEATH: listed in "The Opelousas Post" by Gladys DEVILLIER - 976.35 K2 PAGE 140, Pedro THIBODOT was burried 23 Jul 1790. Pierre THIBODEAUX, widower of 
2 CONC Francoise SAUNIER (SONNIER) in a succession date 23 June 1790 which was recordedat Louisiana State Archives Record, Baton Rouge, La. (LSAR: OPEL: 1790). Also recorded at St. Landry Catholic Church, Opelousas, La. (OPEL CH VOL 1 PA
2 CONC GE 13).
