2 CONT == Biography =='''Marie Dupuis''' was born about 1702 in Port Royal, Acadia. She married Jean Savoye, son of Germain Savoye and Marie Brun 14 Nov 1718 at  Port Royal, Acadia. Signed by Michel Richard, Guillaume Blanchard, Pierre L
2 CONC anoue and Rene Babino.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-1870 (image 176) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1869/176?r=0&s=5≤/ref>≤ref>
2 CONC An Acadian Parish Remembered The Registers of St. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755 Jean Savoye and Marie Dupius marriage RG 1 volume 26 page 322 https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=1338≤/ref>
2 CONT
