2 CONT == Biography == 
2 CONT Marie Joseph Savoye was born 14 May 1722. She was the daughter of [[Savoie-67|Jean Savoie]] and [[Dupuis-295|Marie Dupuis]]. She was baptized the same day at Port Royal. Her godparents were Paul Savoye and AnneDupuis.≤ref>Library 
2 CONC and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-1870 (image 53) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1869/53?r=0&s=5≤/ref>≤ref>An Acadian Parish Remembered The Regi
2 CONC sters of St. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755 Marie Joseph Savoye baptism  RG 1 volume 26page 184 https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=906≤/ref>
2 CONT
