2 CONT # Pierre Appolinaire SAULNIER ca 1766-
2 CONT # Joseph SAULNIER ca 1768-1810
2 CONT # Eleonore SAULNIER 1770-
2 CONT
2 CONT :This woman?:Among the Acadian exiles in New Orleans, 1767. A notation indicates she had not yet received rations from the government for the month of July, 1767.≤ref>Title: Ensemble Encore, "Life Lines"; Author: Acadian Memorial 
2 CONC Foundation. Database of Acadian Immigrants to Louisiana (Internet [http://www.acadianmemorial.org/ensemble_encore2/search.htm Entry for Marie Savoie]:Text: List of Acadians in the City (New Orleans), 1767, AGI, PPC, 114.≤/ref>
2 CONT :Baptism of daughter, St. James Church. Note: One of the earliest baptisms in this parish.:Text: Saulais (sometimes Seiules) Eleonore, daughter of Joseph & Marie Savois, baptized 6 Dec 1770, born not given. Sponsors: Sr Louis Boit
