2 CONT == Biography =='''Pierre Savoye''' was born 22 Jan 1727. He was the son of [[Savoie-67|Jean Savoie]] and [[Dupuis-295|Marie Dupuis]]. He was baptized the same day at Port Royal. His godparents were Claude Savoye, son of Germain Sa
2 CONC voye and Jeanne Dupuy, wife of Simon Le Blanc.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-1870 (image 108) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c186
2 CONC 9/108?r=0&s=5≤/ref>≤ref>An Acadian Parish Remembered The Registers of St. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755 Pierre Savoye baptism RG 1 volume 26 page 256 https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=1161≤/ref> Pa
2 CONC rents names are recordedas Jean Savoye and Marie Dupuy.
2 CONT He married Elisabeth Thibodeau about 1750.≤ref>Dictionnaire Généalogique des Familles Acadiennes: 1715 à 1780780 - Stephen A. White - Moncton, NB: Centre d'Études Acadiennes, draft version - Centre d'Études Acadiennes - Centre d'É
2 CONC tudes Acadiennes University of Moncton - Centre d'Études Acadiennes - 1 University of Moncton - SAVOIE no. 5 d.≤/ref>
