2 CONT
2 CONT '''Germain Savoie''' was born ABT 1654, and died AFT 7 JAN 1733/34. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie dite Vincelotte Breau on ABT 1678 in Port Royal, Acadia, Nova Scotia, Canada . 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Francois SAVOIE and Catherine Lejeune.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT -https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Savoie-15
2 CONT
2 CONT Event: Presence 19 MAY 1727 appeared before British authorities & was questioned about leaving the colony without permission in a period in 1727 with his neighbour Pierre Gaudet - he was dismissed 
2 CONT
2 CONT Event: NB DEC 1729 signed the oath of allegiance. " Je promets & jure sincerement en foi of chretien que je serai entierement fidele & obeirai vraiment Sa Majeste, George, second que je reconnais pour souverain Seigneur of Nouvell
2 CONC e Ecosse & of l'Acadie ".
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT [Category: Port-Royal, Acadie]
2 CONT {Acadian}
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT '''NOTICE''': this profile is protected by the [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Project:Acadians Acadian Project] because it is a highly viewed profile. Please contact the Acadian Project before making any substantive changes. Thank
2 CONC s for helping make WikiTree the best site for accurate information.
2 CONT
2 CONT {One Name Study|name=Savoie|category=Canada, Savoie Name Study}
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Germain Savoie''', son of [[Savoie-9|François Savoie]] and [[Lejeune-11|Catherine Lejeune]], was born at Port-Royal, Acadie in 1654.<ref>“La généalogie des trente-sept familles hôtesses des ‘Retrouvailles ‘94”; WHITE, Stephen A
2 CONC .; Les Cahiers de la Société historique acadienne, vol. 25, nos 2 et 3 (1994) [http://www.umoncton.ca/umcm-ceaac/node/55 Genealogy of 37 Families] or [http://www.umoncton.ca/umcm-ceaac/files/umcm-ceaac/wf/wf/pdf/37fam-Savoie.pdf S
2 CONC avoie]
2 CONT :"Né en France vers 1621, François Savoie est arrivé en Acadie avant 1651, date où il s'est marié à Catherine Lejeune. Neuf enfants sont issus de leur mariage, dont '''Germain, né vers 1654,''' qui épousa vers 1678 Marie Breau, fi
2 CONC lle de Vincent Breau et de Marie Bourque" </ref> Germain was the only one of François' sons to create a family of his own.  In c.1678, he married Marie, daughter of Vincent Breau dit Vincelotte, at Port-Royal.  Germain and Marie r
2 CONC emained at Port-Royal and had a dozen children, including five sons, all born at Port-Royal, who created families of their own.  Three of their daughters married into the Blanchard, Babineau dit Deslauriers, and Poirier families.<
2 CONC ref> Cormier, Steven A. -[http://www.acadiansingray.com/Appendices-ATLAL-SAVOIE-SAVOY.htm Acadians Who Found Refuge in Louisiana, February 1764-early 1800s]; SAVOIE/SAVOY [sah-VWAH, sah-VOY] ACADIA. Copyright (c) 2007-13  </ref>  
2 CONC <!--This DOB conflicts with White's other cited info, and is otherwiseredundant::Germain was born about 1662 in Port-Royal, Acadie. Around 1678, he married Marie Breau in Port-Royal.<ref> Professor Stephen A.  White, Dictionnaire 
2 CONC Généalogique des familles Acadiennes, 1636-1714, 1999 Centre d'Études Acadiennes-Université de Moncton, Vol II, page 1457-1458.
2 CONT
2 CONT Known Children:
2 CONT #  [[Savoie-64|Germain Savoie]]
2 CONT #  [[Savoie-65|Francois Savoie]]
