2 CONC : [http://www.acadian-cajun.com/1671a.htm graph of original census. :Francois SAVOYE, 50, wife, Catherine LeJEUNE 38; children: Francoise 18, '''Germain''' 16, Marie 14, Jeanne 13, Catherine 9, Francoise 8, Barabe 6, Andree 4, Mar
2 CONC ie 2; cattle 4.</ref>
2 CONT :'''1678''' Port-Royal Census<ref>: “Acadian Genealogy”, hosted byTim Hebert; [http://www.acadian-cajun.com/1678cens.htm 1678 Port Royal Census]:Text: Germain Savoye & Marie Beraud-4 acres, 4 cattle <!--Missing something? :: *Colu
2 CONC mn (a) is the age according to the 1678 census. :: *Column (b) is the birth year, calculated from the 1678 census.:: *Column (c) is the name of the child according to the censuses in which the :: name occurs. :: *Column (d) is the
2 CONC  birth year, calculated from the 1671 census. :: *Column (e) is the birth year, calculated from the 1686 census.--> </ref> :'''1686''' Port-Royal, Acadia Census<ref>“Acadian Genealogy”, hosted by Tim Hebert; [http://www.acadian-ca
2 CONC jun.com/1686cens.htm 1686 Acadian Census]:: Germain SAVOYE   31; Marie BARAULT    21; Germain     5; Francois  2 </ref> :'''1693''' Port-Royal, Acadia Census<ref> “Acadian Genealogy”, hosted by Tim Hebert [http://www.acadian-cajun
2 CONC .com/1693cens.htm 1693 Acadian Census],  accessed:: Germain SAVOYE 37, Marie BEREAU 30, Germain 11, Francois 9, Marie 7, Jean 1; 8 cattle, 12 sheep, 6 pigs, 8 arpents, 1 gun </ref> :'''1698''' Port-Royal, Acadia Census<ref>: “Acad
2 CONC ian Genealogy”, hosted by Tim Hebert; [http://www.acadian-cajun.com/1698cens.htm 1698 Acadian Census], accessed>:: Germain SAVOYE 46; Marie BRAULT (wife) 36; Germain 16; Francois 14,Marie 12; Pierre 8; Jean 5; Magdeleine 4; Paul 2
2 CONC ; 12 cattle, 14 sheep, 13 hogs, 16 arpents, 12 fruit trees, 1 gun. </ref>
