2 CONT Bona Arsenault, HISTORY AND GENEALOGY OF THE ACADIANS, 1630-1775; p. 795 
2 CONT
2 CONT >(Port Royal); Born 1684, Francois married at Port Royal on 23 Nov 1707 to Marie RICHARD, daughter of Alexandre & Isabelle PETITPAS. 13 children are listed. Francois lived in the upper reaches of the Port Royal river. His two last
2 CONC  children were baptized at Grand Pre. Some members of this family settled in Louisiana. "Genealogical Dictionary of Acadian Families" by Stephen White, vol 2, p. "1458", "1460"
2 CONT
