2 CONT [Category: Port-Royal, Acadie]
2 CONT {Acadian}
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT {One Name Study|name=Savoie|category=Canada, Savoie Name Study}
2 CONT
2 CONT '''François le jeune, the second child of Germain Savoie''' and Marie Breau was born around 1684 in Port Royal, Acadia. [1][2]Here François Savoye married Marie Richard, the daughter of Alexandre Richard and Elizabeth Petitpas, 23
2 CONC  November 1707 at Port Royal.[3] [4][1]
2 CONT They had 13 children, including seven sons who married into the Thibodeau, Haché, Comeau, Arcand, Richard, Arseneau, Préjean, Lord, and Melanson families. Five of their daughters married into the Arseneau, Comeau, Hébert dit Manue
2 CONC l, and Thibodeau families. [5][1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:<ref name="DGFA"/>
