2 CONT == Biography =='''Pierre Savoye''', son of Germain Savoye and Marie Brault, was born in Port-Royal about 1690. He was age 8 on the 1698 census of Port Royal.<ref>CENSUS: 1698, Port Royal, Acadia: Germain SAVOYE 46; Marie BRAULT (w
2 CONC ife) 36; Germain 16; Francois 14, Marie 12; '''Pierre 8'''; Jean 5; Magdeleine 4; Paul 2; 12 cattle, 14 sheep, 13 hogs, 16 arpents, 12 fruit trees, 1 gun. </ref> Pierre Savoye, son of Germain Savoye the elder and Marie Brau died o
2 CONC f an illness, aged about 20 years and was buried 24 Nov 1710 in the cemetery of St Laurent Chapel up river.<ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-1870 (imag
2 CONC e 200) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1869/200?r=0&s=5</ref><ref>An Acadian Parish Remembered The Registers of St. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755 Pierre Savoye burial RG 1 volume 26 page 354 https://
