1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/KPSM-S97
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Madelaine'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Madelaine Savoye was born about 1694, in Port-Royal, Acadia, New France, her father, Germain Savoye, was 42 and her mother, Marie Breau, was 34. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married René Babineau on 26 April 1711, in Saint-Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, Nova Scotia, British North America. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 7 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 12 March 1770, in Hôtel-Dieu de Québec, Quebec City, District Judiciaire de Québec, Quebec, British North America, at the age of 77, and was buried in Hôtel-Dieu de Québec, Quebec City, District Judiciaire de Québec, Q
2 CONC uebec, British North America.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Sources:'''
2 CONT **Drouin Institute (Archived marriage record - see attached in Media tab)
