2 CONC  at Port Royal.<ref>Acadia.Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870C-1870 (image 155) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1869/155?r=0&s=5</ref><ref>N
2 CONC ova Scotia Archives: Acadians: An AcadianParish Remembered: The Registers of St. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755, RG 1, vol. 26, p. 301 https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=1275</ref>
