2 CONT == Biography =='''Marie Savoye''' was born about 1686. She was the daughter of [[Savoie-15|Germain Savoie]] and [[Breau-9|Marie Breau]]. She married Rene Blanchard, son of Guillaume Blanchard and Huguette Goujon 18 Jan 1708 at Por
2 CONC t Royal.<ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-1870 (image 131) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1869/131?r=0&s=5</ref><ref>An Acadian Par
2 CONC ish Remembered, René Blanchard and Marie Savoye marriage Register-RG 1 volume 26 page 288 
