2 CONT ----------
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	May 24, 1703 Nova Scotia, Canada Death: 	unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles was the son of Germain Savoie and Marie dit Vincelotte Breau. He was the husband of Francoise Martin. Charles and fly were deported from Acadia and were sent to New York. From there, most of the family found its way to St.
2 CONC  Pierre Martinque, West Indies. Charles is not listed with his family in the Jan 1766 Martinque census and his wife is listed with a new husband Hugue Racle, so Charles could have died in New York or during the trip to Martinique 
2 CONC or possibly after they arrived. 
2 CONT
