2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT BIO: Marie was born in about 1650. She is the daughter of Denis Gaudet and Martine Gauthier. She married (1) Olivier Daigle in 1666, in Port-Royal, Acaide. They are the parents of at least the following:1) Jean (abt 1667- ) [per t
2 CONC he 1671 census]2) Jacques (about 1669 - ) [per the 1671 cemsus]3) Bernard (1670-1751) md Claire Bourg2) Olivier (1674-1709) md Jeanne Blanchard3) Marie (1677-) md (a)Jacques Gouzil and (b) Louis Blain4) Anne (1679-) md (a) Mathuri
2 CONC n Thenier and (b) Etienne Poitevin She married (2) John Fredelle in about 1685. ::  https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/184455498/marie-godet#add-to-vc
