1 NOTE Married 1666 Olivier Daigle/Daigre (born 1643 in France; died at Port Royal) at Port Royal, Acadia, Can; sources: Drouin pg 333; "Généalogie de L'ancienne Acadie" [DA-DI] pg 5 shows family with 9 children & [G-K] pg 1.
2 CONT Remarried 1667 Martin Aucion (born 1647/1651 at Riviere aux Canards, France; buried 15 May 1711) at Port Royal, Acadia, Canada; sources: Drouin pg 29; "Généalogie de L'ancienne Acadie" [A-A] shows family with 14 children.
2 CONT The 1671 census of Acadia shows her age 21; census filed with censuses.
2 CONT Another 1671 census shows OLIVIER DAIGRE, age 28, his spouse MARIE GAUDET, age 20; 2 children: Jehan age 4 and Jacques, age 2; this copy also filed in censuses.
2 CONT 1671 Acadian Census shows her to have a sister 7 yrs. younger who was also named MARIE.  Her record also shows her as being married to Martin Aucion which complicates matters?  See the following which may clarify!
2 CONT <http://geocities.com/ronald_gaudet2001/wga7.html> (copy filed L-14-8).
2 CONT Généalogie de L'ancienne Acadie (from the internet) shows her first marriage to Olivier Daigre or Daigle at Port Royal with 5 children: Jean (n 1667); Jacques (n 1669); Bernard (n 1670); Louis (n 1673); Olivier (n 1674). Also show
2 CONC s her remarriage before 1686 to Jean Fredel or  Fredelle or Fardel.  The 1686 census shows the following children with the surname Fredel: Jean (n 1676); Marie (n 1677); Anne (n 1679); Pierre (n 1681).  There is no mention of Mart
2 CONC in Aucion.
2 CONT "Mothers of Acadia" (filed L-14-16) shows the following:  Marie Gaudet (#1986), daughter of Denis (#1983) and Martine Gauthier (#1984), became by her marriage to Olivier Daigle, the grandmother of a numerous family.  Alexander Dai
2 CONC gle died at 101 in 1902 at St Charles de Kent.  Bishop Robichaud of Moncton was also a distant relative of Marie Gaudet (#1986).
2 CONT <http://www.genealogie.com/dgaa/index.html> Add'l info (copy filed L-14-16).
2 CONT <http:www.geocities.com/Heartland/Pointe/6106/genealogy-gaudet.html>
2 CONT See #2005 for more on the Gaudet Genealogy.
2 CONT Durocher/Ferguson Genealogy on internet (copy filed L-14-8).
2 CONT Hebert Genealogy from the internet (copy filed L-14-8) shows her married 1666 to Olivier (aka Daigre) Daigle at Port Royal, Acadia, Canada; also shows family of 10 children; remarried 1685 to Jean (aka Fredelle) Fardel at Port Roy
2 CONC al, Acadia, Canada; no children.
2 CONT <http://jason.gaudet.com/gaudet/gaudet_gen2a.htm>. (copy filed L-14-8).
2 CONT "Histoire et Généalogie des Acadiens"-Arsenault pg 407.
2 CONT ------------------------------------------------
2 CONT The following was acquired from <http://www.acadian-home.org/ancestorsacadian.html>:
2 CONT
2 CONT OLIVIER  DAIGLE
2 CONT
2 CONT The Daigle family in Acadia is rooted in Olivier Daigre, born in France about 1643. He married in Port-Royal about 1666 to Marie Gaudet, daughter of Denis Gaudet and Martine Gauthier. Of their seven sons, only two became founders 
2 CONC of families.
2 CONT ------------------------------------------------
1 NOTE Married before 1666 Martin Aucion [#3428] (son of Martin & Marie Salle) at Port Royal, Acadia; source <http://pages.infinit.net/alber/dat18.htm> (copy filed L-14-8); "Genealogie de l'ancienne Acadie"  -- from the internet.
2 CONT 14 children are listed of this marriage. also, date of marriage (which is based on the estimated birth date of first child is probably 7-10 years off).  Source: "Généalogie de L'ancienne Acadie".
2 CONT To further complicate matters, the 1671 Acadian Census shows that she had a sister named MARIE who was 7 yrs. older.  This sister's record also shows her has married to Martin Aucion in 1677? See message lines of #1986.
2 CONT The 1671 census of Acadia shows her age 14; census filed with censuses.
2 CONT 1686 Census of Port Royal shows family as follows: Martin AUCOIN 35, Marie GAUDET 27; children: Martin 12, Marie10, Michel 9, Isabelle 7, Louis 6, Agnesse 4, Alexis 3, Cecille 7 months; 1 gun, 15 cattle, 10 sheep, 6 hogs.
2 CONT <http://geocities.com/ronald_gaudet2001/wga7.html> (copy filed L-14-8).
2 CONT <http://www.genealogie.com/dgaa/index.html> Add'l info (copy filed L-14-16).
2 CONT <http:www.geocities.com/Heartland/Pointe/6106/genealogy-gaudet.html>.
2 CONT See #2005 for more on the Gaudet Genealogy.
2 CONT Durocher/Ferguson Genealogy on internet (copy filed L-14-8) shows her with 17 children.
2 CONT Hebert Genealogy from the internet (copy filed L-14-8) shows that she married 1673 Martin Aucion at Port Royal, Acadia, Canada; also lists family of 19 children.
2 CONT <http://pages.infinit.net/alber/dat18.htm> (copy filed L-14-8).
2 CONT "Histoire et Généalogie des Acadiens"-Arsenault pg 407.
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------
2 CONT 16. v. MARIE GAUDET, b. Abt. 1657.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. MARIE2 GAUDET (JEAN1) was born Abt. 1633, and died 30 July 1710 in Port-Royal , Acadia. She married (1) ÉTIENNE HÉBERT Abt. 1650 in Port-Royal, Acadia. He was born 1629, and died Bet. 1669 - 1671 in Dec. BIM. She married (2) DO
2 CONC MINIQUE GAREAU Abt. 1676 in Port-Royal, Acadia. He was born Abt. 1626, and died Bef. 1698 in Port-Royal , Acadia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MARIE GAUDET and ÉTIENNE HÉBERT are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 17. i. MARIE3 HÉBERT, b. Abt. 1651; d. Bet. 1677 - 1678, Port-Royal , Acadia.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. MARGUERITE HÉBERT, b. Abt. 1652, Port-Royal , Acadia; d. Aft. 30 January 1714/15, Pisiguit, Acadia; m. JACQUES (JEAN-JACQUES) LEPRINCE(PRINCE), Abt. 1671.
2 CONT
2 CONT 18. iii. EMMANUEL HÉBERT, b. Abt. 1653, Port-Royal , Acadia; d. 30 November 1744, Grand-Pré, Kings, Nova Scotia, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT 19. iv. ÉTIENNE HÉBERT, b. Abt. 1654; d. 02 November 1713, Grand-Pré, Kings, Nova Scotia, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT v. CATHERINE HÉBERT, b. Abt. 1662; d. 03 August 1727, Louisbourg, Cape Breton; m. PHILIPPE PINET, Bef. 1678.
2 CONT
2 CONT 20. vi. ANTOINE HÉBERT, b. Abt. 1670; d. Bef. 31 July 1753.
2 CONT
2 CONT 21. vii. MARTINE HÉBERT, b. Abt. 1665; d. L'Assomption, Pisiguit, Acadia.
2 CONT
2 CONT 22. viii. FRANÇOISE HÉBERT, b. Abt. 1661; d. 17 February 1712/13, Port-Royal , Acadia.
2 CONT
2 CONT 23. ix. MICHEL HÉBERT, b. Abt. 1666; d. 19 January 1735/36, Grand-Pré, Kings, Nova Scotia, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT 24. x. JEAN HÉBERT, b. Abt. 1659.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of MARIE GAUDET and DOMINIQUE GAREAU is:
2 CONT
2 CONT xi. MARIE3 GAREAU, b. Abt. 1677; m. (1) --- LACHAPELLE, Abt. 1693; m. (2) JÉRME DAROIS, Bet. 1755 - 1756, Virginia, U.S.A.
