2 CONT Martin Aucoin-[593] 1
2 CONT Born: 1651, La Rochelle, France 222
2 CONT Married: Abt 1672, Port Royal, Acadia 222
2 CONT Died: 11 May 1711, Saint Charles Des Mines, Acadia 222
2 CONT Buried: 11 May 1711, Saint Charles Des Mines, Acadia 222
2 CONT
2 CONT Martin married Marie Jeanne Gaudet-[592] [MRIN:431], daughter of Denis Gaudet-[582] and Anne Martine Gauthier-[583], about 1672 in Port Royal, Acadia.222 (Marie Jeanne Gaudet-[592] was born in 1657 in Port Royal, Acadia 150 and di
2 CONC ed after 1699 in Riviere Aux Canards, Acadia 8,48.
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------
2 CONT The following was acquired from <http://newsarch.rootsweb.com/th/read/ACADIAN-CAJUN/1998-12/0912645156>:
2 CONT
2 CONT ACADIAN-CAJUN-L Archives
2 CONT
2 CONT From: <LucieMC@aol.com>
2 CONT Subject: Martin Aucoin & Marie Gaudet's children
2 CONT Date: Wed, 2 Dec 1998 19:32:36 EST
2 CONT
2 CONT The Chidren of Martin Aucoin & Marie Gaudet (son of Martin & Marie Sallé):
2 CONT
2 CONT This information comes from the Bergeron Books ...
2 CONT
2 CONT Martin b 1674 married Grand Pre abt 1700 Catherine Teriot daugther of Germain
2 CONT and Andée Brun
2 CONT
2 CONT Michel 1677 married Riviere-aux-Canards abt 1701 Jeanne Bourg(bourque)
2 CONT daugther of Martin + Marie Potet
2 CONT
2 CONT Louise 1682 + François Gautrot (Gautereau) son of Claude and Marie Terriot abt
2 CONT 1703.  NOTE: The family group sheet of Claude Gautrot and Marie Terriot was acquired from <http://www.terriau.org/archive/d3.htm> and a copy is filed in L-14-30.
2 CONT
2 CONT alexis 1683 + Cobequid about 1707 to Anne-Marie Bourg daughter of Martin and
2 CONT Marie Petit-Potet
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes 1684 + Port-Royal abt 1705 to Claude Terriot sond of Claude and Marie
2 CONT Gauterot
2 CONT Anne-Marie 1687 + Port-Royal ll/25/l706 to Pierre Thibodeau son of Pierre +
2 CONT Jeanne Terriot
2 CONT
2 CONT Pierre 1689 +Grand-Pre abt 1713 to Elisabeth Barault daughter of Vincent + M.
2 CONT Bourg
2 CONT
2 CONT Pierre 1689 - 2nd marriage Grand Pre August 1, 1713 to Catherine Comeau
2 CONT
2 CONT Antoine 1693 + Grand Pre ll/20/1713 to Anne Brault daughter of Pierre + marie
2 CONT Bourgeois
2 CONT
2 CONT René 1695 + abt 1715 to Madeleine Bourg daughter of Martin + Marie Potet
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph 1697 Grand Pre abt 1720 Anne Trahan daughter of Jean and Marie Boudrot
2 CONT
2 CONT Jean 1698 + Port Royal abt 1722 to Marguerite Pitre daughter of ?Claude + Marie Comeau
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles 1705 + Grand pre 1/28/1726 to Anne Marie Dupuis daughter of Martin _ Marie Landry
2 CONT
2 CONT Other children:  Isabelle 1678 - Louis 1680 - Paul 1690 - Catherine 1692
2 CONT
2 CONT That's it.. I think that when Stephen white's books come out, that Marie Potet will probably change. but I wouldn't worry about it for now.. basically, the information is correct.. ENJOY!!! Lucie
2 CONT
2 CONT Lucie LeBlanc Consentino
2 CONT http://www.geocities.com/Heartland/Pointe/6106
2 CONT Our Acadian & French Canadian Ancestral Home
2 CONT ------------------------------------------------
