2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Martin (b. 1651, Port Royal) m. 1671 Marie GAUDET (Denis & Martine GAUTHIER)
2 CONT a. Martin (b. 1674) m. 1700 Catherine TERRIOT (Germain & Andree BRUN)
2 CONT b. Michel (b. 1677) m.1701 Jeanne BOURG (Martin & Marie POTET)
2 CONT c. Isabelle (b. 1678)
2 CONT d. Louis (b. 1680)
2 CONT e. Louise (b. 1682) m. Francois GAUTROT (Claude & Marie TERRIOT)
2 CONT f. Alexis (b. 1683) m. 1707 Anne Marie BOURG (Martin & Marie POTET)
2 CONT g. Agnes (b. 1684) 1705 Claude TERRIOT (Claude & Marie GAUTEROT)
2 CONT h. Anne Marie (b. 1687) m. 26 Nov 1706 Pierre THIBODEAU (Pierre & Jeanne TERRIOT)
2 CONT i. Pierre (b. 1689) m1. 1713 Marie Elisabeth BREAU (Vincent & Marie BOURG)
2 CONT m2. 1 Aug 1718 Catherine COMEAU
2 CONT j. Paul (b. 1690)
2 CONT k. Catherine (b. 1692)
2 CONT l. Antoine (b. 1693) m. 20 Nov 1713 Anne BRAULT (Pierre & Marie BOURGEOIS)
2 CONT m. Rene (b. 1695) m. 1715 Madeleine BOURG (Martin & Marie POTET)
2 CONT n. Joseph (b. 1697) m. 1720 Anne TRAHAN (Jean & Marie BOUDROT)
2 CONT o. Jean (b. 1698) m. 1722 Marguerite PITRE (Claude & Marie COMEAU)
2 CONT p. Charles (b. 1705) m. 28 Jan 1726 Anne Marie DUPUIS (Martin & Marie LANDRY)
