2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Support for parents of Joseph Aucoin
2 CONT I'm looking for any evidence that the parents of the Joseph Aucoin b.c. 1698 who married Anne Traban was the son of Martin Aucoin and Marie Gaudet. I've looked at all the censuses available at http://www.acadian-home.org/ through 
2 CONC 1750 and the only thing I find is Joseph Aucoin b.c. 1696 in the 1700 Port Royal census as shown below:
2 CONT François AUCOIN 35 [1665]; Madelaine BELINEAUX [Belliveau] (wife) 23 [1677] ; Jean 6 [1694]; Joseph 4 [1696]; Madelaine 2 [1698]; 18 cattle, 14 sheep, 25 arpents, 1 gun.
