2 CONT Stephen A. White writes: (Stephen A. White, historian and genealogistwith the Centre d'etudes Acadiennes at the University of Moncton in Moncton, NewBrunswick.) The marriage of Martin Aucoin and MarieSalle took place on 20 Jan. 16
2 CONC 32at St.Barthelemy de La Rochelle in France. One child was born to thiscouple, one Jean, baptised at the same place 15 Nov. 1632, and lists MartinAucoin as probaby the son of this couple, based on the notes of PereGallant(from and
2 CONC  article on the Aucoin family in the Cahiers de la Societe Historique Acadienne, vol IV, 1972.) Michelle Aucoin and Jeanne Aucoin, married to Michel Boudrot and Francois Giruard respectively, can be shown to besisters, from dispen
2 CONC sations, but they cannot be shown to be related to MartinAucoin.
