2 CONT Jeanne died at Port-Royal on 7 December 1726, aged 87 years and was buried there the next day.≤ref>Nova Scotia Archives, "An Acadian Parish Remembered - The Registers of St. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755," register RG 
2 CONC 1 volume 26 page 365; online database with images;https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=1583≤/ref>≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-18
