2 CONT == Biography == 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''NOTICE''': this profile is protected by the [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Project:Acadians Acadian Project] because of frequent duplication, variant name spelling,  attempts to add unsourced parents or is an historically impor
2 CONC tant person - matriarch of Acadian Thibodeau family, and is among the Top 100 most highly viewed Acadian profiles. Please contact the Acadian Project before making any substantive changes. Thanks for helping make WikiTree the best
2 CONC  site for accurate information.
2 CONT Jeanne Thériot is the ancestral matriarch of the Acadian Thibodeau family.
2 CONT Jeanne was born about 1643 to parents Jean Thériot and Perrine Reau.≤ref name=DGFA>"Dictionnaire Généalogique des Familles Acadiennes"; Stephen A. White; 2 vols., Moncton, New Brunswick: Centre d'Études Acadiennes, 1999. pp. 1483-
2 CONC 1484 & 1508-1511≤/ref> The family arrived in Acadia before 1650, but it is not clear where Jeanne was born.
2 CONT Around 1660 Jeanne married Pierre Thibodeau,≤ref name=DGFA/> in Port Royal Acadia≤ref name=mass/> (Annapolis Royal, Nova Scotia, Canada). Pierre was a founder of [[Space:Chipoudy, Acadie|Chipoudy]]≤ref name=Clark> Clark, Andrew Hi
2 CONC ll, Acadia; the geography of early nova Scotia to 1760. Madison:  University of Wisconsin Press, 1968. p145 (Thibodeau founder of Chipoudy-Shepody)≤/ref>Between 1661 and 1689, the couple had16 children: ≤ref name=DGFA/> The list i
2 CONC s in WT-ID order, not birth order.
