1 NOTE [b556.FTW]
2 CONT
2 CONT ALTERNATE NAME SPELLING
2 CONT Theriot - Terriault
1 NOTE Jeanne Theriot (Jean) was born 1644 in Port Royal, Acadia
2 CONT (Source: Acadian Descendants, Vol I, by Janet Jehn), and died
2 CONT December 08, 1726 in Port Royal, Acadia (Source: c-smith.ged).
2 CONT She married Pierre Thibodeau Abt 1660 in Port Royal, Acadia
2 CONT (Source: Stephen White, University de Mocton, LA SOCIETÉ
2 CONT HISTORIQUE ACADIENNE). Children of Jeanne Theriot and Pierre
2 CONT Thibodeau are:
2 CONT Marie Thibodeau, born Abt 1660 in Port Royal, Acadia; died Abt
2 CONT 1710 in Boston, MA. Marie Thibodeau, born 1663 in Port Royal,
2 CONT Acadia. Anne Marie Thibodeau, born 1665 in Port Royal, Acadia;
2 CONT died 1700 in St. Charles de Mines, Acadia. Catherine Thibodeau,
2 CONT born Abt 1667 in Port Royal, Acadia; died 1724 in Grand Pre,
2 CONT Acadia. Pierre Thibodeau, born 1670 in Port Royal, Acadia; died
2 CONT 1700. Jeanne Thibodeau, born Abt 1672 in Acadia, Canada. Jean
2 CONT Thibodeau, born 1673 in Port Royal, Acadia; died December 1746
2 CONT in Riv. aux Canards, Acadia. 32 viii. Antoine Thibodeau, born
2 CONT Abt 1674 in Acadia (Source: p-hall.ged). Pierre Thibodeau, born
2 CONT 1676 in Port Royal, Acadia (Source: p-hall.ged); died Abt 1734
2 CONT in Hopewell Hill, Canada (Source: w-boudre.ged). He married
2 CONT Marie Anne Aucoin 1706 in Port Royal, Acadia (Source: Denis
2 CONT Beauregard Homepage). Michel Thibodeau, born Abt 1678 in Acadia
2 CONT (Source: p-hall.ged); died December 24, 1734 in Port Royal,
2 CONT Acadia (Source: p-hall.ged). Cecile Thibodeau, born Abt 1680 in
2 CONT Port Royal, Acadia (Source: p-hall.ged). Anne Marie Thibodeau,
2 CONT born Abt 1682 in Acadia, Canada. Claude Thibodeau, born 1684 in
2 CONT Port Royal, Acadia (Source: p-hall.ged). Catherine Josephe
2 CONT Thibodeau, born 1686 in Port Royal, Acadia.
