2 CONC  12, Pierre 10, Michel 8, Cecille 6, Anne Marie 4, Claude 2.≤/blockquote>≤/ref> 1686,≤ref>Tim Hebert; Transcription of the 1686 Acadian Census, at Port-Royal, Acadie [http://freepages.rootsweb.com/~acadiancajun/genealogy/1686cens.
