2 CONC ream from river. Built grist mill and saw mill. In 1698 (at 68) he founded coony of Chipoudy- with 5 sons. Pierre and Jeanne had 16 children and 159 grandchildren. Many found way to Louisiana- Bayou Lafourche, Opelousas and Attaka
2 CONC pas Founder of Thibodeaux Village in Port Royal area of Annapolis River. Born in France 1631, married at Port Royal to Jeanne Terriot; he died in Dec 1704 leaving 14 children. Son Blaise and his wife Catherine Daigle in Poiton pro
