1 NOTE In this line there are often siblings with the same name.  One inference might be that later siblings might be given the name of earlier children who died.  As an example the first three children of Pierre and Jeanne Thibodeau are
2 CONC  all named Marie.  Since we have no further information the most likely interpitation is that the first two died as infants.
