2 CONT Marie Thibodeau born abt 1661. In 1681 married Antoine Landry born 1660(son o Rene Landry and Marie Marguerite Bernard. They had 11 children. Source: Le Grand Rassemblement Famille Thibodeau - 20 August 1994 MARIE MARGUERITE THIBO
2 CONC DEAU (Pierre,MATHURIN RHIBAUDA) was born 1661 in Port Royal, Acadia, and died 1711 in Boston,Massachussetts. She married Antoine Landry 1681 in Grand Pre, Acadia, son of RENE LANDRY and MARIEBERNARD. Children of MARIE THIBODEAU an
2 CONC d ANTOINE LANDRY are: MARIE MARGUERITE5 LANDRY, born September 04, 1682 in GRAND PRE, ACADIA;died 1733 in TRURO, NOVA SCOTIA, ACADIA. She married JEAN HEBERT 1702 in COBEQUID,ACADIA. ANTOINE LANDRY, born December 04, 1683 in GRAND
2 CONC  PRE,ACADIA; died 1756 inMASSACHUSETTS. ELIZABETH LANDRY, born June 02, 1685. She married Etienne LeBlanc 1734. ANNE LANDRY, born 1688. She married ANTOINE LEBLANC 1719. MARGUERITE LANDRY, born 1689 in PORT ROYAL,ACADIA; died 1765
2 CONC . PIERRE LANDRY, bom 1690 in GRAND PRE, ACADIA. FRANCOIS LANDRY, bom 1692 in GRAND PRE, ACADIA; died April 21, 1767 inASSUMPTION, LOUISIANA. FRANCOISE LANDRY, born 1692 in GRAND PRE, ACADIA. JEAN LANDRY, born 1698. JOSEPH LANDRY, 
