2 CONT :: Jean                      13
2 CONT :: Antoine                   12
2 CONT :: Pierre                    10
2 CONT :: Michel                     8
2 CONT :: Cecille                    6
2 CONT :: Anne Marie                 4
2 CONT :: Claude                     2
2 CONT :Also: '''1686''',  Port La Hève, there is a Marie TIBAUDEAU, age 25 years, living with her husband Pierre LE JEUNE dit Briar.
2 CONT
2 CONT :CENSUS: '''1693''', Port Royal, Acadia, age 30 years:Pierre TIBAUDEAU 59, Jeanne TERRIOT 50, Anthoine 17, Pierre 15, Michel 13, Cecille 11, Marie 10, Claude 8, Catherine Josephe 7, Charles 4; 20 cattle, 30 sheep, 12 pigs, 30 arpe
2 CONC nts, 2 guns
2 CONT
2 CONT :CENSUS: '''1698''', Port Royal, Acadia, age 37 years (sic).:Pierre TIBAUDEAU 65; Jeanne TERRIOT (wife) 57; Jean 24; Antoine 22; Pierre 21; Michelle 19; Claude 13; Catherine 11; Charles 7; 20 cattle, 20 sheep, 8 hogs, 32 arpents, 
2 CONC 20 fruit trees, 4 guns
2 CONT
2 CONT :CENSUS: '''1700''', age 37 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT :CENSUS: '''1701''', age 34 years (sic).
2 CONT
2 CONT :CENSUS: '''1708''', La Hève, Acadia, age 46 years.
