2 CONT Anne Marie Catherine Thibodeau (1665-1700) was born in Port Royal, the daughter of Pierre Thibodeaux and Jeanne Terriot.  She was about 17 when she married Claude, and had nine children.  She died at the age of 35, and was buried 
2 CONC in St.-Charles des Mines, (Acadia). 
2 CONT --------------------
