2 CONT MARIE ANNE THIBODEAU (PIERRE, MATHURIN RHIBAUDA) was born 1665 in PORTROYAL, ACADIA, and died Abt. 1699 in ACADIA. She married CLAUDE BOUDROT 1685 in GrandPre, Acadia, son of MICHEL BOUDREAU and MICHELLE AUCOIN. Children of MARIE 
2 CONC THIBODEAU and CLAUDE BOUDROT are: CLAUDE5 BOUDROT, born 1686 in ACADIA. MICHEL BOUDROT, born 1687 in PORT ROYAL, ACADIA. JACQUES BOUDROT, born 1688 in PORT ROYAL, ACADIA.FRANCOISE BOUDROT, born 1690 in GRAND PRE, ACADIA. MAGDELEIN
2 CONC E BOUDROT, born 1692. JOSEPH BOUDROT, born 1693 in PORT ROYAL, ACADIA. MARIE BOUDROT, born 1693; died 1767. She married RENE HEBERT 1707 inGrand Pre, Acadia. ANNE BOUDROT, born 1694 in PORT ROYAL, ACADIA. MARGUERITE BOUDROT, born 
2 CONC 1695 in Grand Pre, Acadia. ELISABETH BOUDROT, born 1698. She married ETIENNE LEBLANC 1734.
