2 CONT [[Category: Port-Royal, Acadie]]
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT :Pierre Thibodeau (the elder) was born around 1670 to parents Pierre Thibodeau and Jeanne Theriot. (Note, he had a brother Pierre the younger.) Pierre lived at Port-Royal Acadia (Annapolis Royal, Nova Scotia, Canada) with his fami
2 CONC ly. ≤ref name="DGFA">"Dictionnaire Généalogique des Familles Acadiennes"; Stephen A. White; 2 vols., Moncton, New Brunswick: Centre d'Études Acadiennes, 1999; p. 1508-1513≤/ref>
2 CONT :Around 1690 Pierre married Anne-Marie Bourg, daughter of Jean Bourg and Marguerite Martin. By 1693, they had settled at the Riviere Ste-Croix, in [http://www.acadian-cajun.com/pisiguit.htm Pisiquit]. Pierre and Anne-Marie had 12 
2 CONC children. :Pierre died in l'Assomption de Pisiquit(Windsor, Nova Scotia, Canada) after 2 Oct 1719 as Pierre was the first to sign the marriage record of his son Pierre TIBODEAU with Marie Joseph BOUDROT at Grand Pré on that date. 
2 CONC ≤ref name="DGFA"/> ≤ref>"La généalogie des trente-sept familles hôtesses des ‘Retrouvailles 94"; WHITE, Stephen A.; Les Cahiers de la Société historique acadienne, vol. 25, nos 2 et 3 (1994) [http://www.umoncton.ca/umcm-ceaac/node
2 CONC /55 Genealogy of 37 Families]≤/ref>
2 CONT :[https://gw.geneanet.org/katheriot?lang=en&pz=frederick+joseph&nz=theriot&ocz=1&p=pierre+l+aine&n=thibodeau Children]
2 CONT # Anne Marie THIBODEAU b: Abt 1691 in Pisiguit, Acadia
2 CONT # Philippe THIBODEAU b: Abt 1693 in Acadia
2 CONT # Alexandre THIBODEAU b: Abt 1694 in Acadia
2 CONT # Pierre THIBODEAU b: Abt 1697 in Acadia# Antoine THIBODEAU b: Abt 1699 in Village-des-Thibodeau, Pisiguit, Acadia 
2 CONT # Joseph THIBODEAU b: Abt 1700 in Acadia
2 CONT # Jean Baptiste (dit La Croix) THIBODEAU b: Abt 1702 in Acadia
2 CONT # Angelique Pelagie THIBODEAU b: Abt 1704 in Acadia
2 CONT # Rene (dit CASTIN) THIBODEAU b: Abt 1706 in Acadia# Francoise THIBODEAU b: 26 Sep 1708 in Acadia c: 29 Sep 1708 in GrandPré, Acadia
2 CONT # Elisabeth THIBODEAU b: Abt 1710 in Acadia
2 CONT # Marie THIBODEAU b: Abt 1712 iin Acadia
2 CONT
2 CONT == Recensements/Censuses ==
2 CONT :'''Transcriptions of the Censuses''':::[http://freepages.rootsweb.com/~acadiancajun/genealogy/genac1.htm Tim Hebert]
2 CONT ::[http://www.acadian-home.org Acadian & French Canadian Ancestral Home"; 2005 – Present, hosted by Lucie LeBlanc Consentino] [http://www.acadian-home.org/frames Census Records]
2 CONT
2 CONT :'''Scans of official transcriptions''':::[http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c2572/2?r=0&s=4 Official Census Scans]
2 CONT ----* 1671 Acadian Census at Port Royal: Pierre THIBEAUDEAU, 40, wife Jeanne TERRIAU 27; Children: '''Pierre 1''', Marie 10, Marie 9, Marie 7, Anne Marie 6, Catherine 4; cattle 12, sheep 11.
2 CONT * 1678 Acadian Census at Port Royal: Pierre Thibaudeau & Jeanne Terriot-12 acres   30 cattle. 3 boys: '''age 11- born 1669''', 7-1671, 5-1673; 5 girls: age 12-born 1666, 8-1670, 4-1674, 3-1675, 1-1677
2 CONT * 1686 Acadian Census at Port Royal: Pierre TIBAUDEAU 55, Jeanne TERIOT 43, Marie 25, Marie 23, Marie 21, Catherine 19, Anne Marie 17, '''Pierre 16''', Jeanne 14, Jean 13, Antoine  12, Pierre 10, Michel 8, Cecille 6, Anne Marie 4,
2 CONC  Claude 2.
2 CONT *[http://www.acadian-home.org/census1693.html 1693 Acadian census] at Les Mines: '''Pierre TIBAUDEAU''' 25, Anne BOURG his wife 28, Anne Marie 2, Philippes 3 months; 9 cattle, 5 sheep, 4 hogs, 6 arpents, 1 gun.
2 CONT *[http://www.acadian-home.org/census1701.html 1701 Acadian census] at Rviere St Croix, Les Mines: '''Pierre THIBEAUDOT''' [Thibodeau], his wife, 5 boys, 1 girl, 11 cattle, 7 sheep, 2 hogs, 1 gun.
2 CONT *[http://www.acadian-home.org/census1703.html 1703 Acadian census] at Les Mines:  '''Pierre THIBODAU''', his wife, 6 boys, 1 girl, 1 arms bearer.
2 CONT *[http://www.acadian-home.org/census1707.html 1707 Acadian census] at Les Mines: '''Pierre THIBEAUDEAU''' his wife, 2 boys 14 or older, 3 younger boys, 1 girl 12 or older, 1 younger girl; 5 arpents, 12 cattle, 8 sheep, 10 hogs.
2 CONT *[http://www.acadian-home.org/census1714.html 1714 Acadian census] at La Riviere Pisiguit: '''Pierre TIBODEAU''' and his wife, 7 sons, 3 daughters.
