2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT
2 CONT :Jeanne Thibodeau was born about 1672 Port Royal, Acadia. (DGFA)
2 CONT :≤ref> Source: [[#S69]] Title:  1686 Port Royal Census ≤/ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT :She married Mathieu de GOUTIN Abt 1689 Acadie
2 CONT
2 CONT :CENSUS: 1678, Port Royal, Acadia, age 1 year (sic).
2 CONT
2 CONT :CENSUS: 1686, Port Royal, Acadia, age 14 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT :CENSUS: 1693, age 21 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==*White, Stephen A., Patrice Gallant, and Hector-J Hébert. [[Space:Dictionnaire_généalogique_des_familles_acadiennes|''Dictionnaire Généalogique Des Familles Acadiennes.'']] Moncton, N.-B.: Centre D'étudesAcadiennes, U
2 CONC niversité De Moncton, 1999, Print, p1508-1511.::p. 756. She died/was buried ( Louisbourg Register) on 7/8 Apr 1741, at age 72 years. 
2 CONT :: No place given for marriage.::Text: "De Goutin came to Acadia in 1688, and soon married, in the words of Governor Des FRICHES de Meneval, 'foolishly, a peasant's daughter,' Jeanne Tibaudeau, the daughter of Pierre TIBAUDEAU and
2 CONC  Jeanne Terriot."
