2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT [[Category: Port-Royal, Acadie]]
2 CONT == Biography ==:'''Jean Thibodeau''', born in Port Royal, Acadie, to Pierre Thibodeauand Jeanne Theriault. He died 9 Dec 1746 and was buried at the cemetery of St. Charles at Grand-Pré.≤ref>"Catholic Church Records", vol. 1a: Acad
2 CONC ian Records, 1707-1748.  Author: Diocese of Baton Rouge.  Publication: Diocese, 1999; The Registers of St. Charles aux Mines in Acadia, from Grand Pré, carried into exile to St. Gabriel Church of Iberville, LA.  p. 190. :Text: "Je
2 CONC an TIBAUDAU, age ca. 74, died 9 Dec 1746, buried in the cemetery of the parish of St. Charles. Witnesses: J. DUGAS [signed]; Jacques TERRIOT [signed]; Pierre LANDRY [signed]; Joseph LE BLANC; Rene BLANCHAR [signed]; Antoine CELEST
2 CONC IN [signed] (SGA-3, 40b-41a)."≤/ref>
2 CONT :Jean married Marguerite Hebert on 02/07/1703 (Jean Thibodeau according to SA White, married February 7 1703 (not 17) (F & A, II, 1513) (Richard MacDonough)) in Port-Royal, Acadie.  The discrepancy in marriage dates occurs because
2 CONC  the Ottawa copy of Port Royal records indicates they were married the 17th, while the original parish records at the Parish of  St-Jean-Baptiste spells out the date as "septieme" or 7th.≤ref>Personal knowledge of [[Friebel-7|Donn
2 CONC a Storz]] who has seen images of both documents.≤/ref>≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-1870 (image 113) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_r
2 CONC eel_c1869/113?r=0&s=5≤/ref>≤ref>The Registers of St. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755, [https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=1182 Entry for Marriage of Jean Tibodau and Marguerite Hebert], accessed 9 Apr
2 CONC  2016.
2 CONT :Jean Tibodau and Marguerite Hebert
2 CONT :Register	RG 1 Vol. 26 p.265 
2 CONT :Priest	Felix Pain 
2 CONT :Registration Date	7 February 1703 
2 CONT ::'''Groom	Jean Tibodau'''
2 CONT ::Father	Pierre Tibodau
2 CONT ::Mother	Jeanne Terriot
2 CONT
2 CONT ::'''Bride	Marguerite Hebert'''
2 CONT ::Father	Manuel Hebert
2 CONT ::Mother	Andrée Brun::Witnesses	Michelle Tibaudeaux≤/ref>≤ref>"Dictionnaire Généalogiquedes Familles Acadiennes";  Stephen A. White. 2 vols.; Centre d'Études Acadiennes,  Moncton, New Brunswick; 1999. pp. 1509 & 1513.  :Text: "Mar
2 CONC ried 7 Feb 1703 (Register Port Royal). Witnesses: Michel THIBODEAU; MOUSSAIRE (who have signed with the groom); Claude GIROUARD; Emmanuel HÉBERT. (Also recorded in Tanguay, vol. VII , p.290.)"≤/ref>
2 CONT
