2 CONT ==Biography ==Antoine Thibodeau was born about 1676. He was the son of [[Thibodeau-30|Pierre Thibodeau]] and[[Thériot-100|Jeanne Thériot]]. He married Marie Prijan, daughter of Jean Prijan and Andrée Savoy 8 October 1703 at Port R
2 CONC oyal.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-1870 (image 114) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1869/114?r=0&s=5≤/ref>≤ref>An Acadian Parish
