2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Michel THIBODEAUX was born about 1678 in Port Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia. He died on 24 Nov 1734 in Port Royal, Acadia. He was buried on 24 Nov 1734 in Port Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia. He was baptized into the LDS church on 
2 CONC 8 Aug 1969. He was endowed on 9 Sep 1969. He was sealed to parents on 21 Oct 1970 in the St. George, Utah LDS temple. He has reference number FZH4-QB. !BIRTH:Was 8 on the 1686 Census of Port Royal 
2 CONT
2 CONT !MARRIAGE:See notes 
2 CONT
2 CONT DEATH: 
2 CONT
2 CONT BURIAL: 
2 CONT
2 CONT !NOTES:"St Martin Parish History" found on pp. 32(d) & (e) of Vic Jeter's book He was married to Agnes DUGAS on 13 Nov 1704 in Port Royal, Acadia, Nova Scotia, Canada.
2 CONT
