2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT !INFORMATION: was taken from Historire ET Généalogie Des Acadiens by Bona ARSENAULT, Tome1 page 518. THIBAUDEAU et THIBODAUX aussi: THIBODEAU, THIBODEAUX. Pierre THIBODEAU, [Il était meunier à la PréeRonde dans le haut de la ríviè
2 CONC re Port-Royal En 1698, il fonda Chipoudy (Hopewell, N.-B.] né en 1631, originaire du Poitou, arrivé en Acadie avec Emmanuel LeBorgne de Belle-Isle, en 1654, marié vers 1660, à Jeanne TERRIOT, fille de Jean et de Perrine Bourg. ENF
2 CONC ANTS: Marie 1661; Marie 1662; Marie 1664; Anne-Marie 1665; Catherine 1667; Pierre 1670; Jeanne 1672; Jean 1673; Antoine 1674; Pierre 1676; Michel 1678; Cécile 1780; Anne-Marie 1682; Claude 1684; Joseph 1691; Charles 1694. Pierre T
2 CONC HIBODEAU a été inhumé à Port-Royal, le 26 Décembre 1704. Jeanne TERRIOT, sa veuve, a été inhuimé au même endroit, le 8 Décembre 1726.
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT MICHEL THIBODEAU (PIERRE, MATHUR1N RHIBauda)was born 1678 in PORT ROYAL,ACADIA, and died November 24, 1734 in PORT ROYAL,ACADIA. He married AGNES DUGASNovember 13, 1704 in PORT ROYAL, ACADIA,daughter of CLAUDE and FRANCOIS BOURGEO
2 CONC IS. Children of MICHEL THIBODEAU and AGNES DUGAS are: MARGUERITE5 THIBODEAU, born December 22, 1705 in PORT ROYAL, ACADIA; diedSeptember 04, 1765 in ST. MARTINVILLE, LOUISIANA. AGNES TH1BODEAU, born November 19, 1706 in PORT ROYAL
2 CONC , ACADIA. MICHEL THIBODEAU, born May 02, 1708 in PORT ROYAL,ACADIA. PIERRE THIBODEAU, born January 04, 1709/10 in PORT ROYAL, NOVA SCOTIA. JOSEPH THIBODEAU, born February 16, 1710/11 in PORT ROYAL, NOVA SCOTIA. MARIE MADELEINE THI
2 CONC BODEAU, born October 16, 1714. She married CHARLESGIROUARD May 06, 1739 in PORT ROYAL. MARIE JOSEPHE THIBODEAU, born April 26, 1716 in PORT ROYAL, ACADIA; diedin CH1POUDY, ACADIA. She married PIERRE MARTIN August 10, 1744 in PORT 
2 CONC ROYAL. ELIZABETH THIBODEAU, born June 03, 1718 in PORT ROYAL, ACADIA. ShemarriedJOSEPH BREAU Abt. 1738. JEAN BAPTISTE THIBODEAU, born October 17, 1723 in PORT ROYAL, NOVASCOTIA. AMAND GREGOIRE THIBODEAU, born December 16, 1724;die
2 CONC d Abt. 1740. CHARLES THIBODEAUX, born May 27, 1713 in PORT ROYAL,NOVA SCOTIA; diedAbt. 1762. FRANCOIS THIBODEAU, born February 11, 1719/20 in PORT ROYAL, ACADIA. CLAIRE THIBODEAU, born March 29, 1726. She married OLIVIER AUCOINNov
2 CONC ember 05, 1748 in PORT ROYAL. BENJAMIN THIBODEAU, born September 21, 1721 in PORT ROYAL, ACADIA.
