2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT [[Category: Port-Royal, Acadie]]
2 CONT == Biography ==Anne-Marie Thibodeau was born in 1682 in Port Royal, Acadie, Nouvelle-France. Her parents were [[Thibodeau-30|Pierre Thibodeau]] and [[Thériot-100|Jeanne Thériot]].   She was the fifth girl in this family with the n
2 CONC ame Marie and the second to be named Anne Marie.≤ref name=White>White, Stephen A., Patrice Gallant, and Hector-J Hébert. [[Space:Dictionnaire_généalogique_des_familles_acadiennes|''Dictionnaire Généalogique Des Familles Acadiennes
2 CONC .'']] Moncton, N.-B.: Centre D'étudesAcadiennes, Université De Moncton, 1999, Print, p1508-1511. ::She married around age 15 to Charles D'AMOURS, who was about 35; they had ten children from 1698 to 1716.≤blockquote>Anne-Marie [th
2 CONC e 2nd of this name in the family, 1st born around 1666], born around 1682. [sic] ≤/blockquote>More likely born around 1683, given spacing of children?≤/ref>
2 CONT She married [[D'Amours-32|Charles D'Amours]] in 1697.  She was just 15years old and he was 35 (second marriage for him).  She became step mother to two children, the oldest of which was just 4 years younger than she was.≤ref>Sourc
2 CONC e: Mariage PRDH (Admin#1)≤/ref>  Together they had 10 children, all born in Quebec:≤ref name=White />
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:	
2 CONT # [[Damours-Louvieres-2|Louis Bertin Damours-Louvieres]]
2 CONT # [[D'Amours-106|Rene-Louis D'Amours]]
2 CONT #Charlotte Rimbault (born D'amours-dit-louvières) 1701 - ?
2 CONT #Marie-louise D'amours-dit-louvières  1703 - ?
2 CONT #Louis-Michel D'amours-dit-louvières 1707 - ?
2 CONT # [[D Amours-57|Marie-Anne D Amours]]
2 CONT #Marguerite Devilledonne (born D'amours-dit-louvières) 1709 - ?
2 CONT #Marie-madeleine D'amours-dit-louvières 1713 - ?
2 CONT #Louis D'amours-dit-louvières 1716 - ?
2 CONT #Pierre D'amours-dit-louvières ≤ref>MyHeritage≤/ref>
2 CONT She died on September 02, 1720 in Hôtel-Dieu de Québec, Quebec Province ≤ref name=White />
2 CONT
