2 CONT !CENSUS: 1693, Port Royal, Acadia, age 4 years, youngest ch ild listed in family. !CENSUS: 1698, age 7 years. !CENSUS: 1700, age 11 years. !CENSUS: 1701, age 13 years. !BIRTH-MARRIAGE-CHILDREN-RESIDENCES: Bona Arsenault, HISTOI RE
2 CONC  ET GENEALOGIE DES ACADIENS; 1625-1810; Ottawa, Edition s Lemeac, 1978, 6 vols.; pp. 807 (Port Royal) & 1574-1575 ( Chipoudy); own copy. Charles THIBODEAU, born 1689, son of P ierre & Jeanne TERRIOT of Port Royal. Charles married 
2 CONC at Po rt Royal on 19 Dec 1715 to Francoise COMEAU, daughter of Pi erre & Jeanne BOURG; nine children. He lived at Chipoudy. H e was buried at Port Lajoie on 26 Aug 1756. !CHILDREN: Janet Jehn, CORRECTIONS & ADDITIONS TO ARSENAULT 
2 CONC 'S HISTOIRE ET GENEALOGIE DES ACADIENS; 1550-1850; Covingto n, KY, author, 1988; p. 49, reference to p. 1575;own copy . Gives the marriage information for Olivier, born 1732 & A mand, born 1734. Anne THIBODEAU, born 1720, was the 
2 CONC daughte r of Philippe & Elizabeth VINCENT (reference: marriage reco rd of Pierre HENRY).
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT !INFORMATION: was taken from Historire ET Généalogie Des Acadiens by Bona ARSENAULT, Tome1 page 518. THIBAUDEAU et THIBODAUX aussi: THIBODEAU, THIBODEAUX. Pierre THIBODEAU, [Il était meunier à la PréeRonde dans le haut de la ríviè
2 CONC re Port-Royal En 1698, il fonda Chipoudy (Hopewell, N.-B.] né en 1631, originaire du Poitou, arrivé en Acadie avec Emmanuel LeBorgne de Belle-Isle, en 1654, marié vers 1660, à Jeanne TERRIOT, fille de Jean et de Perrine Bourg. ENF
2 CONC ANTS: Marie 1661; Marie 1662; Marie 1664; Anne-Marie 1665; Catherine 1667; Pierre 1670; Jeanne 1672; Jean 1673; Antoine 1674; Pierre 1676; Michel 1678; Cécile 1780; Anne-Marie 1682; Claude 1684; Joseph 1691; Charles 1694. Pierre T
2 CONC HIBODEAU a été inhumé à Port-Royal, le 26 Décembre 1704. Jeanne TERRIOT, sa veuve, a été inhuimé au même endroit, le 8 Décembre 1726.
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Charles THIBODEAUX is listed as a parent in the marriage record of Pierre Armand Amand THIBODEAUX which was recorded at St. Louis Cathedral, New Orleans, La. (NO CH VOL 1765).
