2 CONC chivesnationales.culture.gouv.fr/caomec2/osd.php?territoire=CANADA&commune=ILE%20SAINT-JEAN%20(PORT-LA-JOYE)&annee=1756≤/ref>≤ref>Acadian Church Records, Port LaJoye, Ile St. Jean, 1749-1758- Hebert, Tim, trans. & ed. - Houma, LA,
2 CONC  Acadian-Cajun Genealogy & History, 2000 - Parish records of St. Jean l'Evangeliste Parish. - p. 72≤/ref>
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT ≤references />* BIRTH-PARENTS-CENSUS-MARRIAGE-BURIAL: Stephen A. White, DICTIONNAIREGENEALOGIQUE DES FAMILLES ACADIENNES; 1636-1714; Moncton, New Brunswick, Centre d'Etudes Acadiennes, 1999, 2 vols.; p. 1509
2 CONT * BIRTH-MARRIAGE-CHILDREN-RESIDENCES: Bona Arsenault, HISTOIRE ET GENEALOGIE DES ACADIENS; 1625-1810; Ottawa, Editions Lemeac, 1978, 6 vols.; pp. 807 (Port Royal) & 1574-1575 (Chipoudy)
