1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LHFJ-H2C
2 CONT Brief Life History of Anselme'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Anselme Thibodeau was born about 1751, his father, Olivier Thibodeau, was 39 and his mother, Elizabeth Melanson, was 37. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Joseph Germain on 30 April 1781, in Portneuf, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 11 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 6 June 1822, in Cap-Sante, Portneuf, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 72, and was buried in Cap-Sante, Portneuf, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources:'''
