1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Cosme Brasseur\Brasseux\Brasset was born 16 DEC 1712 at Grand Pre, Acadia.   Cosme was deceased before the census taken at Georgetown, Maryland, USA on 7 July 1763. Cosme's spouse Elizabeth Thibodaux (Brasseux) was
2 CONC  described as being the widow of Cosme Brasseux.  British forces transported Cosme dit Brasseux, his wife Élisabeth Thibodeau, Cosme's younger brother Jean, his wife Madeleine Roy, and their children to Maryland in the fall of 175
2 CONC 5.
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Brasseur-107 WikiTree Genealogy] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 11 2018, 0:47:29 UTC''
