2 CONT !MARRIAGE: of Isidore BROUSSARD (Simon BROUSSARD & Marguerite BLANCHARD) was married on 7 Feb 1804 to Marie BROUSSARD (Rene BROUSSARD & Anne GAUDIN) & was recorded at St. Martin of the Tours Catholic Church, St. Martinville, La. (
2 CONC SM CH VOL 5 # 10). The marriage of Rene BROUSSARD (Joseph BROUSSARD & Astasie LEBLANC) was married on 12 Jun 1775 to Marie Magdeleine LANDRY (Firmin LANDRY & Francoise THIBODEAU) & recorded at St. Martin Parish Courthouse, St. Mar
2 CONC tinville, La. (SM CT HSE OA 1 28). Rene BROUSSARD, widower of Magdeleine LANDRY (Firmin LANDRY & Francoise THIBODEAU) was married on 9 Jan 1779 to Anne GAUDIN (Bonaventure GAUDIN & Theotise THIBOUDEAU) & recorded at St. Martin of 
2 CONC the Tours Catholic Church, St. Martinville, La. (SM CH VOL 1 PAGE 65). Rene BROUSSARD (Joseph BROUSSARD & Anastasie LEBLANC) married Barbara GAUDEN & recorded at St. Martin of the Tours Catholic church, St. Martinville, La. (SM CH
2 CONC ). The marriage of Bonaventure GAUDIN to Theotiste THIBODEAUX was recorded at St. Martin of the Tours Catholic Church, St. Martinville, La. (SM CH). Marie Anne GAUDIN, veuve of Rene BROUSSARD of Halifax (Bonavanture GAUDIN & Theot
2 CONC iste THIBODEAU) was married to Noble WILKIN of Straban (Jean WILKINS & Genie SMAYLIE) & recorded at St. Martin Parish Courthouse, St. Martinville, La. (SM CT HSE OA 14 1/2 15). Theotiste THIBODREAUX married Firmin LANDRY & recorde
2 CONC d at St. Martin of the Tours Catholic Church, St. Martinville, La. (SM CH).
2 CONT
