2 CONC ismal, marriage and death records of a "Savoie" between 1600 and 1650 in France, most in the western regions, specifically Maine-et-Loire and adjacent departments; precisely where researchers speculate is the region where Francois
2 CONC  Savoie originated and where the Seigneur D'Aulnay recruited from.” (Comment at <[https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Savoie-9 Wikitree]>)
