2 CONT * https://www.familytreedna.com/groups/frenchheritage/surnames R1b is the haplogroup for Francois Savoie
2 CONT * A patrilineal descendant of Carlo Alberto di Savoia (a member of the same House of Savoy) took a DNA test on FamilyTree DNA and got haplogroup EL-117 (E-M35). See: https://www.familytreedna.com/public/Italy?iframe=yresults R1b i
2 CONC s the haplogroup for Francois Savoie. E-3b for the Savoia royal male descendants. And, R1b happens to be the predominant haplogroup in the western region of France and the many Savoie descendants in that area.
2 CONT *1671 Acadie Census - shown to be 50 years old which estimates birth c.1621.
2 CONT *See the extract from “Savoy Heritage: 1621 to the Present.” (1983). Louis German Savoy,  [https://photos.geni.com/p13/f8/16/79/a6/5344484912e0e33c/loius_savoy_book_original.pdf link] (also on “Sources” tab)
2 CONT * https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/123968183/francois-savoie
