2 CONT [86162] CORPORON, Jean (..), ploughman (laboureur), born about 1646 (rec. 1671), 1647 (rec. 1686), 1649 (rec. 1693) or 1648 (rec. 1699), buried 1713-02-12 Port-Royal (Acadie)
2 CONT
2 CONT * married about 1670, from Port-Royal ? (Acadie)
2 CONT
2 CONT SAVOIE, Françoise (François & Catherine LEJEUNE [85608]), born about 1653 (rec. 1671, rec. 1686) or 1652 (rec. 1693) Port-Royal (Acadie), died 1711-12-27, buried Port-Royal (Acadie)
2 CONT
2 CONT       1) Cécile, married about 1702 Jean Baptiste BOUDREAU
2 CONT
2 CONT       2) Élisabeth ou Isabelle, union René FONTAINE, union .., married about 1714 William ou Billy ou Guillaume JOHNSON
2 CONT
2 CONT       3) Jean Baptiste, married about 1702 Marie PINET
2 CONT
2 CONT       4) Jean le jeune, married about 1730 Jeanne PICHOT
2 CONT
2 CONT       5) Jeanne, married about 1691 Antoine HÉBERT
2 CONT
2 CONT       6) Madeleine, born about 1670 (m 1735), married about 1690 Bernard DOUCET dit LAVERDURE, married Port-Royal (Acadie) 1710-11-24 François LECLERC dit LAVERDURE, married Port-Royal (Acadie) 1735-08-07 Claude BOUDREAU
2 CONT
2 CONT       7) Marguerite, union Jean LECUL, union Jean CLÉMENCEAU, union .., married before 1725-02-20 Henry ou Honoré SAMUEL
2 CONT
2 CONT       8) Marie, born about 1671-09 (rec. 1671 : 6 sem.), 1670 (rec. 1686), 1673 (rec. 1693), died after 1714-11-27 Pisiquit (Acadie), married about 1687 Charles BOUDREAU
2 CONT
2 CONT       9) Marie Madeleine, married about 1715 Jean SEIGNEUR dit LARIVIÈRE
2 CONT
