2 CONT http://www.acadiansingray.com/Acadians%20of%20LA-Intro-1.htm#THE_ACADIANS_OF_LOUISIANA
2 CONT Jean Préjean dit Le Breton, evidently from Brittany, married Andrée, a daughter of François Savoie and Catherine Lejeune, in c1683.  De Meulles counted them at Port-Royal in 1686.  Jean was age 35, and Andrée was 21.  They were li
2 CONC ving with a two-year-old daughter on an arpent of land.  They owned 2 guns and 1 hog.  Andrée gave Le Breton a dozen children, including eight sons who created families of their own.219 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
