2 CONT Beraud, living with Marie Bourg on three acres with five cattle, four
2 CONT boys ages 12, 9, 7, and 4 (born in 1666, 1669, 1671, and 1674) and two
2 CONT girls, ages 11 and 8, born in 1667 and 1670.
