2 NOTE Denise, thanks so much for adding this map to this Geni site.  I was in Nova Scotia with my family in 1985 right on the Bay of Fundy.  We travelled by car all around.  I wondered then where my ancestors had lived.  I wanted to loo
3 CONC k through cemeteries; but I didn't know enough information at the time to be able to be specific enough in a search of the area.  I am happy you added this map. Norma (Aubey) Lewis ~~ Vincent Breaux is my 8th Great-Grandfather on 
3 CONC my mother's mother's side of the family.  My mother's grandfather was Camille Breaux, who raised his large family near Napoleonville, Louisiana.  There are pictures on his profile page that I added from a book my mother's first co
3 CONC usin (Gerald P. Breaux) wrote for his cousins and families.  I think you can view them if you are interested. Again, thanks for your addition to this profile page! Norma (Aubey) Lewis
