2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT == Biography == :Pierre Breau was born about 1670 in Port-Royale, Acadie. He was age 1on the census of 1671 taken at Port-Royal. His parents were [[Breau-18|Vincent Breau]] and [[Bourg-38|Marie Bourg]].≤ref name="DGFA">"Dictionnai
2 CONC re Généalogique des Familles Acadiennes"; Stephen A. White; 2 vols., Moncton, New Brunswick: Centre d'Études Acadiennes, 1999; pp. 271, 274.
2 CONT *p. 274 BREAU #3 - Born around 1670, son of Vincent (1) & Marie BOURG.
2 CONT about 1694 :	Marriage (with Marie Josephe BOURGEOIS) - Acadia*p. 271 - Pierre was on the 1757 census at Braintree, MA, age 87 years* p. 274 BREAU #3 - Pierre BREAU, son of Vincent (1) & Marie BOURG, married 2nd around 1705 to Anne
2 CONC  LE BLANC, daughter of Jacques (2) & Catherine HÉBERT.≤/ref>
2 CONT :He married (1) in Acadie [[Bourgeois-623|Marie-Josèphe Bourgeois]] in 1694. ≤ref name="DGFA"/> Together they had 6 children:≤ref name="DGFA"/>
2 CONT # [[Brot-9|Jean-Baptiste Brot]]
2 CONT # [[Breau-184|Anne Breau]]
2 CONT # Marie BREAU ca 1697-ca 1717
2 CONT # [[Breau-15|Pierre Breau]]
2 CONT # Female BREAU ca 1703-
2 CONT # Female BREAU ca 1705-
2 CONT :He married (2) [[LeBlanc-353|Anne LeBlanc]] in 1705 in Acadie. ≤ref name="DGFA"/>Together they had 9 children:≤ref name="DGFA"/>
2 CONT # [[Brault-184|Théodore Joseph Brault]]
2 CONT # [[Breau-10|Catherine Breau]]
2 CONT # F Anne BREAU 1710-
2 CONT # [[Breau-16|Isabelle Breau]]
2 CONT # [[Breau-136|Jean Breau]]
2 CONT # [[Breau-138|Paul Breau]]
2 CONT # [[Breau-8|Brigitte Breau]]
2 CONT # [[Breau-137|Amand Breau]]
2 CONT # [[Breau-40|Agathe Breau]]
2 CONT :Pierre died after the census of 1758, presumably in Braintree, Massachusetts Colony, Age: 87-88. ≤ref name="DGFA"/>≤ref>Acadian Genealogy Exchange - Jehn, Janet, ed. - vol. XVI, no. 1 (Jan 1987), p. 9 - Pierreà Vincent BRAU died 
2 CONC 1760.≤/ref>
2 CONT == Recensements/Censuses ==:[http://www.acadian-cajun.com/1671cens.htm 1671 Acadian Census], Port-Royal].:Vincent BROT, 40, wife Marie BOURG 26; Children: Marie 9, Antoine 5, Marguerite 3, '''Pierre 1'''; cattle 9, sheep 7.≤ref>16
2 CONC 71 Acadian Census, at Port-Royal, Acadie The original census can be [http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c2572/2?r=0&s=1 Acadian Census microfilm C-2572 of the National Archives of Canada] “Acadie Recensements1671 – 
2 CONC 1752”, Images 3-14. Also: [http://www.acadian-cajun.com/1671a.htm Scan of original]; [http://www.acadian-cajun.com/1671cens.htm Tim Hebert transcription].
2 CONT ≤/ref>:[http://www.acadian-cajun.com/1678cens.htm 1678 Acadian Census]≤ref>Hebert, Tim. “Recensement 1678, Port-Royal, Acadie.” Edited by Clarence d'Entremont. Acadian-Cajun Genealogy & History. Rootsweb.com. Accessed November 2, 
2 CONC 2019. 
2 CONT Folio 20
2 CONT ≤/ref>
2 CONT :Vincelot Beraud & Marie Bourg:On Folio 20: one of four boys, he was '''Pierre, age 9''', in household of Vincelot BERAUD & Marie BOURG. There are also two girls.
