2 CONC , Rene 3, Susanne 2 months; 3 arpents, 6 cattle, 4 sheep, 6 hogs.≤ref> The original census can be found at [http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c2572/2?r=0&s=1 Acadian Census microfilm C-2572 of the National Archives
