1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jean Breau (Abt. 1675-1751) was born and died in Port Royal. He married Anne Chiasson of Beaubassin. They had seven children recorded. They were born in in Beaubassin (1700), Grande-Pre (1705), and Port Royal (1707
2 CONC -1715).  Anne died in Beaubassin in 1720.  He was buried in the Garrison Graveyard, Port Royal, on April 17, 1751. His age at death was recorded as “about 60”.
2 CONT --------------------
