2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT 1701 census of Port Royal Jean Brau was shown as age 24. His wife, Anne Chiason, was 22. They had one child Marie age 1. They had one arpent of land, 15 cattle, 12 sheep, 6 hogs, and one gun.
2 CONT 1703 census simply stated "Jean Breau and his wife, 1 arms bearer.
2 CONT 1707 census of Port Royal Jean Brault and his wife had one boy 14 or older, 1 younger boy, one girl less that 12, one arpent, 9 cattle, 17 sheep, 15 hogs and one gun.
2 CONT 1714 censu shows "Jean Breau and his wife, 3 males, 3 females"
2 CONT Found info that showed Pierre being exiled to Connecticut. Ambroise's ancestors ended up in South Louisiana.
