2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT He was refuge at Restigouche in 1760 with his family of 2 children. He was probably taken prisoner at Népisiguit in 1761 and taken to Halifax where he was found with his family in 1763. France and Britain signed the peace the same
2 CONC  year, Joseph went to join his compatriots in the Baie des Chaleurs.
2 CONT === GEDCOM Source ===
2 CONT P. 271 Les Savoie - Fidèle Thériault
