2 CONT : Mother:	Genevieve Babinot: Godparents: Pierre La Noue, Jeanne Gautrot, widow of La Noue ≤ref>Nova Scotia Archives: Acadians: An Acadian Parish Remembered: The Registers of St Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal 1702-1755, RG 1, Vol. 
2 CONC 26, p. 148 [https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=2100 Baptismal Registration]≤/ref>
2 CONT === Marriage ===
