2 CONC  Vol. 26a, p. 282 [https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=2759 Marriage Registration]≤/ref>
2 CONT === Children ===: 1- Marie Joseph, b. 1746 in Annapolis Royal [https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=2830 Baptism/Marie Joseph Savoye]: 2- Joseph, b. 1 nov 1747 [https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp
2 CONC ?ID=2957 Baptism/Joseph Savoye]: 3- Jean Baptiste, b. 30 march 1750 [https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=3160 Baptism/Jean Baptiste Savoye]: 4- Marie Josephe, b. 18 november 1752 [https://novascotia.ca/archives/
