2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT [[Category: Port-Royal, Acadie]]
2 CONT == Biography =='''Marie Joseph Savoye''' was born 15 Nov 1719. She was the child of [[Savoie-64|Germain Savoie]] and [[Babineau-31|Geneviève Babineau]]. She was baptized the next day at St Jean Baptiste Parish, Port Royal. Her god
2 CONC parents were Claude Savoye and Marie Brau.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-1870 (image 31) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1869/31?
2 CONC r=0&s=5≤/ref>
2 CONT She married Michel Dupuis, son of the late Jean Dupuis and Anne Richard 20 January 1744 at Port Royal. Witnesses were: Joseph Dupuis, René Richard, Joseph Savoye and Louis Girouard. There was a dispensation for 3-4 consanguinity.≤
2 CONC ref>An Acadian Parish Remembered The Registers ofSt. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755 Michel Dupuis and MarieJoseph Savoye marriage 20 January 1744 RG 1 volume 26a page 260 https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.
2 CONC asp?ID=2695≤/ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT # Marie Josephe DUPUIS 
2 CONT # Ludivine DUPUIS 1752-1827
2 CONT # Joseph DUPUIS 
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT ≤references />* BIRTH-MARRIAGE: Bona Arsenault, HISTOIRE ET GENEALOGIE DES ACADIENS;1625-1810; Ottawa, Editions Lemeac, 1978, 6 vols.; p. 797 (Port Royal)* BAPTISM-MARRIAGE:  Dictionnaire Généalogique des Familles Acadiennes - Dic
2 CONC tionnaire Généalogique des Familles Acadiennes, Première Partie 1636-1714 - Stephen A. White - 2 vols., Moncton, New Brunswick: Centre d'Études Acadiennes, 1999 - p. 1462
2 CONT
