2 CONT == Biography =='''Marguerite Savoye''' was born 28 May 1722. She was the daughter of [[Savoie-64|Germain Savoie]] and [[Babineau-31|Geneviève Babineau]]. She was baptized the same day at Port Royal. Her godparents were Antoine Bla
2 CONC nchard and Marie Joseph Savoye.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada,Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-.)-1870 C-1870 (image 53) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1869/53?r=0&s=5≤/ref>
