2 CONT == Biography == '''Francois Savoye''' was born 22 Dec 1724. He was the son of [[Savoie-64|Germain Savoie]] and [[Babineau-31|Geneviève Babineau]]. He was baptized  27 Dec 1724 at Port Royal, Acadia. His godparents were Charles Sav
2 CONC oye and Marie Blanchard, daughter of Antoine Blanchard.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-1870 (image 73) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_r
2 CONC eel_c1869/73?r=0&s=5≤/ref>≤ref>An Acadian Parish Remembered The Registers of St. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755 François Savoye baptism RG 1 volume 26 page 203 https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=1006
2 CONC ≤/ref> 
2 CONT He passed away 6 June 1734 aged 9 years and was buried the next day atPort Royal, Acadia. Witnesses were Germain Savoye, grandfather and Marie Brau, grandmother.≤ref>An Acadian Parish Remembered The Registers of St. Jean-Baptiste,
2 CONC  Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755 François Savoye burial RG 1 volume 26a page 123 https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=2013≤/ref> 
