2 CONT *'''Biography''':  Anne Marie Savoie, daughter of Francois Savoie and Marie Josephe Richard, was born June 2, 1718 in Port-Royal, Acadie and baptized there the same day.  Her godparents were Germain Richard and Anne Richard, wife 
2 CONC of Jean Dupuis.<ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-1870 (image 13) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1869/13?r=0&s=5</ref> She married J
2 CONC oseph Thibodeau, son of Michel Thibodeau and Agnes Dugas around 1738 in Acadie. There are three known children,Joseph, Marie Elisabeth and a second son also named Joseph. Anne-Marie died between Oct 1755 & Aug 1756 a time of great
2 CONC  upheaval in Acadie.<ref>"Dictionnaire Généalogique des Familles Acadiennes" ("DGFA"); Stephen A. White; Publication: 2 vols., Moncton, New Brunswick: Centre d'Études Acadiennes, 1999; pp. 1460 & 1518
2 CONT : Sponsors: Germain RICHARD & Anne RICHARD (wife of Jean DUPUIS). :Anne-Marie died between Oct 1755 & Aug 1756.</ref>
2 CONT
