2 CONT == Biography =='''Simon Savoye''' was born 17 Aug 1723. He was the son of [[Savoie-65|François Savoie]] and [[Richard-174|Marie-Josèphe Richard]]. He wasbaptized 5 Sept 1723 at Saint Charles des Mines, Grand-Pré, Acadia.His godpar
2 CONC ents were Antoine Dupuis and Marie Granger.<ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Charles-des-Mines (Grand-Pré, N.-É.) - 1869;  Canadiana, Heritage, Parish registers:Nova Scotia : C-1869 (Image 178
2 CONC ): http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1870/178?r=0&s=4</ref>
2 CONT his marriage record to Angélique Glinelle/Delinelle gives his origin as BEAUBASSIN EN ACADIE
2 CONT
