1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/KPSM-9R9
2 CONT Brief Life History of René'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When René Babineau was born about 1693, in Port-Royal, Acadia, New France, his father, Nicolas Babineau dit Deslauriers, was 41 and his mother, Marie Marguerite Granger, was 26. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Madelaine Savoye on 26 April 1711, in Saint-Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, Nova Scotia, British North America. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 7 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 15 October 1754, in New Brunswick, Canada, at the age of 62, and was buried in Port Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Sources:'''
2 CONT **Drouin Institute (Archived marriage record - see attached in Media tab)
