2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT [[Category: Port-Royal, Acadie]]
2 CONT == Biography =='''Rene (dit Renaud) Babineau''' dit Deslauriers was born about 1688 in Port Royal, Acadia, to parents Nicolas Babineau dit Deslauriers and Marie Marguerite Granger. 
2 CONT On 26 Apr 1711 he married Magdelaine Savoye, daughter of Germain Savoye and Marie Braux in Port Royal.≤ref>Acadia.Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-1870 (im
2 CONC age 155) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1869/155?r=0&s=5≤/ref>≤ref>Nova Scotia Archives: Acadians: An Acadian Parish Remembered: The Registers of St. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755, RG 1, vol. 26, p.
2 CONC  301 https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=1275≤/ref> They had twelve children allborn/baptized at Port Royal:
2 CONT # Marie Madeleine BABINEAU 1713-1754
2 CONT # Marie Josephe BABINEAU 1717-1799
2 CONT # Jean Baptiste BABINEAU 1719-1807
2 CONT # Charles BABINEAU 1722-/1777
2 CONT # Rene BABINEAU 1725-1775
2 CONT # Anne BABINEAU 1726-1784
2 CONT # Paul BABINEAU ca 1726-1733
2 CONT # Marie BABINEAU 1729-1766
2 CONT # Marguerite BABINEAU 1732-1793
2 CONT # Cecile BABINEAU 1735-1786
2 CONT # Claude Poncy BABINEAU 1737-
2 CONT # Angelique BABINEAU ca 1740-1789
2 CONT
2 CONT He died before 13 Mar 1770 in Port Royal when his widow was buried.
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT ≤references />*PARENTS-MARRIAGE: Dictionnaire Généalogique des Familles Acadiennes; Author: Stephen A. White; Publication: 2 vols., Moncton, New Brunswick: Centre d'Études Acadiennes, 1999; Page: pp. 65 & 1458
2 CONT *BIRTH-NAME-MARRIAGE-CHILDREN: Bona Arsenault, HISTOIRE ET GENEALOGIE DES ACADIENS; 1625-1810; Ottawa, Editions Lemeac, 1978, 6 vols.; pp. 395-396.
