2 CONT Brief Life History of Rene'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Rene Babineau dit Deslauriers was born on 19 April 1725, in Annapolis, Nova Scotia, Canada, his father, René Babineau, was 33 and his mother, Marie Magdelaine Savoie, was 32. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 1st wife Margueritte Bourg (1722- ) on 27 January 1755, in Digby, Nova Scotia, Canada. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 2nd wife Madeleine Michel (1731–1806) on 20 May 1759 in New England
2 CONT They had at least 6 children
2 CONT Paul BABINEAU dit Deslauriers 1759–
2 CONT David BABINEAU dit Deslauriers 1761–
2 CONT Geneviève Babineau Deslauriers 1762–1790
2 CONT Anne Babineau dit Deslauriers 1764–
2 CONT Joseph Babineau dit Deslauriers 1767–1767
2 CONT Marguerite Babineau dit Deslauriers 1768–1796
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 5 December 1775, in Beauport, Montmorency No. 1, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 50, and was buried in Beauport, Montmorency No. 1, Quebec, Canada.
