2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Babineau was born on 25 March 1729, in Annapolis Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia, Canada, her father, René Babineau, was 37 and her mother, Marie Madelaine Savoye, was 36. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Edmond Armand Comeau on 9 May 1752, in Port Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia, Canada. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT Antoine Firmin Comeau 1753–1810
