2 CONT {{Acadian}} [[Category: Port-Royal, Acadie]]
2 CONT == Biography=='''René Blanchard''' was born about 1677. He was the son of [[Blanchard-173|Guillaume Blanchard]] and [[Gougeon-18|Huguette Gougeon]]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT CENSUS: 1678, Port Royal, Acadia, age 6 months.
2 CONT
2 CONT CENSUS: 1686, Port Royal, Acadia, age 8 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT CENSUS: 1693, age 16 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT CENSUS: 1698, age 22 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT CENSUS 1700, age 23 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT CENSUS; 1701, age 23 years (sic).
2 CONT He married Marie Savoye, daughter of Germain Savoye and Marie Braux 18January 1708 at Port Royal.<ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds dela paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-1870 (image 131) http
2 CONC ://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1869/131?r=0&s=5</ref><ref>An Acadian Parish Remembered, René Blanchard and Marie Savoye marriage Register-RG 1 volume 26 page 288 
2 CONT https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=1236</ref>
2 CONT
