2 CONT # girl BLANCHARD 1728-1728
2 CONT # girl BLANCHARD 1728-1728
2 CONT # Marie Josephe BLANCHARD 1731-/1771 He passed away 3 Dec 1754, aged about 77 years and was buried the nextday at Port Royal.<ref>An Acadian Parish Remembered The Registers of St. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755 René Bla
2 CONC nchard burial RG 1 volume 26a page 517 https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=3538</ref>
