2 CONT ***Cabanocé census, 1766, listed as Juan Savoies
2 CONT ***Opelousas census, 1777, called Jean Scavois, age 25
2 CONT ***Opelousas census, 1788, Bellevue, listed as Jn. Savoye
2 CONT ***Opelousas militia list, Jul 1789, fusilier, listed as Jean Savoye
