2 CONT Will Celebrate Golden Wedding.  Grand Coteau. La., Nov. 1 or 4.- the golden wedding anniversary of Judge and Mrs. J. A. Smith (Estelle Cavilier) will be celebrated on Thursday of next week.  They were married in New Orleans on Nov
2 CONC ember 9, 1872.  A special mass of thanksgiving will be said at the Sacred Heart Catholic Church, after which they will receive their friends.
