2 CONT GRAND COTEAU -- Funeral services were held at 9:30 a.m. today in the Sacred Heart Catholic Church for Mrs. James Fox 87, the former Zita Smith, who died a 5 p.m. Saturday at her home. Burial was in the church cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT She is survived by two sons, Jack Fox of Grand Coteau and Edward Joseph Fox of New Orleans; one sister, Mrs. Electa Richard of Grand Coteau; seven grandchildren; and seven great grandchildren.
2 CONT
