2 CONT Died at St. Joseph parish, Riviere-aux-Canards, in Acadia. According toGenevieve Massignon, GAUTHIER is not an Acadian name. The name MartinGauthier appears in the register of LaChausee, Vienne, France, at thebeginning of the 17th
2 CONC  century.
2 CONT Martine Gauthier spouse of Denis Gaudet, was the grandmother of all theAcadian Gaudets of America. Born in France, she married in Port Royal in1645, 2 or 3 years after her arrival on the Ship Aulnay. (published inL'Acadie Vivante)
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT [v02t3249.ftw]
2 CONT !DEATH: In 1671 Port Royal Census her age is given as 62 years old. In1678 Port Royal census her husband Denis Gaudet RIN 691 is listed as widower.
