2 CONT "Histoire et Genealogie des Acadiens"-Arsenault Vol I pg 407.
2 CONT Shown on the 1671 Acadian Census with family of 5 children; The Généalogie de L'ancienne Acadie (from the Internet) also shows this info.
2 CONT The 1671 census of Acadia shows her age 52 with 5 children; census filed with censuses.
2 CONT <http://www.genealogie.com/dgaa/index.html> Add'l info (copy filed L-14-16).
2 CONT <http:www.geocities.com/Heartland/Pointe/6106/genealogy-gaudet.html>
2 CONT <http://jason.gaudet.com/gaudet/gaudet_gen1.htm> (copy filed L-14-16).
2 CONT "Mothers of Acadia" (filed L-14-16) shows the following:  Martine Gauthier, spouse of Denise Gaudet (#1983), was the grandmother of all the Acadian Gaudets of America.  Born in France, she married in Port-Royal in 1645, 2 or 3 yea
2 CONC rs after her arrival on the Ship Aulnay.  (Denis Gaudet had come to Acadia in 1632, with his father Jean (#2005) who was 96 in 1671 and who had remarried to Nicole Coleson (#2006) from the Scottish group that ahd settled at Port-R
2 CONC oyal (Scottish Port) in 1629.
2 CONT See #2005 for more on the Gaudet Genealogy.
2 CONT Durocher/Ferguson Genealogy on internet (copy filed L-14-18).
2 CONT Hebert Genealogy from the internet (copy filed L-14-8).
2 CONT Individual record of self (copy filed L-14-9).
2 CONT <http://jason.gaudet.com/gaudet/gaudet_gen2a.htm>. (copy filed L-14-8).
2 CONT <http://geocities.com/ronald_gaudet2001/wga7.html> (copy filed L-14-8).
2 CONT <http://pages.infinit.net/alber/dat18.htm> (copy filed L-14-8).
2 CONT "Généalogie de L'ancienne Acadie" [G-K] pg 1.
2 CONT LDS Ancestral File, descendancy chart of #2008 (copy filed L-14-18).
2 CONT Gaudet Descendents from the internet (copy filed L-14-8).
