2 CONT
2 CONT The Gaudet Family
2 CONT -----------------------------------
2 CONT Father: Denis Gaudet: [Jean]
2 CONT Mother: Martine Gauthier
2 CONT
2 CONT 3rd Generation
2 CONT -----------------------------------
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT -----------------------------------
2 CONT 1. Anne Gaudet: b. abt 1646 (SW); d. abt 1678 (SW), Port Royal.
2 CONT Married: abt 1663 (SW), Port Royal to Pierre Vincent.
2 CONT -----------------------------------
2 CONT 2. Marie Gaudet: b. abt 1650 (SW), Port Royal; d. 2/3 May, 1734, Port Royal (SW), Nova Scotia.
2 CONT Married: abt 1666 (SW), Port Royal to Olivier Daigre: (parents undetermined) b. abt 1643 (SW).S
2 CONT Children: Jean, Jacques, Bernard, daugher, Olivier, Jean, Marie, Anne and Pierre.
2 CONT Married 2nd: abt 1685 to John (Jean) Fardel (Fredelle): (parents undetermined) b. abt 1643 (SW).
2 CONT Children: none that have been traced (SW).
2 CONT -----------------------------------
2 CONT 3. Pierre l'aîné Gaudet: b. abt 1652 (SW), Port Royal.
2 CONT Married: abt 1672 (SW) to Anne Blanchard: (Jean & Radegonde Lambert) b. abt 1645 (SW), Port Royal; d. Beaubassin (SW).. Note: was the widow of Francois Guérin (SW).
2 CONT Children: Bernard, Pierre, Claude, Abraham, Marie (twin), Madeleine (twin), Jeanne, Augustin and Jean.
2 CONT -----------------------------------
2 CONT 4. Pierre le jeune Gaudet: b. abt 1654 (SW), Port Royal; d. Dec. 8/9, 1741 (SW), Port Royal, Nova Scotia.
2 CONT Married: abt 1675 (SW) to Marie Blanchard: (Jean & Radegonde Lambert) b. abt 1656 (SW), Port Royal.
2 CONT Children: Pierre dit Will Denis, Antoine, Germain, Guillaume, Denis, Marguerite, Jean dit Varouël, Bernard dit Bléche, Marie and Jeanne.
2 CONT -----------------------------------
2 CONT 5. Marie Gaudet: b. abt 1657 (SW), Port Royal.
2 CONT Married: abt 1673 (SW) to Martin Aucion: (Martin & Marie Sallé) b. abt 1651 (SW); d. May 14/15, 1711, Grand Pré (SW), Acadia/Nova Scotia.
2 CONT Children: Martin, Marie, Michel, Isabelle (Elisabeth), Lousie, Agnes, Alexis (twin), Augustin (twin), Cécile, Anne-Marie, Pierre, René, Catherine, Antoine, Francoise, Joseph, Jean, Charles and an unnamed daughter.
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------
2 CONT The following was acquired from:  <http://www.louisianacajun.com/web/robertjor/pafg12.htm>.
2 CONT
2 CONT This page honors all of the women who came from France as Pioneers to a land called New France. By their heroic deeds, they braved all kinds of challenges. In all that they did they mirrored the strength of their descendants. With
2 CONC out a doubt, they are truly the Mothers of Acadia...
2 CONT
2 CONT Martine GAUTHIER, spouse of Denis GAUDET, was the grandmother of all the Acadian Gaudets of America. Born in France, she married in Port-Royal in 1645, 2 or 3 years after her arrival on the Ship Aulnay. (Denis Gaudet had come to A
2 CONC cadia in 1632, with his father Jean who was 96 in 1671 and who had remarried to Nicole Coleson from the Scottish group that had settled at Port-Royal (Scottish Fort in 1629.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Martine GAUTHIER, spouse of Denis GAUDET, was the grandmother of all the Acadian Gaudets of America. Born in France, she married in Port-Royal in 1645, 2 or 3 years after her arrival on the Ship Aulnay. (Denis Gaudet had come to A
2 CONC cadia in 1632, with his father Jean who was 96 in 1671 and who had remarried to Nicole Coleson from the Scottish group that had settled at Port-Royal (Scottish Fort in 1629.)
2 CONT
2 CONT The historical data presented is from research done with the 1671 Census by Antoine BERNARD, c.s.v. and published in L'Acadie Vivante. This was published some years ago and has been translated from French by me for this page as we
2 CONC ll as updated according to newer information researched in the past several years. Information is confirmed in the Dictionnaire généalogique des familles acadiennes by Stephen A. White
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------
