2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Anne, born about 1644 or 1646 (rec. 1671), married about 1663 Pierre VINCENT
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Marie1, born about 1651 (rec. 1671) or 1650 (rec. 1686, rec. 1699), died Port-Royal (bim) (Acadie), married about 1666 Olivier DAIGLE, married about 1685 John puis Jean FARDEL ou FREDELLE
2 CONT
