2 CONT DAIGLE, Olivier
2 CONT
2 CONT The Daigle family in Acadia is rooted in Olivier Daigre, born in France about 1643. He married in Port-Royal about 1666 to Marie Gaudet, daughter of Denis Gaudet and Martine Gauthier. Of their seven sons, only two became founders 
2 CONC of families.
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------
2 CONT The following was acquired from the Gaudet Genealogy <http:www.geocities.com/Heartland/Pointe/6106/genealogy-gaudet.html>.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. DENIS2 GAUDET (JEAN1) was born Abt. 1625, and died 11 October 1709 in Port-Royal, Acadia. He married MARTINE GAUTHIER Abt. 1645 in Port-Royal, Acadia, daughter of MARTIN GAUTHIER. She was born Abt. 1619, and died Bef. 1678.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of DENIS GAUDET and MARTINE GAUTHIER are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 13. i. ANNE3 GAUDET, b. Abt. 1646; d. Bef. 1678, Port-Royal, Acadia.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. MARIE GAUDET, b. Abt. 1650; d. 02 May 1734, Port-Royal, Acadia; m. (1) OLIVIER DAIGRE, Abt. 1666, Port-Royal, Acadia; b. Abt. 1643, France; m. (2) (JOHN) JEAN FARDEL(FREDELLE), Abt. 1669, Port-Royal, Acadia; b. Abt. 1643, Fran
2 CONC ce.
2 CONT
2 CONT 14. iii. PIERRE DIT L'?INÉ GAUDET, b. Abt. 1652.
2 CONT
2 CONT 15. iv. PIERRE DIT LE JEUNE GAUDET, b. Abt. 1654; d. 08 December 1741, Port-Royal, Acadia.
2 CONT
2 CONT 16. v. MARIE GAUDET, b. Abt. 1657.
