2 CONT In the census of the Port Royal river valley in 1671, Denis Gaudet gives his age as 46 years old, his wife Martine Gauthier was 52 years old.  They had five children, two were married: Anne Gaudet was 25 years old (married to Pier
2 CONC re Vincent); Marie Gaudet was 21 years old (married to Olivier Daigre, who lived opposite Gaudet Village on the south bank); Pierre Gaudet l'Aine, aged 20; Pierre Gaudet le Jeune, aged 17; Marie Gaudet, aged 14.  All were farmers.
2 CONC   Denis had six arpents of cultivated land (an arpent = roughly 5/6 of an acre). nine horned cattle and 13 sheep, some large, some small.
