2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT BIO: Anne was born in about 1646, as she was 32 years old when she died. She is the daughter of Denis Gaudet and Martine Gauthier.She married Pierre Vincent in about 1663, in Port-Royal, Acadie. They are believed to be the parents
2 CONC  of the following:1) Huguette (1664-1717) md Jean Bastarache2) Michel (1668-) md (a) Anne-Marie Doiron and (b) Marie-Josephe Richard3) Pierre (1669-1732) md Marie-Jeanne Trahan4) Clement (1674-) md Madeleine Levron :: https://www.
2 CONC findagrave.com/memorial/156815879/anne-gaudet#add-to-vc
2 CONT
2 CONT
