2 CONT == Biography ==:'''NOTICE''': this profile is protected by the [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Project:Acadians Acadian Project] because of frequent duplication.  Please contact the Acadian Project before making any substantive cha
2 CONC nges. Thanks for helping make WikiTree the best site for accurateinformation.
2 CONT Anne was born around 1646, possibly in Port-Royal but no place is given by Stephen White. ≤ref name=DGFA>White, Stephen A., Patrice Gallant,and Hector-J Hébert. [[Space:Dictionnaire_généalogique_des_familles_acadiennes|''Dictionna
2 CONC ire Généalogique Des Familles Acadiennes.'']] Moncton, N.-B.: Centre D'études Acadiennes, Université De Moncton,1999, Print, p. 668.≤/ref> 
2 CONT She married Pierre Vincent around 1663 in Port-Royal according to the depositions of her descendants at Belle-Isle-en Mer.≤ref name=DGFA/>
2 CONT She was listed twice in the first Acadian census in 1671 at the age of 25:  in her father's household and in her husband's.≤ref>Tim Hebert;Transcription of the 1671 Acadian Census, at Port-Royal, Acadie. [http://freepages.rootsweb
2 CONC .com/~acadiancajun/genealogy/1671cens.htm 1671 Census Transcribed]. The original census can be found at [http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c2572/2?r=0&s=1Acadian Census microfilm C-2572 of the National Archives of 
2 CONC Canada] “Acadie Recensements 1671 – 1752” Images 3-14.≤blockquote>at Port-Royal: *(with parents) Denis GAUDET, 46, wife, Martine GAUTHIER 62; Children (the first 2 married): Anne 25, Marie 21, Pierre 20, Pierre 17, Marie 14; cattl
2 CONC e 9, sheep 13.≤br/>*(with husband and children)  Pierre VINCENT, 40, wife Anne GAUDET 27; Children: Huguette 7, Thomas 6, Michel 3, Pierre 2; cattle 18, sheep 9.≤/blockquote>≤/ref> 
2 CONT Anne passed away in Port-Royal before 1678 since she is not listed with her husband in the census for that year.≤ref>Tim Hebert; 1678 Port Royal Acadian Census noting that the correlations for this census were done by Rev. Clarenc
2 CONC e J. d'Entremont, Fairhaven, Massachusetts.[http://freepages.rootsweb.com/~acadiancajun/genealogy/1678cens.htm 1678 Census]≤blockquote> at Port Royal: Pierre Vincent, 15 cattle, 8 acres, 4 boys: age 13- born 1665; 11-1667, 9-1669,
2 CONC  7-1671; 2 girls: age 15- born1663, 10-1668.≤/blockquote>≤/ref>
2 CONT
