2 CONT :'''[[Gaudet-11|Pierre 'the younger' Gaudet]] and [[Gaudet-17|Pierre 'the elder' Gaudet]] are both listed on the 1671 Census.''' They were brothers and both married women named Blanchard. Each had a son named Jean or Jean Baptiste
2 CONC . Anne born about 1645 married the elder Pierre and Marie born about 1656, married the younger Pierre. 
2 CONT :There is '''confusion''' about '''which''' Pierre Gaudet '''died''' in '''1741'''. There is a record which states a Pierre Gaudet died on 8Dec. 1741, age 89 which would give a birth year of about 1652, consistent with the older b
2 CONC rother, however their birth dates are only about 2 years apart and age at death in a record is very unreliable. Both brothers had the same death date. 
