1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/94VD-9DN
2 CONT Brief Life History of Angelique'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Angelique Aucoin was born on 9 January 1708, in Grand-Pré, Acadia, New France, her father, Martin Aucoin, was 36 and her mother, Catherine Theriot, was 35. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Pierre Duhon/Duon on 15 November 1745, in Acadia, New France. They were the parents of at least 5 daughters. 
2 CONT Marguerite Duon/Duhon 1749–
2 CONT Marie Duon/Duhon 1753–
2 CONT female Child Duon/Duhon 1755–1755 (died in infancy)
2 CONT Fleurine Duon/Duhon 1755–
2 CONT Marie Claire Duon/Duhon 1755–1813
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1757, in Bristol, England, United Kingdom, at the age of 49.
