2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT
2 CONT == Biography =='''Catherine Comeau''' was born about 1697. She was the daughter of [[Comeau-5|Jean Comeau]] and [[Babin-3|Catherine Babin]]. She married Pierre Aucoin, son of the deceased Martin Aucoin and Marie Godet and widower 
2 CONC of Marie Breau 1 Aug 1718 at Saint Charles des Mines.≤ref>http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1870/590?r=0&s=5≤/ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT ≤references />
2 CONT * Title: Catholic Church Records, vol. 1a: Acadian Records, 1707-1748
2 CONT Author: Diocese of Baton Rouge
2 CONT Publication: Diocese, 1999, 
2 CONT Note: The Registers of St. Charles aux Mines in Acadia, from Grand Pré, carried into exile to St. G abriel Church of Iberville, LA.
2 CONT Page: pp. 14 & 50Text from p. 50: Caterine Comeau (Jean Comeau and Caterine Babin) m. 1Aug. 1718 (consanguinity ≤u>3rd to≤/u> 4th degree.  Pierre Aucoin, widower of Marie Brau (Martin Aucoin, ≤u>decd.≤/u> and Marie Godet) wit.Mart
2 CONC ien Aucoin (s); {+} Jean Aucoin; Jean Commaux (s); sig. {+} Pierre Aucoin; {+} Caterine Comeau Note: part of entry missing, underlined text is from 1895 transcription. (SGA-2,260-261).
2 CONT
2 CONT * Source: Genealogy of Canada[http://www.nosorigines.qc.ca/GenealogieQuebec.aspx?genealogy=Comeau_Catherine&pid=159568&lng=en]
