1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT !BIRTH-CHRISTENING: Sponsors Rene AUCOIN & Catherine BABIN (SGA-2, 15) in Baton 
2 CONT Rouge, Acad. Records, p. 3. He'lene. 
2 CONT
2 CONT BIRTH-PARENTS-MARRIAGES: Albert Robichaux, Jr., THE ACADIAN EXILES IN 
2 CONT SAINT-MALO; 1758-1785; Eunice, LA, Hebert Publications, 1981, Part I, vol. II; 
2 CONT p. 762, family #893 & p. 445, family #499; own copy; contains Family 
2 CONT Genealogies H-Z. Helene AUCOIN, born about 1719 in the parish of St. Joseph 
2 CONT [Riviere aux Canards] in Acadie, married 1st about 1744 to Claude TRAHAN; 
2 CONT daughter born about 1745. As his widow, with her daughter Marguerite TRAHAN she 
2 CONT disembarked at St. Malo from England on 23 May 1763 from the ship "La 
2 CONT Dorothee." Until her remarriage she resided at Plouer in 1763; at Pleslin in 
2 CONT 1764. On 15 Mar 1764 she married 2nd to Ambroise HEBERT (widower of 
2 CONT Marie-Madeleine BOURG), son of Jean & Marie LANDRY, at Plouer, Cotes-du-Nord, 
2 CONT France.
