2 CONT
2 CONT Jean was born about 1601, in Martiaze, Vienne, France. He married Perrine Reau there before 1637. They are the parents of the following:
2 CONT 1) Claude (1637-1725) md Marie Gaudreau
2 CONT 2) Jean (1639-) md before census 1671
2 CONT 3) Bonaventure (1641-1731) md Jeanne Boudreau
2 CONT 4) Jeanne (1643-1726) md Pierre Thibodeau
2 CONT 5) Germain (1646-1678) md Andree Brun
2 CONT 6) Catherine (1650-1713) md Pierre Guilbault
2 CONT 7) Pierre (1654-1725) md Cecile Landry
2 CONT
2 CONT He died between the census 1671 and census 1678
2 CONT
