2 CONC 39 in Port Royal, , , Acadia Has Children Bonaventure (dit Venture) THERIOT b: Abt 1641 in Port Royal, , , Acadia Has Children Jeanne THERIOT b: Abt 1643 in Port Royal, , , Acadia Has Children Germain THERIOT b: Abt 1646 in Port R
2 CONC oyal, , , Acadia Has Children Catherine THERIOT b: Abt 1650 in Port Royal, , , Acadia Has No Children Pierre THERIOT b: Abt 1654 in Port Royal, , , Acadia
