2 CONC  Author: Stephen A. White Publication: 2 vols., Moncton, New Brunswick: Centre d'Études Acadiennes, 1999 Page: pp. 1365 & 1483 Note: No place given for marriage. Abbrev: Histoire et Généalogie des Acadiens Title: Histoire et Généa
2 CONC logie des Acadiens Author: Bona Arsenault Publication: Montreal: Lemeac, 1978, 6 vols. Note: Vols. 2-6 contain genealogies by area, paged continuously. Page: p. 804 (Port Royal) Text: Already married around 1635 to Perrine BOURG [
