2 CONT :Jean Thériot was born around 1639. We do not know the name of his wife but the 1671 census states that they were married before that date.≤ref>Source: [[#DGFA]] p. 1488:Note by S. A. WHITE: we do not know the name of the wife of 
2 CONC Jean THÉRIOT fils [Jr.]. However, it is clearly indicated on the 1671 census that he was married before that date. He must have settled elsewhere, as did other children of the first colonists of Acadia. [No indication given that h
2 CONC e may have gone to Quebec, where a THERIAULT line is foundin the next generation.]≤/ref>≤ref>Based on his age in the 1671 census. Note: the DGFA doesn't give a location of birth.≤/ref>
