2 CONC therine 21; (not married): Pierre 16; cattle 6, sheep 1.≤/blockquote>≤/ref>  They were enumerated again in 1678, with three girls in the family home.≤ref>Tim Hebert; 1678 Port Royal Acadian Census noting that the correlations for 
