2 CONC ote>≤/ref> Inthe following census in 1698 were listed among their possessions 20 fruit trees.≤ref> Tim Hebert; Transcription of the 1698 Acadian Census at Port-Royal, Acadie[http://freepages.rootsweb.com/~acadiancajun/genealogy/16
