2 CONT :Bonaventure was listed as a widow in the 1710 census and was living alone. Jeanne had passed away a few months earlier at the age of about 60.≤ref>. The original census can be found at [http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.la
2 CONC c_reel_c9119/1315?r=0&s=4 Acadian Census microfilmC-9119 of the National Archives of Canada] “Acadie Recensements 1671 – 1752”, Images 1315-1318.≤/ref> 
2 CONT :He died on 3 May 1731 (at about 95 years of age according to the register) in Grand-Pré and was buried there the next day. ≤ref name=Burial/>≤ref name=Burial2/>≤ref name="DGFA"/>
