2 CONT ------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	unknown Death: 	1678 Port Royal Annapolis County Nova Scotia, Canada
2 CONT
2 CONT Germain was born in about 1646, as he was 25 on the 1971 census. He married Andree Brun (her 1st husband) in about 1668, in Port-Royal, Acadie. They are the parents of at least the following:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Germain (1669-1750) md Anne Pellerin 2) Pierre (1671-) md Marie Bourg 3) Catherine (1673-) md Martin Aucoin
2 CONT
2 CONT According to the 1671 Census of Port Royal:
2 CONT
2 CONT Germain Terriau, farmer, age 25 Andree Brun, age 25 Germain, age 2 5 cattle 2 sheep 2 arpents [of land]
2 CONT
