2 CONT 6. Germain Terriot was born in
2 CONT 6. Germain Terriot (d1.htm) was born in 1646 in Port-Royal and died in 1676 in Grand-Pré, NE.
2 CONT Germain married Andrée Brun, daughter of Vincent Brun and Marie Reine Breau, in 1666 in Port-Royal. Andrée was christened on 21 Aug 1646 in La Chaussée, Vienne, Poitou, France and died on 25 Jul 1727 in Port-Royal.
2 CONT Children from this marriage were:
2 CONT + 27 M i. Germain Terriot (d1.htm) was born about 1669 in Port-Royal and died on 4 Aug 1750 in Port-Lajoie, Ile-St-Jean.
2 CONT + 28 M ii. Pierre Terriot (d1.htm) was born about 1671 in Port-Royal.
2 CONT + 29 F iii. Catherine Terriot (d1.htm) was born about 1673 in Port-Royal.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2nd source see Jehan Terriot says Germaine died in 1680
2 CONT
