2 CONC te>≤/ref>
2 CONT Claude  passed away and  was buried at Annapolis Royal (formerly Port Royal) on September 17 1725 at 87 years of age.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-
