1 NOTE Feel free to use any of this information you wish to use, and share it with anyone else who is interested.
1 NOTE Claude Theriot (Jean) was born 1637 in France (Source: Acadian
2 CONT Descendants, Vol I, by Janet Jehn), and died September 17, 1725
2 CONT in Port Royal, Acadia (Source: Acadian Descendants, Vol I, by
2 CONT Janet Jehn). He married Marie Francoise Louise Gauterot Abt
2 CONT 1661 (Source: Acadian Descendants, Vol I, by Janet Jehn;
2 CONT w-boudre.ged), daughter of Francois Gauterot and Edmee LeJeune.
2 CONT While CLAUDE'S birth certificate is not available, the first
2 CONT Census of Acadia in 1671, records him to be 34 years of age at
2 CONT the time. It is therefore safe to assume that Claude was born
2 CONT ABT 1637'. This same census indicates that CLAUDE owned six
2 CONT cattles and one sheep. The Port Royal Acadian census of 1678-79
2 CONT indicates that CLAUDE TERRIOT and Marie Gautrot owned 3 acres
2 CONT of land, and 5 cattles. At the time, they had 3 boys age 16
2 CONT (born in 1662), age 9 (born in 1669), age 1 (born in 1677) and
2 CONT four girls; age 14 (born in 1664), age 12 (born in 1666), age 8
2 CONT (born in 1670) and age 4 (born in 1674). The children are not
2 CONT named in the Census. Children of Claude Theriot and Marie
2 CONT Gauterot are: Germain Theriot, born 1662 in Port Royal, Acadia;
2 CONT died July 29, 1737. Marie Elizabeth Theriot, born 1665 in Port
2 CONT Royal, Acadia; died Abt 1685. Marguerite Theriot, born 1667 in
2 CONT Port Royal, Acadia. Jean Theriot, born 1670 in Port Royal,
2 CONT Acadia; died Bef 1725. Anne Theriot, born 1672 in Port Royal,
2 CONT Acadia; died in Port Royal, Acadia. Jeanne Theriot, born 1674
2 CONT in Port Royal, Acadia; died 1751 in Port Royal, Acadia. Claude
2 CONT Theriot, born 1678 in Port Royal, Acadia; died October 1752 in
2 CONT Riviere aux Canards, Acadia. Marie Theriot, born 1679 in Port
2 CONT Royal, Acadia (Source: Acadian Descendants, Vol I, by Janet
2 CONT Jehn; p-hall.ged). Madeleine Theriot, born 1681 in Acadia
2 CONT (Source: Acadian Descendants, Vol I, by Janet Jehn). Pierre
2 CONT Theriot, born 1684 in Port Royal, Acadia (Source: Acadian
2 CONT Descendants, Vol I, by Janet Jehn; p-hall.ged). Elizabeth
2 CONT Theriot, born 1685 in Port Royal, Acadia; died March 27, 1735
2 CONT in Port Royal, Acadia. Joseph Theriot, born 1687 in Port Royal,
2 CONT Acadia. 24 xiii. Marie Theriot, born 1691 in Acadia (Source:
2 CONT Acadian Descendants, Vol I).
