2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT === Birth ===
2 CONT : Birth:  
2 CONT :: Date:  CA. 1654
2 CONT ::≤ref name="DGFA1488" />
2 CONT :: Note:  Pierre was 16 in Port Royal Census of 1671.
2 CONT === Occupation ===: Occupation:  Colonizer, Judge≤ref name="DGFA1488">White, Stephen A.,Patrice Gallant, and Hector-J Hébert. [[Space:Dictionnaire_généalogique_des_familles_acadiennes|''Dictionnaire Généalogique Des Familles Acadi
2 CONC ennes.'']] Moncton, N.-B.: Centre D'études Acadiennes, Université De Moncton, 1999, Print, p1488-1489.>≤/ref>
