2 CONT The family of Antoine LANDRY and Marie THIBODEAU
2 CONT
2 CONT [85552] LANDRY, Antoine (René le jeune & Marie BERNARD [10514])
2 CONT
2 CONT * married about 1681, from .. (Acadie)
2 CONT
2 CONT THIBODEAU, Marie1 (Pierre & Jeanne THÉRIAULT [85617])
2 CONT
2 CONT       1) Angélique, married about 1723 Joseph BABIN
2 CONT
2 CONT       2) Anne, married about 1703 Antoine LEBLANC
2 CONT
2 CONT       3) Antoine, married about 1705 Marie Blanche LEBLANC
2 CONT
2 CONT       4) François, married Grand-Pré (Saint-Charles-des-Mines) (Acadie) 1711-05-27 Marie Josephte DOUCET
2 CONT
2 CONT       5) Françoise, born about 1695 (white) or 1707 (sép. 1767), died 1767-10-03, buried 1767-10-04 Lavaltrie (Qc), married Grand-Pré (Saint-Charles-des-Mines) (Acadie) 1711-02-16 Pierre LEBLANC
2 CONT
2 CONT       6) Germain, married about 1722 Marie Cécile FOREST
2 CONT
2 CONT       7) Isabelle, married about 1703 Pierre HÉBERT dit LAPRADE
2 CONT
2 CONT       8) Jean, married about 1720 Madeleine MELANÇON
2 CONT
2 CONT       9) Joseph, born about 1701 (m 1745), married about 1727 Marie Marguerite FOREST, married Grand-Pré (Saint-Charles-des-Mines) (Acadie) 1745-01-11 Marie Josephte BOURG
2 CONT
2 CONT       10) Marguerite, married about 1706 Jacques HÉBERT
2 CONT
2 CONT       11) Marie Marguerite, married about 1701 Jean HÉBERT
2 CONT
2 CONT       12) Pierre, married about 1713 Marguerite FOREST
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.francogene.com/quebec--genealogy/085/085552.php
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT According to Paul Suprenant, Edna Landry's son, Antoine lived in Acadia before 1755 (the Great Upheaval).
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT 1686 Census
2 CONT
2 CONT Antoine LANDRY 26, Marie THIBODEAU 25; children: Marie 4, Antoine 2, Isabelle 1; 2 guns, 9 arpents, 8 cattle, 6 sheep, 10 hogs.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1693 Census
2 CONT
2 CONT Antoine LANDRY 33, Marie TIBAUDEAU 32, Marie 10, Antoine 9, Isabelle 7, Anne 5, Marguerite 4, Pierre 3, Francois 1; 15 cattle, 8 sheep, 6 pigs, 12 arpents, 1 gun 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1701 Census
2 CONT
2 CONT Antoine LANDRY, his wife. 6 boys, 5 girls, 8 arpents, 25 cattle, 25 sheep, 16 hogs, 1 gun. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1703 Census
2 CONT
2 CONT Antoine LANDRY, his wife, 2 boys, 2 girls, 1 arms hearer
2 CONT
2 CONT 1707 Census
2 CONT
2 CONT Antoine LANDRY, his wife, 7 boy less than 14; 1 arpent, 3 cattle, 8 sheep, 8 hogs. 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT It is possible that Antoine is the son of Rene Landry b. 1618 who is married to Perrine Bourg and not Rene Landry b. 1640. There is some speculation that Antoine is actually Rene Landry's, b. 1640, brother.
2 CONT --------------------
