2 CONT !BIRTH-PARENTS-MARRIAGES-CENSUS-DEATH: Stephen A. White, DI CTIONNAIRE GENEALOGIQUE DES FAMILLES ACADIENNES; 1636-1714 ; Moncton, New Brunswick, Centre d'Etudes Acadiennes, 1999 , 2 vols.; p. 919; own copy. #(39): Joseph married 1
2 CONC st (Dis pensation of descendants in Louisiana records) around 172 7 to Marguerite FOREST. He married 2nd (parents were name d in Register at Grand Pré) on 11 Jan 1745, at age 44 years , to Marie-Josephe BOURG (widow of Pierre-Jose
2 CONC ph GODIN di t Chatillon dit Préville. Joseph was on the 1763 census a t Oxford, MD. !EDUCATION: He was able to sign his name on his 2nd marriag e record in 1745. !PARENTS-MARRIAGES-CHILDREN-CENSUS-DEATH: Gregory A. Wood , A GUIDE 
2 CONC TO THE ACADIANS IN MARYLAND IN THE EIGHTEENTH AN D NINETEENTH CENTURIES; 1755-1899; Baltimore, Gateway Press , 1995; p. 146; own copy. Joseph LANDRY on Oxford, MD censu s in 1763 with Marie Joseph & six others. His wife Marie Jo s
2 CONC ephe BOURG was a widow on the 1767 census at New Orleans , LA, with three unmarried daughters: Madeleine, Marguerite , and Gertrude (Reference: Papeles procedentes de Cuba, Leg ajo 114). !BIRTH-MARRIAGE-CHILDREN-RESIDENCES-BURIAL:
2 CONC  Arsenault, H&G , p. 1200 (Grand Pre'), born in 1701. Deported to Oxford, M aryland, he settled at Donaldsonville, LA, where he was bur ied on 4 SEP 1783 [sic]. !MARRIAGE: Jehn's C&A claims 1st marriage to Marie or Margu erite FOR
2 CONC EST (her mother wasMarie GRANGER). A son of thi s first marriage, Etienne LANDRY, born ABT 1734 [sic], anot her Etienne, born ABT 1727 [?]. This 2nd Etienne married i n Maryland 1765 to Suzanne GODIN (Pierre GODIN & Marie Jose phe
2 CONC  BOURG), his step-sister. (Ref. Terrebonne Gen. Soc, vol . 2, no. 1, p. 43) !MARRIAGE: Was age 44 when he married the widow of Pierre G ODIN. Both his parents were already deceased, as washer mo ther [and father?] (SGA-3, 30a) in 
2 CONC the Baton Rouge, Acad. R ecords, vol. 1, p. 76. DEATH-BURIAL: Where did I get 1 OCT 1789?
