1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Sources=
2 CONT * [http://www.nosorigines.qc.ca/GenealogieQuebec.aspx?genealogie=Pierre_Lejeune&pid=19119&lng=fr&partID=19118 NosOrigines.qc.ca ID No: 19119]
2 CONT
2 CONT =Bio=
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Note:'''   Pierre Lejeune married Marie "La Cadette" Thibodeau. Marie's parents gave the first name of ''Marie'' to four of their daughters as it was customary in the Catholic faith  to give all girls the first name ''Mary or M
2 CONC arie'' to show respect for Jesus' mother depending on whether you were English Catholic or French Catholic respectively.  The girl's middle name was considered the christian given name and it was by the middle name that most where
2 CONC  called.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1678 Census
2 CONT
2 CONT Pierre LE JEUNE Marie THIBAUDEAU
2 CONT
2 CONT 3 acres 4 cattle
2 CONT
2 CONT 1686 Census
2 CONT
2 CONT Pierre LEJEUNE, dit Briars, 28; Marie TIBAUDEAU his wife 25; 6 guns, 1 arpents. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1693 Census
2 CONT
2 CONT Pierre LEJEUNE 37, Marie TIBEAUDEAU 30, Marie 6, Pierre 3, Jeanne 2; 10 cattle, 15 sheep, 7 pigs, 8 arpents, 2 guns
2 CONT
2 CONT 1698 Census
2 CONT
2 CONT Pierre LEJEUNE 48; Marie TIBAUDEAU (wife) 37; Marie 12; Pierre 9; Jeanne 8; Germain 5; Marguerite 3; Jean 1; 11 cattle, 14 sheep, 5 hogs, 10 1/2 arpents, 10 fruit trees, 1 gun. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1700 Census
2 CONT
2 CONT Pierre LEJEUNE 44; Marie THIBAUDEAU (wife) 37; Pierre 10; Germain 2; Jean Ig Marie 13; Jeanne 9; Marguerite 6; Anne 4: 8 cattle, 6 sheep, arpents, 2 guns. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1701 Census
2 CONT
2 CONT Pierre BRIART (sic LEJEUNE) 45, Marie TIBAUDEAU (wife) 34; Pierre 13, Germain 9, Jean 6, Marie 16, Jeanne 12, Marguerite 8, Rnne 6, Jacqueline 1; 1 gun, 9 cattle, 15 sheep, 5 hogs, 8 arpents. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1714 Census
2 CONT
2 CONT  Pierre LeJEUNE and wife, 3 sons, 3 daughters.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Pierre and Marie had 9 children
2 CONT
2 CONT 1 marie b 1686
2 CONT
2 CONT 2 pierre b 1689 m. jeanne benoit
2 CONT
2 CONT 3 jeanne b1690
2 CONT
2 CONT 4 germain b1693
2 CONT
2 CONT 5 marguerite b 1695
2 CONT
2 CONT 6 anne b1696
2 CONT
2 CONT 7 jean b 1697
2 CONT
2 CONT 8 catharine b 1699
2 CONT
2 CONT 9 joseph b 1704  m cecile pitre  
