2 CONT       12) Paul, married about 1730 Marie Josèphe DOIRON, married about 1758 Nathalie PITRE
2 CONT       13) Pierre, born about 1712 (m 1733), married Grand-Pré (Saint-Charles-des-Mines) (Acadie) 1733-08-03 Marie DOIRON, married Port Lajoie (Acadie) 1753-11-17 (dgfa,dag) or 1753-11-19 (fafd) Madeleine GAUTREAU
