2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Anne'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Anne Boudrot [Boudreau] was born about 1690, in Grand-Pré, Acadia, New France, her father, Claude Boudrot, was 28 and her mother, Anne Marie Thibodeau, was 27. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Joseph Hébert about 1709, in Grand-Pré, Acadia, New France. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 6 daughters.
2 CONT Marie Josèphe Hébert 1710–1770
