2 CONT == Biography ==Anne was born about 1694. She was the daughter of [[Boudrot-15|Claude Boudrot]] and [[Thibodeau-31|Anne Marie Thibodeau]]. She married Augustin Hebert, son of Jean Hebert and Anne Doucet, both deceased, 19 Sept1712 
2 CONC at Saint Charles des Mines. Anne's mother was also deceased at the time of her marriage. ≤ref>http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1870/562?r=0&s=5≤/ref>
