1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Boudrot-211
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth Boudrot aka Boudreau
2 CONT * Born 1696 in Grand Pre, Acadie, Nouvelle-France
2 CONT * Daughter of Claude Boudrot and Anne Marie Thibodeau
2 CONT * Sister of Claude Boudrot, Michel Boudrot, Joseph Boudrot, Anne Marie Boudrot, Marie Boudrot, Anne Boudrot, Marguerite Boudrot, Catherine Boudrot [half], Cecile Boudrot [half], Étienne Boudrot [half], Marie Anne Boudrot [half], P
2 CONC aul Boudrot [half], François Boudrot [half], Jean Boudrot [half], Pierre Boudrot [half], Françoise Boudrot [half], Marie Josephe (Boudreaux) Boudrot [half], Claire Boudrot [half], Anne Boudrot [half] and Charles Boudrot [half]	
2 CONT * Wife of Jacques LeBlanc — married 1715 in Acadiemap
2 CONT * Wife of Martin Aucoin — married 1723 in Acadie
2 CONT * Mother of Marie Josephe Blanche LeBlanc, Joseph (Leblanc) LeBlanc, Pierre LeBlanc, Alexis Aucoin, Marie Joseph Aucoin, Marie Marguerite Aucoin, Claude Aucoin, Anne Aucoin, Magdeleine Aucoin, Anne Aucoin and Elisabeth Aucoin
2 CONT * Died about 13 Sep 1756 at about age 60 in Grand Pré, Acadie, Colony of Nova Scotia
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth Boudrot was born about 1696 in Grand Pré, Acadia. She was the daughter of Claude Boudrot and Anne Marie Thibodeau.
2 CONT
2 CONT She first married Jacques LeBlanc, son of Jacques LeBlanc and Catherine Hébert about 1715 in Acadia.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following known children:
2 CONT
2 CONT #     Marie Josephe Blanche LeBlanc
2 CONT #     Joseph LeBlanc
2 CONT #     Pierre LeBlanc
2 CONT
2 CONT After she was widowed in 1720, Elisabeth subsequently remarried to Martin Aucoin, son of Martin Aucoin and Catherine Thériot.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following known children:
2 CONT
2 CONT #     Alexis Aucoin 
2 CONT #     Marie Joseph Aucoin 
2 CONT #     Marie Marguerite Aucoin 
2 CONT #     Claude Aucoin 
2 CONT #     Anne Aucoin 
2 CONT #     Magdeleine Aucoin 
2 CONT #     Anne Aucoin 
2 CONT #     Elisabeth Aucoin 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
