2 CONT
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Landry (b.1686) of Charles-des-Mines (Canning area):
2 CONT
2 CONT This Jean Baptiste married Marguerite Comeau at Saint-Charles-des-Mines, on 17th October, 1718. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ten children were born: Eustache (b.1719), Helene (b.1721), Euphrosie (b.1723), Prosper (b.1726 , Hilaire (b.1728, Joseph (b.1729), Clet (b.1731), Jean Baptiste (b.1733 , Simon (b.1735, & Marguerite (b.1738).
2 CONT
2 CONT After the deportation members of this family could be found at Saint-Servan-de-Saint-Malo, France.
2 CONT --------------------
