2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Jean Landry born 1693 of Charles-des-Mines(Canning area): This Jeanmarried, 1716, Claire LeBlanc(Rene and Ann Bourgeois); he married asecond time to Blanche LeBlanc. From his first Marriage Jean hadthirteen children (1717-1744 and
2 CONC  three children from second marriage(1755-1759). Some of the male children of Jean: Alexis, b1721, Mathurinb,c1730, and Etienne b 1731. By 1755-58 the family was to be found atPEI. Eventually, certain of them could be found at Bou
2 CONC logne-sur-Mer,France. Source: The Landrys of Old Acadia P 8
2 CONT
