2 CONT == Biography == 
2 CONT :Not much is known about Jean Landry, son of Claude Landry & Marie-Catherine Thibodeau. His birth date and location are guesses. According to Stephen White who cites P. Gallant, he married Claire LeBlanc, daughter of René Le Blanc
2 CONC  & Anne Bourgeois about 1716. He died during the deportations, between the censuses of 1756 and 1763.≤ref> White, Stephen A., Patrice Gallant, and Hector-J Hébert. [[Space:Dictionnaire_généalogique_des_familles_acadiennes|''Dictio
2 CONC nnaire Généalogique Des Familles Acadiennes.'']] Moncton, N.-B.: Centre D'études Acadiennes, Université De Moncton, 1999, Print, pp 935 & 988.
2 CONT :'''Claude Landry & Marie-Catherine Thibodeau'''::h. Jean (selone P. Gaudet) m (selon P. Gallant) GP janv ou Févr 1717 Claire Le Blanc (René & Anne Bourgeois); d. entre Rc 1756 & Rc 1763(20 juin).
2 CONT
2 CONT :'''René Le Blanc & Anne Bourgeois'''::j. Claire (Dècl BIM: Victoire) Rc Pennsylvanie 1763 vve); m (selon P. Gallant janv ou févr 1717 Jean Landry (Claude & Catherine Thibodeau≤/ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT ≤references />
