2 CONT [[Category:Grand-Pré, Acadie]]
2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT [[Category: Port-Royal, Acadie]]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT == Biography =='''Marie Madeleine Landry''' was born about 1701. She was the daughterof [[Landry-74|Claude Landry]] and [[Thibodeau-176|Marie-Catherine Thibodeau]]. She married Jean Daigle, son of Bernard Daigle and Marie Bourg 6 
2 CONC Nov 1721 at Saint Charles des Mines. Madeleine's mother was deceased at the time of her wedding.≤ref>http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1870/606?r=0&s=5≤/ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT :Father: Claude LANDRY b: ABT 1663 in Port Royal, Acadia 
2 CONT :Mother: Marie Catherine THIBODEAU b: ABT 1668 in Port Royal, Acadia
2 CONT
2 CONT :Marriage 1 Jean DAIGRE b: ABT 1698 in Kenescout, Pigiguit, Acadia
2 CONT :Married: 6 Nov 1721 in Grand Pré, Acadia 1 2
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:Madeleine DAIGRE b: 4 Sep 1722 in Grand Pré, Acadia c: 4 Sep 1722 inGrand Pré, Acadia:Judith DAIGRE b: 2 Nov 1723 in Grand Pré, Acadia c: 2 Nov 1723 in Grand Pré, Acadia:Marie Rose DAIGRE b: 15 Feb 1725 in Grand Pré, Acad
2 CONC ia c: 14 Mar 1725in Grand Pré, Acadia
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT ≤references />
2 CONT Title: Catholic Church Records, vol. 1a: Acadian Records, 1707-1748
2 CONT Author: Diocese of Baton Rouge
2 CONT Publication: Diocese, 1999, Note: The Registers of St. Charles aux Mines in Acadia, from Grand Pr, carried into exile to St. Gabriel Church of Iberville, LA.
2 CONT Page: p. 55:Note: Discrepancy with date in DICTIONNAIRE GÉNÉALOGIQUE DES FAMILLES ACADIENNES.
2 CONT Text: Jean Bapt. DAIGLE, son of Bernard DAIGLE & Marie BOURG, married 10 [sic] Nov 1721 Marie Magde leine LANDRY, daughter of Claude LANDRY & deceased Catherine THIBODOT. Witnesses: Claude LANDRY [signed]; Bernard DAIGRE [signed];
2 CONC  Charle DAIGRE; Pierre DOUCET [signed] (SGA-2, 252).
2 CONT
2 CONT Title: Dictionnaire Généalogique des Familles Acadiennes
2 CONT Author: Stephen A. WhitePublication: 2 vols., Moncton, New Brunswick: Centre d'Études Acadiennes, 1999
2 CONT Page: p. 448Text: Jean married 1st (Grand Pré Register) 6 [sic] Nov 1721 to Marie-Madeleine LANDRY, daughter of Claude & Catherine THIBODEAU.
