2 CONT == Biography =='''Claire Landry''' was born about 1705. She was the daughter of [[Landry-74|Claude Landry]] and [[Thibodeau-176|Marie-Catherine Thibodeau]]. She married Claude Comot, son of Jean Comot and Catherine Babin 11 Nov 17
2 CONC 21 at Saint Charles des Mines. Claire's mother was deceased at the time of her wedding. ≤ref>http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1870/606?r=0&s=5≤/ref>
