2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT == Biography == 
2 CONT '''Alexandre Thibodeau'''  was born about 1694 in Acadia, the 3rd child of Pierre Thibodeau and Anne Marie Bourg.
2 CONT About 1715, he married Francoise Benoit, daughter of Martin Benoit andMarie Chaussegros.   They settled in Pisiquit, Acadia.  They had 3 children:
2 CONT #Marguerite THIBODEAU
2 CONT #Marie Madeleine Josephe THIBODEAU
2 CONT #Anne THIBODEAU b: 8 Jan 1731 in Pisiguit, Acadia
2 CONT At some point around 1751, Alexandre and his wife fled to Isle St. Jean to escape deportment.
2 CONT
2 CONT Alexandre died in 1752 in Isle St. Jean, Acadia, at the age of 58.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Born''' 
2 CONT 1694
2 CONT Pisiquit, Acadia, Nova Scotia, Canada. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Died''' 
2 CONT ABT 1752. 
2 CONT Grand Anse, Ile St Jean, Quebec, Canada. Age: ABOUT 57-58. ≤ref>Source: [[#S54]]  Volume: Vol. 7 Sect. 1 : Rob-Tra; Page: 290 Volume: Vol. 7 Sect. 1 : Rob-Tra; Page: 290 Certainty: 0≤/ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Baptism:''' 
2 CONT 1694Age:≤ref>Source: [[#S54]]  Volume: Vol. 7 Sect. 1 : Rob-Tra; Page: 290Volume: Vol. 7 Sect. 1 : Rob-Tra; Page: 290 Certainty: 0≤/ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Buried''' 
2 CONT 19 JAN 1752. Ile Saint-Jean Acadie. ≤ref>Source: [[#S54]]  Volume: Vol. 7 Sect. 1 :Rob-Tra; Page: 290 Volume: Vol. 7 Sect. 1 : Rob-Tra; Page: 290 Certainty: 0≤/ref>
2 CONT
