2 CONT == Biography =='''Antoine Tibaudeau''' was born about 1699. He was the son of [[Thibodeau-33|Pierre Thibodeau]] and [[Bourg-40|Anne-Marie Bourg]]. When he was 26, Antoine married Suzanne Comau, age 20, daughter of Pierre Comau and
2 CONC  Suzanne Bezier, 28 May 1725 at Port Royal. Witnesses were Claudeand Antoine Tibaudeau, uncles of the groom, Pierre Comeau, father of the bride and Pierre Suret.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Sai
2 CONC nt-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-1870 (image 80) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1869/80?r=0&s=5≤/ref>≤ref>An Acadian Parish Remembered The Registers of St. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755 A
2 CONC ntoine Tibaudeau and Suzanne Comau marriage 28 May 1725 RG 1 volume 26 page 215 https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=1037≤/ref>
