1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT == Biography == :Marie Thibodeau was born about 1712 in Acadia. There isn't a record that shows who her parents were, but, Stephen White has concluded that she is the daughter of [[Thibodeau-33|Pierre Thibodeau]] and [[Bourg-40|An
2 CONC ne-Marie Bourg]]. They are marked uncertain. 
2 CONT :Marie married Michel Girouard about 1735. The couple had 4 known children: Amand, Marie Madeleine, Elisabeth and Francois. Marie died before 1 Jan 1752 in Acadia. Marie died before the census dated 1 January 1752.≤ref>"Dictionnai
2 CONC re Généalogique des Familles Acadiennes"; Stephen A. White; 2 vols; Moncton, NB: Centre d'Études Acadiennes, 1999; p.1512: No place or date of birth given."Marie (according to S. A. WHITE) daughter of Pierre THIBODEAU & Anne-Marie
2 CONC  BOURG." 
2 CONT :died before 1 January 1752≤/ref>
2 CONT == Research ==The following hasn't been verified. Stephen White doesn't give a date of birth or parents.
2 CONT '''Born''' 
2 CONT 11 JUN 1713. 
2 CONT ACADIA
2 CONT == Sources ==
