1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LVMX-47F
2 CONT Brief Life History of Agathe'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Agathe Thibodeau was born on 9 September 1711, in Port Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia, Canada as the daughter of Antoine Thibodeau. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Jean Boudrot on 4 October 1731, in Annapolis Royal, Nova Scotia, British North America. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1746, in her hometown, at the age of 35.
2 CONT
