2 CONT == Biography =='''Marie Joseph Tibaudot''' was born about 1708. She was the daughter of [[Thibodeau-1286|Antoine Thibodeau]] and [[Prejean-18|Marie Prejean]]. At age 23 she married Guillaume Hebert age 22, son of Michel Hebert and
2 CONC  Elisabeth Pellerin 26 April 1721 at Saint Charles des Mines, Grand-Pré, Acadia.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroissecatholique Saint-Charles-des-Mines (Grand-Pré, N.-É.) - 1869;  Canadiana, Heritage, Parish regis
