2 CONT == Biography =='''Zacharie Tibaudeau''' was born 18 Apr 1719. He was the son of [[Thibodeau-1286|Antoine Thibodeau]] and [[Prejean-18|Marie Prejean]]. He was baptized the same day at Port Royal. His godparents were Simon Leblanc a
2 CONC nd Jeanne Dupuis.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-1870(image 24) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1869/24?r=0&s=5≤/ref>
2 CONT He married Marie Josephe Girouard, daughter of Claude and Elisabeth Blanchard and widow of Charles Landry 11 February 1754 at Port Royal, Acadia. Witnesses were Joseph Tibodeau, Paul Tibodeau and Joseph Lanoue.≤ref>An Acadian Pari
2 CONC sh RememberedThe Registers of St. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755 RG 1 volume 26a page 506 https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=3495≤/ref>
2 CONT == Sources ==
