2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT [[Category: Port-Royal, Acadie]]
2 CONT == Biography =='''Cecile Thibaudault''' was born 27 Mar 1721. She was the daughter of[[Thibodeau-1286|Antoine Thibodeau]] and [[Prejean-18|Marie Prejean]]. She was baptized the same day at Port Royal. Her godparents were Joseph Pr
2 CONC ijean and Magdelaine Pellerin.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-1870 (image 43) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1869/43?r=0&s=5≤/ref
2 CONC >≤ref>An Acadian Parish Remembered The Registers of St. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755 Cecile Thibaudault baptism 27 March 1721 RG 1 volume 26 page 177 https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=858≤/ref>
2 CONT She married first, Joseph Bernard Godet, son of the late Bernard Godetand Marie Doucet 19 Jan 1748 in Port Royal, Acadia. Witnesses were Joseph Prijean, Fabien Tibodeau, Gregoire Godet and Gregoire Maillet≤ref>An Acadian Parish Re
2 CONC membered The Registers of St. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755Bernard Godet and Cecile Tibodeau marriage 19 February 1748  RG 1 volume 26a page 355 https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=2993≤/ref>
2 CONT She married second, Francois Robichaud, son of Jean and Marie Leger 6 Nov 1758 in Quebec, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT She passed away 14 April 1794 aged 73 years and was buried the next day at Becancour, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT ≤references />*BIRTH-CHRISTENING-PARENTS-MARRIAGES-DEATH-BURIAL: Stephen A. White, DICTIONNAIRE GENEALOGIQUE DES FAMILLES ACADIENNES; 1636-1714; Moncton, New Brunswick, Centre d'Etudes Acadiennes, 1999, 2 vols.; p. 1516
2 CONT * http://www.nosorigines.org/GenealogieQuebec.aspx?genealogy=Francois_Robichaud&pid=1144462&lng=en&partID=1144460
2 CONT
