2 CONT == Biography =='''Anne Thibaudault''' was born 17 Jan 1723. She was the daughter of [[Thibodeau-1286|Antoine Thibodeau]] and [[Prejean-18|Marie Prejean]]. She was baptized at birth by Marie Savoye and ceremonies took place the nex
2 CONC t day at Port Royal. Her godparents were Charles Giroir and Anne Bourgeois.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-1870 (image 58) http://heritage.canadiana.
2 CONC ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1869/58?r=0&s=5≤/ref>≤ref>An Acadian Parish Remembered The Registers of St. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755 Anne Thibaudault baptism RG 1 volume 26 page 189 https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian
2 CONC /archives.asp?ID=937≤/ref> NS Archives citation states born and baptized 18 Jan. Record statesbaptized 18 Jan, born "le jour precedant" (the previous day).
2 CONT She was seen on the 1763 Census of SC: age 30 years (sic), at home of Joseph (her younger brother?)
