2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-14100-183458560/guillaume-bourgeois-in-filae-family-trees Filae Family Trees] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jan 31 2023, 16:14:18 UTC''
