2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Joseph'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Joseph Germain was born on 4 February 1763, in Sainte-Famille-du-Cap-Santé, Québec, Canada, New France, her father, François Germaine, was 38 and her mother, Marie Madeleine Nobert, was 33. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Anselme Thibodeau on 30 April 1781, in Portneuf, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 11 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 7 December 1810, in Cap-Sante, Portneuf, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 47, and was buried in Cap-Sante, Portneuf, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources:'''
2 CONT [https://www.nosorigines.qc.ca/GenealogieQuebec.aspx?genealogie=Germain_Marie-Josephte&pid=522179 Nosorigines]
