2 CONT
2 CONT She married Jean Baptiste Côté on 31 January 1809, in Cap-Sante, Hampshire, Lower Canada, British North America.
2 CONT
2 CONT  She died on 11 March 1810, in Grondines, Portneuf, Lower Canada, British North America, at the age of 27.
