1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Richard-2235
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth (Isabel) Richard
2 CONT * Born 30 Apr 1742 in Grand Pré, Acadie, Colony of Nova Scotia
2 CONT * Daughter of Jacques Richard and Anne Granger
2 CONT * Sister of Joseph Richard [half], Charles Ignace Richard [half], Marie Anne Richard, Marguerite Joseph Richard, Magdeleine Joseph Richard, Anne Richard and Jean Baptiste Richard
2 CONT * Wife of Joseph Pierre Brasseur — married 1767 in Maryland Colony
2 CONT * Mother of Marguerite Brasseur, Joseph (Brasseau) Brasseur, Olivier Brasset and Marie Rose Brasseur
2 CONT * Died Jul 1807 at age 65 in St. Gabriel, Louisiana
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT *'''Sources:'''
2 CONT **"Acadian Immigrants to St Gabriel d'Iberville, 1767" - http://www.acadiansingray.com
2 CONT ***In report of Acadians at Newtown, Province of Maryland, Jul 1763
2 CONT ***In report on Acadians who settled at St.-Gabriel, 1767, listed as Isabel, age 24 
2 CONT ***St.-Gabriel, La Luisiana census, 1777, listed as unnamed, age 28[sic]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Notes:'''
2 CONT **Arrived in current day Louisiana in 1767, age 25
2 CONT ----
