2 CONT
2 CONT Magdeleine Brasseux daughter of Blaise Brasseux and Anne PREJEAN married Feb 3, 1801 to Alexandre LANDRY [son of Olivier LANDRY and Marie Magdeleine HEBERT of Attakapas] Witnesses were Olivier LANDRY and Alexander JEANSONNE (recor
2 CONC d was faded and very light) Father Pedro deZamora
2 CONT ___________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT Magdelaine Brasseaux widow of Alexandre LANDRY  inhabitant  at la cote gelee; native of St. Landry Parish of Opelousas (major daughter of Blaise Brasseaux and Anne PREJEAN) married between November 1-15, 1825 John William Smith - 
2 CONC of this parish; native of Maryland (major son of John SMITH and Elisabeth RANY). Witnesses were Louise GRANGE, Fabien LANDRY, John GREIG, William GREIG. Rev Marcel Borella, assistant priest of St. Martin Father Gabriel Isabey. St.
2 CONC  Martinville Church
