2 CONT
2 CONT Marguerite Brasseaux widow of William Woods and daugther of Blaise Brasseaux and Anne PREJEAN married June 16, 1823 Francois RICHARD of Opelousas. Opelousas Courthouse Marriage #24
2 CONT Helene Brasseaux daughter of Blaise Brasseaux and Anne PREJEAN was baptized on August 13, 1780. Sponsors were Amand PREJEAN represented by Charles COMOT and Anastasie SAVOIE. Father L.M. Grumeau
2 CONT ___________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT Helene Brasseaux [record has Brasseuse - the feminine form of Brasseaux] daughter of Blaise Brasseaux and Anne PREJEAN married Jan 8 1798 to Francois RICHARD [of Acadia] son of Pierre RICHARD and Marguerite DUGAT. Witnesses were J
2 CONC ean Baptiste RICHARD, Pierre RICHARD and Charles CORMIER. Father Pedro de Zamora.
2 CONT ___________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT Ellen BRASSEUX married to Francois RICHARD. Children Francois fils; Sidalise married to Valcourt DELHOMME; Alexandre; Eugenie married to Joseph L. RICHARD; Zelig age 16; Merante age 13; Aureline age 3. All named in Succession date
2 CONC d May 1823. Opelousas Court House succession #308
