2 CONT Last Changed: March 17, 2021 by 
2 CONT Custom Fact • 
2 CONT Unknown Parents
2 CONT The names of Edmee's parents are unknown. All we know is that Edmee is most likely the sister of Catherine Lejeune, since their descendants share the mtDNA haplogroup U6a7a [European descent]. Please do not add Pierre Lejeune as t
2 CONC heir father since this has never been proven. 
2 CONT Last Changed: April 8, 2021 by 
