2 CONT [[Category: Port-Royal, Acadie]]
2 CONT == Biography ==:Jeanne Corporon, daughter of [[Corporan-2|Jean Corporon]] and [[Savoie-55|Francoise Savoie]], was born about 1673 in Port-Royal.≤ref name="DGFA"/> She died there 11 Aug 1735 and was buried the next day. ≤ref name="
2 CONC DGFA"> "Dictionnaire Généalogique des Familles Acadiennes"; Author: Stephen A. White; Publication: 2 vols., Moncton, New Brunswick: Centre d'Études Acadiennes, 1999; p. 411*c. Jeanne n v 1673 (Rc PR 1686 12a, 1693 20a, 1698 21a [s
2 CONC ic], 1700 27a); m v 1691 Antoine Hébert (Etienne & Marie Gaudet); d/s Rg PR 11/12aout 1735 70a env (sic).* Jeanne CORPORON died/was buried on 11/12 Aug 1735, age around 70 years (sic) (Register Port Royal).≤/ref> 
2 CONT :She married [[Hebert-401|Anthoine Hebert]] about [1691] ≤ref name="DGFA"/> 
2 CONT :[http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=katheriot&id=I1855 Children] Note: all born in Port-Royal, Acadie
2 CONT # Louis (dit Baguette) Antoine HEBERT b: Abt 1692
2 CONT # Marie HEBERT b: Abt 1694
2 CONT # Agnes HEBERT b: Abt 1696
2 CONT # Madeleine HEBERT b: Abt 1699
2 CONT # Marie Anne HEBERT b: Abt 1701
2 CONT # Pierre l'ainé HEBERT b: 30 Aug 1703
2 CONT # Charles Paul HEBERT b: Abt Dec 1706
2 CONT # Pierre le jeune HEBERT b: 13 May 1708
2 CONT # Marie Marthe HEBERT b: 12 Jul 1710
2 CONT # HEBERT b: Abt 1711
