2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Corporon info per Louviere:
2 CONT Birth: circa 1677 at Port Royal, Acadia ... The son of Jean Corporon and Francoise Savoie.
2 CONT Marriage: circa 1702 to: Marie Pinet, daughter of Phillipe Pinet and Catherine Herbert at Port Royal.
2 CONT
2 CONT Eustache Corporon is 1 of 7 children listed.
2 CONT Death: 16 March 1741 at Louisbourg, Ile Royal; reported around 70 years. 
2 CONT Note: 1741 - 70 = 1671 ... Is that close enough to 1677 to be "born circa 1677" ?
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT * White, Stephen A., Patrice Gallant, and Hector-J Hébert. [[Space:Dictionnaire_généalogique_des_familles_acadiennes|''Dictionnaire Génalogique Des Familles Acadiennes.'']] Moncton, N.-B.: Centre D'études Acadiennes, Université De
