2 CONT == Biography ==:Martin Corporon, son of Jean Corporon and Francoise Savoie, was born about 1687 in Port-Royal, Acadie. He died before 27 July 1750 in Acadie. Martin married Cecile Joseph about 1708 also in Acadie. He next married 
2 CONC Marie Josephe Viger about 1718.≤ref>BIRTH-PARENTS-CENSUS-MARRIAGES-DEATH:  White, Stephen A., Patrice Gallant, and Hector-J Hébert. Dictionnaire Généalogique Des Familles Acadiennes. Moncton, N.-B.: Centre D'études Acadiennes, Uni
2 CONC versité De Moncton, 1999, Print., p. 1566≤/ref>
