2 CONT == Biography =='''Anne Pellerin''' was born about 1684, at Port Royal, Acadia. She was the daughter of Etienne Pellerin and Jeanne Savoye. She was age 3 onthe 1686 census of Port Royal.
2 CONT She married first to Abraham Brun about 1701 in Port Royal, Acadia ≤ref>Source: [[#DGFA]] Note:  No place given.≤/ref>
2 CONT Children of Marie Anne Pellerin and Abraham Brun≤ref>Source: [[#KTR]]≤/ref># Marie Madeleine BRUN b: 13 Nov 1702 in Port Royal, Acadia c: 13 Nov 1702 in Port Royal, Acadia# Marie Josephe BRUN b: 25 Dec 1704 in Port Royal, Acadia c
2 CONC : 30 Dec 1704 in Port Royal, Acadia# Charles BRUN b: 4 Nov 1706 in Port Royal, Acadia c: 4 Nov 1706 in Port Royal, Acadia# Marie Anne BRUN b: 7 Apr 1708 in Port Royal, Acadia c: 29 Apr 1708 in Port Royal, Acadia# Marguerite BRUN 1
2 CONC  b: 14 Nov 1709 in Port Royal, Acadia c: 15 Nov 1709 in Port Royal, Acadia# Marguerite BRUN b: 8 Jan 1711 in Port Royal, Acadia c: 9 Jan 1711 inPort Royal, Acadia# Joseph BRUN b: 18 Dec 1712 in Port Royal, Acadia c: 20 Dec 1712 in
2 CONC  Port Royal, Acadia
2 CONT She married second, Laurent Doucet, son of Laurent Doucet and Jeanne Babin 12 January 1722 at Annapolis Royal (formerly Port Royal). There was a dispensaton for 4-4 consanguinity. Signed by Bernard Godet, Jean Doucect and Simon Le
2 CONC Blanc.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-1870 (image 179) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1869/179?r=0&s=5≤/ref>≤ref>An Acadian Paris
2 CONC h Remembered The Registers ofSt. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755 Laurent Doucet and AnnePellerin marriage RG 1 volume 26 page 328 https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=1357≤/ref> 
2 CONT Children of Marie Anne Pellerin and Laurent Doucet≤ref>Source: [[#KTR]]≤/ref># Michel DOUCET b: 30 Nov 1722 in Port Royal, Acadia c: 30 Nov 1722 inPort Royal, Acadia
2 CONT # Marguerite DOUCET b: ABT 1724 in Port Royal, Acadia
2 CONT # Laurent DOUCET III b: 1 May 1727 in Port Royal, Acadia
2 CONT CENSUS: 1686, Port Royal: Estienne PELLERIN 40, Jeanne SAVOYE 29; children: Magdelaine 10, Marie 8, Pierre 5, '''Anne 3''', Jean-Baptiste 1;3 arpents, 8 cattle, 12 sheep, 8 hogs. 
2 CONT
