2 CONT {{Acadian}} 
2 CONT == Biography =='''Jean Baptiste Pellerin''' was born around 1685. He was the son of [[Pellerin-2|Étienne Pellerin]] and [[Savoie-11|Jeanne Savoie]]. He was age 1 on the 1686 census of Port Royal.
2 CONT He married Marie Martin, daughter of Pierre Martin and the late Anne Petitous 11 February 1710 at Port-Royal.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-1870 (im
2 CONC age 145) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1869/145?r=0&s=5≤/ref>≤ref>An Acadian Parish Remembered TheRegisters of St. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755 Jean Baptist Pellerin and Marie Martin marriage RG 1
2 CONC  volume 26 page 297 https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=1259≤/ref> They had sixchildren, including two sons who married into the Girouard and Bourg families.  Two of their daughters married into the Doucet and R
2 CONC aymond families. 
2 CONT
2 CONT # Marguerite PELLERIN 1711-1764
2 CONT # Pierre PELLERIN 1713-1714
2 CONT # Marie PELLERIN 1715-1793
2 CONT # Pierre PELLERIN 1717-/1781
2 CONT # Jean Baptiste PELLERIN 1719-1805
2 CONT # Agathe PELLERIN 1723-1764
2 CONT
