2 CONT {{Acadian}} 
2 CONT == Biography =='''Charles Pellerin''' was born about 1690. He was the son of [[Pellerin-2|Étienne Pellerin]] [[Savoie-11|Jeanne Savoie]]. 
2 CONT Charles was age 3 on the 1693 census of Port Royal: Estienne Pelerin 46, Jeanne Savoye his wife 35, Marie 13, Pierre 11, Anne 9, Jean-Baptiste 8, '''Charles 3''', Bernard 2; 15 cattle, 20 sheep, 12 hogs, 16 arpents, 1 gun.
2 CONT At age 27 [sic] he married Magdelaine Robichaud, age 22, daughter of Prudent Robichaux and Henriette Petitpas 20 Jan 1725 at Port Royal. Hisfather was deceased by this date. Witnesses were Baptiste Pellerin, brother of the groom a
2 CONC nd Germain Savoye, his maternal uncle.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-1870 (image 74) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1869/74?r=0&
2 CONC s=5≤/ref>≤ref>An Acadian Parish Remembered The Registers of St. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755 Charles Pellerin and Magdelaine Robichaux marriage RG 1 volume26 page 205 https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.as
2 CONC p?ID=1011≤/ref>
2 CONT Family Charles Pellerin and Madeleine Robichaud in full (8 children) checked with PRDH ≤ref>PRDH Children of the couple Charles Pellerin andMadeleine Robichaud . f 1726-10-17 Port Royal URSULE deaths 1797-07-11 Québec . f 1729-05-
2 CONC 01 Port Royal ANNE HELENE deaths 1799-08-21 Québec . m 1731-06-10 Port Royal CHARLES deaths 1799-07-17 Québec married on 1773-09-20 L'Assomption Marie-Monique Dugas . f 1733-08-22 Port Royal married to Mary Magdalene JOSEPH DOUCET
2 CONC  on 8-4-1771 Quebec . f Acadie 1735 ANNE married to Jean Lacroix-Thibodeau before 1759-11-01 Acadie . m 1739-05-02 JOSEPH 6-2-1797 Quebec and death . f 1741-09-26 Port Royal ELISABETH married to Martin Schinckle 9-5-1774 Quebec . 
2 CONC f about 1746 MARIE Vénérande Port Royal Wedding 1771-11-25 Quebec-FrancoisRenvoise Sanchagrin ≤/ref> 
2 CONT
2 CONT Inh /Death.  Death: 1789-08-01 ≤ref>Nos Origines cites Source: death S. White and≤/ref>Burial: 1789-08-02 Québec ≤ref>Title: Programme de recherche en démographie historique; Note: Individual information.≤/ref>Burial: Source:PRDH 
2 CONC makes no mention of death
