2 CONT [[Category: Port-Royal, Acadie]]
2 CONT ==Biography=='''Bernard Pellerin''' was born about 1691 in Port-Royal, Acadie. He was the son of Etienne Pellerin and Jeanne Savoye. He was age 2 on the 1693 census of Port Royal. He married Marguerite Godet, daughter of Pierre Go
2 CONC det and Marie Blanchard, on 27 Nov 1713 in Port-Royal.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-1870 (image 168) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_r
2 CONC eel_c1869/168?r=0&s=5≤/ref>≤ref>An AcadianParish Remembered The Registers of St. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755 Bernard Pellerin and Marguerite Godet marriage RG 1 volume26 page 307 https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadia
2 CONC n/archives.asp?ID=1295≤/ref>
