2 CONT == Biography =='''Alexandre Pellerin''' was born around 1694. He was the son of  [[Pellerin-2|Étienne Pellerin]] [[Savoie-11|Jeanne Savoie]]. He was age 5on the 1698 census of Port-Royal. 
2 CONT He married Jeanne Godet, daughter of Pierre Godet and Marie Blanchard 13 January 1716 at Port Royal. SIgned by Pierre Godet, B. Godet and Michelle Tibeau.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean
2 CONC -Baptiste (Port-Royal, N.-É.)-1870 C-1870 (image 173) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1869/173?r=0&s=5≤/ref>≤ref>An Acadian Parish Remembered The Registers of St. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755 Alexan
2 CONC dre Pellerin and Jeanne Godetmarriage RG 1 volume 26 page 316 https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=1319≤/ref>
2 CONT
