2 CONT # Pierre PELLERIN 1718-
2 CONT # Marie Josephe PELLERIN 1720-# Francois PELLERIN 1722-/1763 m. 7 February 1745, Port Royal, Acadia,to Ursule DUPUIS
2 CONT # Madeleine PELLERIN 1724-# Charles PELLERIN ca 1726- m. 1 abt. 1755, Acadia, to Marie THIBODEAUm. 2 16 August 1757, Port Lajoie, Isle St. Jean, Acadia, to MadeleineDingle
