2 CONT In 1752, Francois Chiasson, Anne Doucet(wife) and their children: Jean,Francois, Joseph, Louis, Chrisostome, Anne, and Marie Chiasson wereresidents of St. Pierre-du-Nord on the island of Ilse St. Jean. OnJanurary 23,1759, Francois
2 CONC  Chiasson, widower of Anne Doucet and his sonsdisembarkered at St. Malo from one of the "five Ships". After the deathof their father in 1759, Louis and Chisostome Chiasson went to residewith their brother, Jean Baptiste Ciasson, a
2 CONC t Parame.
2 CONT
