2 CONT **1671 Acadie Census - shown to be 62 years old which estimates birth c.1609.
2 CONT **https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Bourg-126
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Notes:
2 CONT **Antoine Bourg, the patriarch of the Bourg family in Acadia, was born in France around 1609. We have no proof of his birthplace, but some believe he was born in Martaizé, in the province of Poitou (today in the department of Vien
2 CONC ne).  Regardless, we know that Antoine came to Acadia in the early 1640s, or even earlier. 
2 CONT
2 CONT **Antoine married Antoinette Landry around 1642, who gave him at least eleven children.
2 CONT
2 CONT **Evidence needed to support https://www.geni.com/people/Simon-Martaize-Bourg/6000000180764011853?through=6000000001304143148 & https://www.geni.com/people/Helene-Le-Comte/6000000180763961834?through=6000000180764011853 as parents
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT **Last name also spelled "Borg", which may or may not be a typo...  Name of whole family is spelled Bourc on 1671 and 1686 Acadian Censuses.  Name is spelled Bourg on Father d'Entremont's translation of the 1678 Census.
2 CONT
2 CONT **Antoine's parents are not known
2 CONT
2 CONT **Birth of 1609 is calculated according to the 1671 & 1686 census.
2 CONT
2 CONT **Antoine's specific birthplace has not been identified. Suggestions include Loudun, Vienne, Poitou-Charentes and Martaizé in the Province of Poitou (which is today Vienna).
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT The family of Antoine BOURG and Antoinette LANDRY
2 CONT
