2 CONT #       2) Marie, born about 1645 (rec. 1671, rec. 1686, rec. 1693, rec. 1698) or 1644 (rec. 1699), buried 1730-09-19 Port-Royal (Acadie), married about 1661 Vincent BRAULT 
2 CONT #       3) Jean, ploughman (laboureur), born about 1647 (rec. 1671), 1646 (rec. 1671, rec. 1686) or 1653 (rec. 1693), died between census 1693 and census 1698, married about 1667 Marguerite MARTIN
2 CONT #       4) Bernard, ploughman (laboureur), born about 1648/1649 (rec. 1671), 1650 (rec. 1686), 1651 (rec. 1699) or 1647 (rec. 1701), died before 1726 Port-Royal (bim) (Acadie), married about 1670 Françoise BRUN
2 CONT #       5) Martin, born about 1650 (rec. 1671, rec. 1686) or 1658 (rec. 1699), died Cobequid (bim) (Acadie), married about 1675 Marie POTET
2 CONT #       6) Jeanne1, born about 1653 (rec. 1671), married about 1673 Jean Antoine BÉLIVEAU
