2 CONC e Martin4) Bernard (1648-) md Francoise Brun5) Martin (1650-) md Marie Potet6) Jeanne (1653-) md Jean-Antoine Belliveau7) Renee (1655-1689) md Charles Boudreau8) Huguette (1657-) md Sebastian Brun9) Jeanne (1659-) md Pierre Comeau
2 CONC 10) Abraham (1662-) md Marie-Sebastienne11) Marguerite (1667-1727) md Louis Allain; Please note that Stephen A White places his death as between 5 October 1687 and 1693. Also according to SAW, he was alive on the 1686 census but A
2 CONC ntoinette is listed as a widow on the 1693 census.Antoine and Antoinette are the grandparents of Joseph Theriault and Euphrosine Terriot, through their daughter Marie. ::  https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/144085816/antoine-bour
