2 CONC ival). !CHRISTENING: Information from Beauregard, Dictionnaire Genealogique l'Ancienne Acadia, available on the Internet at http://www.cam.org/beaur/dgaa/dgaa-b4.html !MARRIAGE: Information from Beauregard, Dictionnaire Genealogiq
2 CONC ue l'Ancienne Acadia, available on the Internet at http://www.cam.org/beaur/dgaa/dgaa-b4.html (establishes the marriage but gives no date). !DEATH: Information not found; assumed to be at Port Royal. !BURIAL: Information not found
