2 CONT The following was acquired from <http://www.geocities.com/bourque_ca/antoine.html>:
2 CONT
2 CONT BOURG GENEALOGY -- Antoine Bourg
2 CONT
2 CONT Antoine Bourg and Antoinette Landry had thirteen children for which there are records at Port Royal, starting about 1644. The children were:A)Francoise; B)Marie; C)Jean; D)Bernard; E)Martin; F)Marie-Jeanne; G)Renee; H)Huguette; I)
2 CONC Jeanne; J)Abraham; K)Michel; L)Madeleine; M)Marguerite.
2 CONT
2 CONT A) Francois Bourg was baptised in 1644 in Port Royal. In 1665 he married Marguerite Boudrot, born 1648 in Port Royal. Marguerite was the daughter of Michel Boudrot, born 1601 in France, and his wife, Michelle Aucoin. Francois Bour
2 CONC g and Marguerite Boudrot had at least six children: Michel (1665), Marie (1668), Alexandre (1671), Pierre (1681), Anne (1683), and Marguerite. They are direct ancestors three times to Sam Myers who married Mary Alfreda Bourque, tw
2 CONC ice through daughter Marguerite who married Martin Richard and once through son Michel (1665). After Francois' death, widow Marguerite nee Boudrot married Jean Babineau and had two more children.
2 CONT
2 CONT B) Marie Bourg was baptised in 1645 in Port Royal. In 1661, at Port Royal, she married Vincent Brau (Brault). Vincent was born in 1631 in France. Vincent arrived in Acadia around 1652. They are direct ancestors of Sam Myers who ma
2 CONC rried Mary Alfreda Bourque, through their son Pierre. Marie and Vincent has eleven children: Marie (1662), Antoine (1666), Marguerite (1668), Pierre (1670), Anne (1672), Francois(1674), Jean (1675), Marie (1677), Jeanne (1680), Re
2 CONC ne (1683), Elizabeth-Suzanne (1686).
2 CONT
2 CONT C) Jean Bourg was baptised in 1647. He established himself at Cobequid.
2 CONT
2 CONT D) Bernard Bourg was baptised in 1649. He married Francoise Brun.
2 CONT
2 CONT E) Martin Bourg was baptised in 1650.
2 CONT
2 CONT F) Marie-Jeanne Bourg was baptised in 1653 at Port Royal. About 1671 she married Jean-Antione Belliveau, born 1652 in Port Royal. Jean-Antoine was recorded as being at Port Toulouse, Ile Royale in 1715 and at Tracadie, Ile St. Jea
2 CONC n in 1728. Jean-Antoine was the son of Antoine Belliveau and Marie-Andree Gueguen (Guyon), they arrived in Acadia in 1645 from France. Marie-Jeanne Bourg and Jean-Antoine Belliveau are direct ancestors of Mary Alfreda Burke once a
2 CONC nd Sam Myers twice.
2 CONT
2 CONT G) Renee Bourg was baptised in 1655. She married Charles Boudrot, brother of Marguerite Boudrot who married Renee's brother, Francois (brother and sister married sister and brother).
2 CONT
2 CONT H) Huguette Bourg was baptised in 1657. She married Sebastien Brun.
2 CONT
2 CONT I) Jeanne Bourg was baptised in 1659. About 1677 she married Pierre Comeau, born 1653 in France. Pierre Comeau was one of nine children of Pierre Comeau and Rose Boyol. They arrived in Acadia in 1656. Jeanne Bourg and Pierre Comea
2 CONC u are direct ancestors through daughter Madeleine Comeau, born 1686, of Mary Alfreda Bourque once and direct ancestor through daughter Jeanne Comeau, born 1682, to Sam Myers once.
2 CONT
2 CONT J) Abraham Bourg was baptised in 1662. About 1683, he married Marie Brun. They are the direct ancestors the all male line to Mary Alfreda Bourque. They are the direct ancestors through the all male line to Edouard Bourque and subj
2 CONC ect of the next generation.
2 CONT
2 CONT K) Michel Bourg was baptised in 1665.
2 CONT
2 CONT L) Madeleine Bourg was baptised in 1666. She married Pierre Leblanc.
2 CONT
2 CONT M) Marguerite Bourg was baptised in 1667.
2 CONT ------------------------------------------------
