2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT The family of François BOURG and Marguerite BOUDREAU
2 CONT
2 CONT [46532] BOURG, François (Antoine & Antoinette LANDRY [46444]), ploughman (laboureur), born about 1643 (rec. 1671), died between census 1678 and census 1686
2 CONT
2 CONT * married about 1665, from .. (Acadie)
2 CONT
2 CONT BOUDREAU, Marguerite (Michel & Michelle AUCOIN [84284]), born about 1648 (rec. 1671), 1649 (rec. 1693), 1648 (rec. 1698-1699) or 1651 (rec. 1701), buried 1718-11-09 Port-Royal (Acadie)
2 CONT
2 CONT       1) Alexandre, land-surveyor, judge and royal notary (arpenteur juré, juge et notaire royal), born short after rec. 1671 (rec. 1678, rec. 1693) Port-Royal (Acadie), died 1760 Richibouctou (New Brunswick), Canada, married abou
2 CONC t 1694 Marguerite MELANÇON
2 CONT
2 CONT       2) Anne dite Jeanne, married about 1700 Charles MELANÇON
2 CONT
2 CONT       3) Madeleine, married about 1693 Pierre MAISONNAT dit BAPTISTE, married about 1697 Pierre LEBLANC
2 CONT
2 CONT       4) Marguerite, married about 1691 Martin RICHARD
2 CONT
2 CONT       5) Michel dit Michaud, married about 1689 Élisabeth MELANÇON
2 CONT
