2 CONT François Bourg BIRTH	1644 Canada DEATH	1684 (aged 39–40) Canada BURIAL	 Garrison Graveyard Annapolis Royal, Annapolis County, Nova Scotia, Canada  MEMORIAL ID	139694783 · View Source
2 CONT
2 CONT MEMORIAL PHOTOS 0 FLOWERS 5 Francois is the son of Antoine Bourg and Antoinette Landry. He was born between 1643-1644 and died between 1682-1686. He married Marguerite Boudrot in 1665. They are the parents of the following:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Michel Bourg (1665-1714) md Elisabeth Melanson 2) Marguerite-Marie Bourg (1668-) md Richard Martin 3) Alexandre Bourg (1671-1759) md Marguerite Melanson 4) Madeleine Bourg (1677-) md (a) Pierre Leblanc and (b) Pierre Maisonnat 
2 CONC 5) Anne-Jeanne Bourg (1684-1750) md Charles Melanson
2 CONT
