2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Francois Bourg was born in 1644, the son of Antoine Bourg and AntoinetteLandry. About 1665 he married Marguerite Boudrot. Born in 1648,Marguerite was the daughter of Michel Boudrot and Michelle Aucoin. Francois established himself
2 CONC  in Port Royal where he died about 1684. His widow married Jean Babineau about 1691. Children: Michel, b. 1665; Marie, b. 1668; Alexandre, b. 1671; Pierre, b.1681; Anne, b. 1683. Re: Martin, Lucien and Melba "Remember Us" Page 69-
2 CONC 70 1671 Acadian Census: Francois Bourc 28, wife marguerite Boudrot 23:Children: Michel, b. 1665; Marie, b. 1668, cattle 15, sheep
2 CONT
2 CONT
