2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT [[Category:Port-Royal, Acadie]]
2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT == Biography =='''NOTICE''': this profile is protected by the [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Project:Acadians Acadian Project] because of frequent duplication. Please contact the Acadian Project before making any substantive chang
2 CONC es. Thanks for helping make WikiTree the best site for accurate information.
2 CONT François Bourque, the eldest of Antoine's children, was born around 1643. He married Marguerite Boudrot, daughter of Michel Boudrot and Michelle Aucoin, around 1665. Before his untimely death, around 1685, François Bourque had sev
2 CONC en children, the eldest of whom bore the name ofhis maternal grandfather. "
2 CONT "François Bourque, l'aîné des enfants d'Antoine, est né vers 1643.Celui-ci a épousé vers 1665 Marguerite Boudrot, fille de Michel Boudrot et de Michelle Aucoin. Avant sa mort prématurée, survenue vers 1685, François Bourque a eu s
2 CONC ept enfants, dont l'aîné portait le prénom de son grand-père maternel."≤ref>White, Stephen A. La généalogie des trente-sept familles hôtesses des "Retrouvailles 94", Les Cahiers de la Société historique acadienne, vol. 25, nos 2 e
2 CONC t 3 (1994).Bourque, p. 1,  [https://www.umoncton.ca/umcm-ceaac/node/55  37 Families]≤/ref>
2 CONT He lived in Port Royal in 1671 with Marguerite and two children.≤ref>[http://www.acadian-cajun.com/1671cens.htm 1671 Census]≤/ref>  By 1678 he still had 15 cattle, but now had 8 arpents of land.  Five children ranging from age 13 
2 CONC to 1 are present.≤ref>[http://www.acadian-cajun.com/1678cens.htm 1678 Census]≤/ref>  In all, he had seven children:≤ref>White, Stephen A.  Dictionnaire Généalogique des Familles Acadiennes” 2 vols., Moncton, New Brunswick: Centre 
2 CONC d'Études Acadiennes, 1999. p. 223≤/ref>
2 CONT # Michel (dit Michaud) BOURG b: Abt May 1666 
2 CONT # Marie BOURG b: Abt 1668
2 CONT # Alexandre (dit Bellehumeur) BOURG b: Abt 1671
2 CONT # Marguerite BOURG b: Abt 1673
2 CONT # Madeleine BOURG b: Abt 1677
2 CONT # Pierre BOURG b: Abt 1683
2 CONT # Anne dite Jeanne BOURG b: Abt 1684
2 CONT He died after 1684 when his last child was born, and before the 1686 census, as his family was not listed.  His widow, Marie Boudrot marriedto Jean Babineau in the 1693 Census, already had a child age 1.  Francois' son Pierre Bour
2 CONC g (age 10) was living in the Babineau household. No mention of youngest daughter Anne.  ≤ref>[http://www.acadian-cajun.com/1693cens.htm 1693 Census]≤/ref>
2 CONT == Sources ==
