2 CONC d L-13-30) lists a family of 2 children; "Genealogie de l'ancienne Acadie, BO" pg 9 & 14 pg 15 shows family with 2 children.
2 CONT <http://www.kencrouse.com/stories/alfred3.htm> shows that he remarried Marguerite Robichaud 1680 at Port Royal, Acadia; copy of this source filed L-13-30.
