2 CONC ritten in French) pgs 133 - 140 4. Bona Arsenault, Histoire et Genealogie des Acadiens, (Ottawa, Can:, Editions Lemeac, 1978), in custody of the Dallas Public Library, Dallas, Texas. 4. The 1671 Acadian Census 5. He arrived in Aca
2 CONC dia, 1636, ship: "St. Jehan". He and Antoinette Landry had 14 children.
