1 NOTE A short bio of Antoine Bourg acquired from the internet (copy filed L-13-30).
2 CONT Married abt 1667 Marguerite Martin (b. abt 1639/51, died 24 buried 25-04-1707 at Port Royal, Acadia, Canada), (dau of Pierre & Catherine Vigneau) at Cobequid; sources: A short bio of Antoine Bourg acquired from the internet (copy 
2 CONC filed L-13-30); <http://members.tripod.com/~CyberBart/bourque.htm> (copy filed L-13-30);
2 CONT <http://www.genealogie.com/dgaa/dgaa-b4.html> (copy filed L-13-30) lists a family of 8 children; <http://membres.lycos.fr/ancetre/bour.htm> (copy filed L-13-30 also in his father's internal textfile); "Genealogie de l'ancienne Aca
2 CONC die, BO" pg 14, pg 16-17 shows family with 8 children;
2 CONT <http://home.attbi.com/~sodapop68/webtree/pafg52.htm> (copy filed L-13-30).
2 CONT 1686 Census of Port Royal shows family as follows:  Jean BOURC 40, Marguerite MARTIN; children: Anne 18, Marguerite 16, Marie 13, Isabelle 10, Magdeleine 8, Catherine 6, Jean-Baptiste 3; 1 gun, 12 arpents, 16 cattle, 15 sheep, 12 
2 CONC hogs.
2 CONT 1698 Census of Acadia shows the following: Marguerite MARTIN widow (of Jean BOURG) 50; Marguerite 27, Magdelaine 20, Catherine 17, Jean 14, Jeanne 11, Louise 8; 1 cow, 6 sheep, 16 hogs, 16 arpents, 80 fruit trees.
2 CONT <http://membres.lycos.fr/ancetre/bour.htm> (copy filed L-13-30 also in his father's internal textfile).
2 CONT ------------------------------------------------
2 CONT The following ancestry of Marguerite Martin was acquired from <http://www.geocities.com/jenpayne11/outfam/martin_acadia.html>:
2 CONT
2 CONT Some Descendants of Rene Robert Martin
2 CONT 1   Rene Robert Martin b: 1550 in St Germain de Bourgeuil, Indre et Loire, France
2 CONT ....  +Estienette Poirer b: 1550 m: 1570
2 CONT ... 2   Rene Robert Martin b: 1580 in St Germain de Bourgeuil, Indre et Loire, France  d: in Port Royal, Acadia, Canada
2 CONT .........  +Estienelle Poirer b: 1579 in Touraine, France m: 1590 in France d: Bef. 1600 Father: ? Poirer
2 CONT ........ 3   Pierre Martin b: 1601 in St Germain, Bourgeuil, France
2 CONT ..............  +of the Abenaki tribe
2 CONT ............. 4   Jean Martin
2 CONT ...................  +Madeleine Babin b: 1678   Father: Antoine Babin Mother: Marie Mercier
2 CONT ........  *2nd Wife of Pierre Martin:
2 CONT ..............  +Catherine Vigneau b: 1603 in Poiters, France m: June 20, 1630 in Bourgeuil, France  Father: Oliviere Vigneau Mother: Renee Courtin
2 CONT ............. 4   Marguerite Martin b: 1639 in Port Royal, Acadia, Canada  d: April 24, 1707 in Port Royal, Acadia, Canada
2 CONT ...................  +Jean Bourg b: 1647 m: 1667 in Port Royal, Acadia, Canada d: April 24, 1707 in Port Royal, Acadia, Canada Father: Antoine Bourg Mother: Antoinette Landry
2 CONT .................. 5   Marguerite Bourg b: 1670 in Cobequid, Acadia
2 CONT ........................  +Jean-Baptist Naquin b: 1661 m: 1697 in Port Royal, Acadia d: 1706 in Port Royal, Acadia, Canada
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------
2 CONT The following was acquired from:  <http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~bobmartell/Landry/Landry3.htm>.
2 CONT
2 CONT Descendants of Jean Claude Landry
2 CONT Generation No. 3
2 CONT 9.  JEAN3 BOURQUE (ANTOINETTE (TWIN)2 LANDRY, JEAN CLAUDE1) was born Abt. 1646 in Richmond, Port Royal, Nova Scotia, and died 24 Apr 1707 in Cobequid (Truro),Acadia, Nova Scotia.  He married MARGUERITE MARTIN Abt. 1667 in Port Roy
2 CONC al, Annapolis, Nova Scotia, Canada, daughter of PIERRE MARTIN and CATHERINE VIGNEAU.  She was born Abt. 1644 in Port Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia, Canada, and died 24 Apr 1707 in Port Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JEAN BOURQUE and MARGUERITE MARTIN are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i.    MARGUERITE4 BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1669; m. JEAN DIT L'ETOILE NAQUIN.
2 CONT ii.    MARIE CLAIRE BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1673; m. (1) JEAN DUBOIS; d. Aft. 1693; m. (2) CHARLES DU CADET ROBICHAUD, 18 Jun 1703.
2 CONT 46.            iii.    ELIZABETH ISABELLE BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1676; d. Aft. 24 Apr 1735.
2 CONT iv.    CATHERINE BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1680; m. (1) JEAN aka LA GIROFLEE TURPIN, 16 Jan 1707/08; m. (2) PIERRE DIT TRIQUELTRIEL, Abt. 1720.
2 CONT 47.             v.    JEAN BAPTISTE BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1684; d. 22 Feb 1757.
2 CONT vi.    JEANNE BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1687; m. PIERRE aka LAFORGE GUERIN.
2 CONT 48.           vii.    ANNE MARIE BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1668; d. Bet. 1696 - 1765.
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------
