1 NOTE Married 1670, Francoise Brun (b. abt 1652, d. 23 buried 24-05-1725 at Port Royal, Acadia, Canada) dau of Vincent & Renee Brode; sources: <http://members.tripod.com/~CyberBart/bourque.htm> (copy filed L-13-30); <http://www.genealog
2 CONC ie.com/dgaa/dgaa-b4.html> (copy filed L-13-30) lists a family of 10 children; "Genealogie de l'ancienne Acadie, BO" pg 14-15 shows family with 10 children.
2 CONT <http://home.attbi.com/~sodapop68/webtree/pafg52.htm> (copy filed L-13-30).
2 CONT <http://www.execulink.com/~sonny1/samson/fam00148.htm> (copy filed L-13-30).
2 CONT 1686 Census of Port Royal shows family as follows: Bernard BOURC 36, Francoise BRUN 34; children: Marie 15, Marguerite 13, Rene 9, Anne 8, Jeanne 6, Clair 4, Francoise 3, Abraham 1; 1 gun, 3 arpents, 4 cattle, 6 sheep, 5 hogs.
2 CONT 1698 Census of Acadia shows the following: Bernard BOURG 50; Francoise BRUN (wife) 46; Rene 21, Jeanne 19, Anne 17, Clair 15, Francoise 14, Abraham 12, Renee 9, Marie 7, Claire 4; 19 cattle, 40 sheep, 12 hogs, 35 arpents, 45 fruit
2 CONC  trees, 2 guns.
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------
2 CONT The following was acquired from:  <http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~bobmartell/Landry/Landry3.htm>.
2 CONT
2 CONT Descendants of Jean Claude Landry
2 CONT Generation No. 3
2 CONT
2 CONT 10.  BERNARD3 BOURQUE (ANTOINETTE (TWIN)2 LANDRY, JEAN CLAUDE1) was born Abt. 1648 in Richmond, Port Royal, Nova Scotia, and died Abt. 1725 in Nova Scotia.  He married FRANCOISE BRUN Abt. 1670 in Port Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia
2 CONC , Canada, daughter of VINCENT BRUN and MARIE BREAU.  She was born Abt. 1653 in Port Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia, Canada, and died 23 May 1725 in Port Royal, Nova Scotia, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of BERNARD BOURQUE and FRANCOISE BRUN are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 49.              i.    MARIE CLAIRE4 BOURQUE, b. 1671; d. Abt. 1727.
2 CONT ii.    DAUGHTER BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1673.
2 CONT 50.            iii.    MARGUERITE BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1674; d. 27 May 1747, Port Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia Canada.
2 CONT iv.    RENE BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1676.
2 CONT 51.             v.    JEANNE BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1678; d. 17 Nov 1723.
2 CONT 52.            vi.    ANNE BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1680, Port Royal, Acadia, New France; d. 12 Mar 1750/51, Port Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia, Canada.
2 CONT 53.           vii.    CLAIRE BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1682, Port Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia Canada.
2 CONT 54.          viii.    FRANCOISE BOURQUE, b. 1683.
2 CONT 55.           ix.    ABRAHAM aka LA JEUNE BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1685; d. Abt. 1751.
2 CONT x.    RENEE aka RENOCHE BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1689; m. CLEMENT BABIN, 11 Jan 1716/17.
2 CONT xi.    MARIE BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1690; m. LAURENT GRANGER, 11 Apr 1711; b. Abt. 1688.
2 CONT 56.          xii.    CLAIRE BOURQUE, b. 1692, Port Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia Canada.
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------
