2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT == Biography ==:'''NOTICE''': this profile is protected by the [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Project:Acadians Acadian Project] because of frequent duplication, and variant name spellings. Please contact the Acadian Project before
2 CONC  making any substantive changes. Thanks for helping make WikiTreethe best site for accurate information.
2 CONT :Martin was born around 1650 in Port Royal, Acadia, the son of AntoineBourg and Antoinette Landry. He died in Cobequit according to the Declarations made at Belle-isle-en-Mer. Martin married Marie Potet about 1675 in Port-Royal, A
2 CONC cadie. Together they had 11 children.≤ref>Birth-Marriage-Death-Children-Residence: "Dictionnaire Généalogique des Familles Acadiennes"; Stephen A. White; 2 vols., Moncton, New Brunswick: Centre d'Études Acadiennes, 1999; pp. 221 &
2 CONC  228.≤/ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT :Children
2 CONT #Marie BOURG b: Abt 1676 in Port Royal, Acadia
2 CONT # Abraham BOURG b: Abt 1678 in Port Royal, Acadia
2 CONT # Pierre BOURG b: Abt 1682 in Port Royal, Acadia
2 CONT # Jeanne BOURG b: Abt 1684 in Port Royal, Acadia
2 CONT # Ambroise BOURG b: Abt 1686 in Port Royal, Acadia
2 CONT # Francois BOURG b: Abt 1688 in Port Royal, Acadia
2 CONT # Anne Marie BOURG b: Abt 1691 in Cobeguit, Acadia
2 CONT # Madeleine BOURG b: Abt 1694 in Cobeguit, Acadia
2 CONT # Charles BOURG b: Abt 1698 in Port Royal, Acadia
2 CONT # BOURG b: Abt 1700 in Port Royal, Acadia
2 CONT # BOURG b: Abt 1702 in Port Royal, Acadia
2 CONT
2 CONT === Residence ===* 1671 Acadian Census at Port Royal: Antoine BOURC, 62, wife Antoinette LANDRY 53; Children (4 married): Marie 26, Francois 27, Jehan 24, Bernard 22; (not married) Martin 21, Jeanne 18, Renee 16, Huguette 14, Jean
2 CONC ne 12, Abraham 9, Marguerite 4; cattle 12, sheep 8.
2 CONT * 1678 Acadian Census at Port Royal: Martin Bourg & Marie Potet / 4 cattle; 1 gun / Abraham 6 months; Marie 3. They have 4 head of cattle [no land listed], with 1 gun.
2 CONT * 1686 Acadian Census at Port Royal: Martin BOURC 36, Marie POTET 29; children: Marie 10, Abraham 7, Pierre 5, Jeanne 2; 1 gun, 3 arpents, 4cattle, 5 sheep, 6 hogs.
2 CONT *Land: 1748; Place:  Lower Debert, Cobeguit, Acadia≤ref>“Land Transaction.” Karen Theriot Reader's Family Tree. geneanet.org, 2019. [https://gw.geneanet.org/katheriot Karen Theriot Reader's Family Tree; [https://gw.geneanet.org/ka
