2 CONT *1693 census of Port Royal, Acadia has Martin BOURG 34, Marie POTRET his wife 34, Marie 17, Abraham 13, Pierre 11, Jeanne 9, Ambroise 7, Francois 5, Anne Marie 2; 18 cattle, 24 sheep, 13 hogs, 30 arpents, 1 gun.
2 CONT *1698 census of Port Royal, Acadia has Martin BOURG 48; Marie POTET (wife) 42; Abraham 20; Pierre 18; Jeanne 15; Ambroise 12; Francois 10, Marie 10; Madeleine 4; Charles 1/2; 19 cattle, 27 sheep, 9 hogs, 35 arpents, 45 fruit trees
2 CONC , 2 guns.
2 CONT *1700 census of Port Royal, Acadia shows Martin BOURG 41; Marie POTET (wife) 41; Abraham 20; Pierre 18; Ambroise 14; François 12; Jeanne 16; Anne-Marie 9; 13 cattle, 21 sheep, 30 arpents, 2 guns.
2 CONT
