1 NOTE Married abt 1675 to Marie Potet-Dupuis (b. 1658) at Port Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia, Canada; children: Marie, Ambroise and Madeleine-Marguerite; sources: <http://www/familyorigins.com/users/s/t/g/Bob--Stgelais/FAMO1-0001/d185.h
2 CONC tml> (copy filed L-13-30); <http://members.tripod.com/~CyberBart/bourque.htm> (copy filed L-13-30); <http://www.genealogie.com/dgaa/dgaa-b4.html> (copy filed L-13-30) lists a family of 7 children; "Genealogie de l'ancienne Acadie,
2 CONC  BO" pg 14.
2 CONT 1698 Census of Acadia shows the following: Martin BOURG 48; Marie Potet (wife) 42; Abraham 20, Pierre 18, Jeanne 15, Ambroise 12, Francois 10, Marie 10, Madeleine 4, Charles 1/2; 19 cattle, 27 sheep, 9 hogs, 35 arpents, 45 fruit t
2 CONC rees, 2 guns.
2 CONT <http://home.attbi.com/~sodapop68/webtree/pafg52.htm> (copy filed L-13-30).
2 CONT <http://www/familyorigins.com/users/s/t/g/Bob--Stgelais/FAMO1-0001/d184.html> (copy filed L-13-30).
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------
2 CONT The following was acquired from:  <http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~bobmartell/Landry/Landry3.htm>.
2 CONT
2 CONT Descendants of Jean Claude Landry
2 CONT Generation No. 3
2 CONT
2 CONT 11.  MARTIN3 BOURQUE (ANTOINETTE (TWIN)2 LANDRY, JEAN CLAUDE1) was born Abt. 1650 in Richmond, Port Royal, Nova Scotia, and died Abt. 1698 in Cobequid,Acadia, Nova Scotia.  He married MARIE POTET Abt. 1675 in Cobequid, Acadia, Nov
2 CONC a Scotia, daughter of JEHAN LA POTET and MARIE GAUTROT.  She was born Abt. 1657.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MARTIN BOURQUE and MARIE POTET are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 57.              i.    MARIE4 BOURQUE, b. 1676.
2 CONT 58.             ii.    ABRAHAM BOURQUE, b. 1678.
2 CONT 59.            iii.    PIERRE BOURQUE, b. 1682.
2 CONT 60.            iv.    ANNE akaANNE BOURQUE, b. 1684.
2 CONT 61.             v.    AMBROISE BOURQUE, b. 1686.
2 CONT 62.            vi.    FRANCOIS BOURQUE, b. 1688.
2 CONT vii.    ANNE MARIE BOURQUE, b. 1691; d. 14 Jan 1766, Boulonge-sur-Mer France; m. ALEXIS (TWIN) AUCOIN, Abt. 1707; b. 14 Mar 1683/84, Beaubassin, Nova Scotia, Canada; d. 25 Dec 1759, St. Nicolas des Boulogne sur Mer.
2 CONT 63.          viii.    MADELEINE BOURQUE, b. 1694, Cobequid, Nova Scotia Canada.
2 CONT 64.           ix.    CHARLES BOURQUE, b. 1698.
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------
