2 CONT The family of Charles BOUDREAU and Renée BOURG
2 CONT
2 CONT [86028] BOUDREAU, Charles (Michel & Michelle AUCOIN [84284]), born about 1649 (rec. 1671), 1646 (rec. 1686) or 1648 (rec. 1693), died after 1714-11-27 Pisiquit (bim) (Acadie)
2 CONT
2 CONT * married about 1672, from .. (Acadie)
2 CONT
2 CONT BOURG, Renée (Antoine & Antoinette LANDRY [46444]), born about 1655 (rec. 1671), died Pisiquit (Sainte-Famille) (bim) (Acadie)
2 CONT
2 CONT       1) Charles, married about 1700 Marie RIVET
2 CONT
2 CONT       2) Jean Baptiste, married about 1702 Cécile CORPORON, married about 1722 Louise SAULNIER
2 CONT
2 CONT       3) Marguerite, married about 1705 Jean BABIN
2 CONT
