1 NOTE Married abt 1674 to Charles Boudreau at Port Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia, Canada; children: Marie, Charles, Anne, Elizabeth, Rene, Marguerite, Jean-Baptiste and Claude; source: <http://www/familyorigins.com/users/s/t/g/Bob--Stge
2 CONC lais/FAMO1-0001/d185.html> (copy filed L-13-30).
