2 CONT Descendants of Jean Claude Landry
2 CONT Generation No. 3
2 CONT
2 CONT 13.  RENEE3 BOURQUE (ANTOINETTE (TWIN)2 LANDRY, JEAN CLAUDE1) was born Abt. 1655 in St. Jean Baptiste, Port Royal, Acadia, and died Abt. 1686 in Pisiquit, Hants, Nova Scotia.  She married CHARLES BOUDREAU 1674 in Pisiguit, Annapol
2 CONC is, Nova Scotia, son of MICHEL BOUDREAU and MICHELLE AUCOIN.  He was born 1646 in Port Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia, Canada, and died 1729 in La Paroisse St. Famile, Acadia, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of RENEE BOURQUE and CHARLES BOUDREAU are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i.    SON4 BOUDREAU, b. 1673.
2 CONT 68.             ii.    CHARLES BOUDREAU, b. Abt. 1674.
2 CONT 69.            iii.    MARIE BOUDREAU, b. Abt. 1675, Pisquit, (Windsor) Nova Scotia Canada; d. St. Josephs des RC.
2 CONT iv.    ISABELLE BOUDREAU, b. Abt. 1677.
2 CONT 70.             v.    RENE BOUDREAU, b. Abt. 1680, Port Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia, Canada; d. 26 Jun 1748, Port Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia, Canada.
2 CONT vi.    ELIZABETH BOUDREAU, b. Abt. 1681.
2 CONT 71.           vii.    MARGUERITE BOUDREAU, b. Abt. 1682.
2 CONT viii.    CLAUDE (TWIN) BOUDREAU, b. Abt. 1683, Grand Pre, Acadia, Canada.
2 CONT 72.           ix.    JEAN BAPTISTE (TWIN) BOUDREAU, b. Abt. 1683; d. 1758, At Sea enroute to France.
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------
