2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Jeanne Bourg was born at Port Royal in 1659. She was the daughter ofAntoine Bourg and Antoinette Landry. In 1677 she married Pierre Comeau,the Elder. Pierre was the son of Pierre Comeau and Rose Bayols. Jeanne had a sister born in
2 CONC  1653 who also was named Jeanne. She marriedJean-Antoine Beliveau. It was not unusual in Acadian families for achild at the baptism to take the name of a parent or godparent.Therefore, in many instances there were two and even thr
2 CONC ee siblingsbearing the same given name. Re: Martin, Lucian and Melba "Remember Us" Page 70 Histoirie Des Acadians Vol II Page 484
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT !INFORMATION: Antoine BOURG & Antoinette LANDRY listed in a book "Histoire Et Genealogie Des Acadiens" by Bona ARSENAULT, Tome 1, Pages 358 to 359, copies in possession of Renee M. EBERT of Las Vegas,NV..
