2 CONT Abraham Bourg, born in 1662, was the son of Antoine Bourg and AntoinetteLandry of Port Royal. He married Marie Brun about 1683. Born in 1659,Marie was the daughter of Vincent Brun and Renee Brot. Children: Jean Baptiste, b. 1684; 
2 CONC Marguerite, b. 1686; Claude, b. 1688; Pierre, b. 1689; Marie, b. 1691; Michel, b. 1693: Charles, b. 1695; Joseph, b.1697. Re: Martin, Lucien and Melba "Remember Us" Page 69-70
2 CONT
