2 CONT 16.  ABRAHAM3 BOURQUE (ANTOINETTE (TWIN)2 LANDRY, JEAN CLAUDE1) was born Abt. 1662 in Richmond, Port Royal, Nova Scotia, and died 13 Apr 1751 in Port Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia.  He married MARIE SEBASTIENNE BRUN Abt. 1683 in P
2 CONC ort Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia, daughter of VINCENT BRUN and MARIE BREAU.  She was born Abt. 1658 in Port Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia, Canada, and died 13 Apr 1736 in Port Royal, Nova Scotia, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ABRAHAM BOURQUE and MARIE BRUN are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i.    JEAN BAPTISTE4 BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1684.
2 CONT 85.             ii.    MARGUERITE BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1685.
2 CONT 86.            iii.    CLAUDE BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1688.
2 CONT 87.            iv.    PIERRE BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1689.
2 CONT 88.             v.    MARIE BOURG/ BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1695, Port Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia, Canada; d. Abt. 1727, Port Toulouse, Cape Breton, Nova Scotia, Canada.
2 CONT 89.            vi.    MICHEL BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1693, Port Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia, Canada; d. Abt. 1761.
2 CONT vii.    CHARLES BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1695, Port Royal, Acadia, Nova Scotia; m. ANNE (TWIN) BOUDREAU, Abt. 1726, Port Toulouse; b. 25 Aug 1709.
2 CONT viii.    JOSEPH BOURQUE, b. Abt. 1697; m. LOUISE ROBICHAUD, 06 Nov 1722, Port Royal, Acadia, Nova Scotia.
