2 CONT
2 CONT BOURG-BOURQUE GENEALOGY
2 CONT ABRAHAM BOURG
2 CONT son of Antoine
2 CONT
2 CONT Abraham Bourg was born in Port Royal in 1662. He was the fifth son and tenth child in a family of thirteen children of Antoine Bourg and Antoinette Landry.
2 CONT
2 CONT Abraham had some schooling as he signed his name as witness at the wedding of his son Michel, on April 22, 1720. Other witnesses were unable to write their signatures.
2 CONT
2 CONT About 1683, Abraham married Marie Brun, born in 1659 in Port Royal. She was the daughter of Vincent Brun and Marie-Renee Brot. Abraham and Marie are direct ancestors four different ways to Mary Alfreda Bourque-twice through daught
2 CONC er, Marie who married Jean Fougere and twice through son, Michel who married Anne Boudrot.
2 CONT
2 CONT Abraham Bourg and Marie Brun have eight children: A) Jean-Baptiste; B) Marguerite; C) Claude; D) Pierre; E) Marie; F) Michel; G) Charles; H)Joseph.
2 CONT
2 CONT A) Jean-Baptiste Bourg was born in 1684
2 CONT
2 CONT B) Marguerite Bourg was born in 1686
2 CONT
2 CONT C) Claude Bourg was born in 1688
2 CONT
2 CONT D) Pierre Bourg was born in 1689
2 CONT
2 CONT E) Marie Bourg was born in 1691 in Port Royal. On November 27, 1713 she married Jean Fougere, son of Jean Fougere and Marie Barre of France. Marie Bourg and Jean Fougere are direct ancestors twice to Mary Alfreda Bourque - once th
2 CONC rough son Jean Fougere and once through daughter, Marguerite Fougere.
2 CONT
2 CONT F) Michel Bourg was born in 1693 in Port Royal. On April 22, 1720 at Port Royal, he married Anne Boudrot. They are the direct ancestors through the all male line to Mary Alfreda Bourque as well as through a mixed male and female l
2 CONC ine. They are the direct ancestors through the all male line to Edouard Bourque and subject of our next generation.
2 CONT
2 CONT G) Charles Bourg was born in 1695
2 CONT
2 CONT H) Joseph Bourg was born in 1697
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------
