1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT
2 CONT She is the daughter of Germain Bourgeois and  Marguerite Belliveau 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage or Union 
2 CONT Marie-Josephe at 17 & Pierre Brault at 24 1694 Acadie, Canada
2 CONT Source: S. White p.274
2 CONT 2. Pierre2 Brau (Vincent1 Brault(Brot)) was born 1670 in Port Royal, Acadie, and died Aft. 1760 in Boston MA.  He married (1) Marie Josephe Bourgeois Abt. 1692 in Port Royal, Acadie, daughter of Germain Bourgeois and Marquerite Be
2 CONC lliveau.  She was born 1677 in Port Royal, Acadie,and died Bet. 1699 - 1705 in Grand Pre, Acadie.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Pierre Brau and Marie Bourgeois are:i.       Anne Brau, born Abt. 1693 in Grand Pre, Acadie; died June 30, 1759 in St. Suliac, France.  She married Antoine Aucoin November 20, 1713 in St. Charles des Mines, Grand Pre, 
2 CONC Acadie.ii.       Marie Brau, born Abt. 1695 in Grand Pre, Acadie.  She married Pierre Aucoin Abt. 1716 in St. Charles des Mines, GrandPre, Acadie.iii.       Pierre Brau, born Abt. 1697 in Grand Pre, Acadie.  He married Anne Franco
2 CONC ise Dupuis November 23, 1722 in Port Royal, Acadie.iv.       Jean Baptiste Brau, born Abt. 1699 in Grand Pre, Acadie.  He married Elizabeth Henry Abt. 1725.
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==* White, Stephen A., Patrice Gallant, and Hector-J Hébert. [[Space:Dictionnaire_généalogique_des_familles_acadiennes|''Dictionnaire Génalogique Des Familles Acadiennes.'']] Moncton, N.-B.: Centre D'études Acadiennes, 
2 CONC Université De Moncton, 1999, Print, p274.
2 CONT * http://www.nosorigines.qc.ca/GenealogieQuebec.aspx?genealogy=Bourgeois_Marie-Josephe&pid=77585&lng=en
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.http://www.themartensfamily.com/BraultFamilyTree.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ≤references />
