2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT [[Category: Grand-Pré, Acadie]]
2 CONT == Biography =='''Pierre Breau''' was born about 1699 in Grand-Pré, Acadia. He was the son of [[Breau-27|Pierre Breau]] and [[Bourgeois-623|Marie-JosèpheBourgeois]]. He married Anne Dupuis, daughter of Jean Dupuis and AnneRichard 
2 CONC 23 November 1722 at Port Royal, Acadia. The bride and groom made their marks and Joseph Leblanc signed ≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Jean-Baptiste (Port-Royal,N.-É.)-1870 C-1870 (image 182
2 CONC ) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1869/182?r=0&s=5≤/ref>≤ref>An Acadian Parish Remembered The Registers of St. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755 RG 1 Vol. 26 p.339 https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/
2 CONC archives.asp?ID=1368≤/ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT Known Children:
2 CONT # Alexis BREAU ca 1723-1808
2 CONT # Marguerite BREAU ca 1725-1751
2 CONT # Jean BREAU
2 CONT # Marie Anne BREAU †/1785
2 CONT # Simon BREAU †/1763
2 CONT # Anastasie "Nathalie" Nathalie BREAU ca 1734-1800
2 CONT # Joseph BREAU ca 1738-1760
2 CONT # Pierre BREAU †/1798
2 CONT # Charles BREAU †
2 CONT # Paul BREAU ca 1746-1764
2 CONT He died sometime before 5 JUN 1770 when he was recorded as deceased onhis son's marriage contract of that date. ≤ref>Source: [[#S112]] p. 111 Text:  Listed as deceased father on son Pierre BRAU's marriage contract dated 5 Jun 1770
2 CONC  (Bordeaux: Minutes of Maitre LAVILLE : Cote 3 E 20655).≤/ref> 
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT ≤references/>* BIRTH-MARRIAGE: Bona Arsenault, HISTOIRE ET GENEALOGIE DES ACADIENS;1625-1810; Ottawa, Editions Lemeac, 1978, 6 vols.; p. 1126 (Grand Pr) * PARENTS-MARRIAGE-DEATH: Stephen A. White, DICTIONNAIRE GENEALOGIQUE DES FAM
2 CONC ILLES ACADIENNES; 1636-1714; Moncton, New Brunswick, Centre d'Etudes Acadiennes, 1999, 2 vols.; p. 274; #(10):* Source: ≤span id='S112'>S112≤/span>Title:  Donald J. Hebert, Acadians in Exile (Cecilia, LA: Hebert Publications, 1980
2 CONC ).
2 CONT *Bona Arsenault, HISTOIRE ET GENEALOGIE DE S ACADIENS; 1625-1810; Ottawa, Editions Lemeac, 1978, 6 vol s.; p. 1126 (Grand Pré)
