2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT '''Marie Breau'''Marie was born around 1697 in Acadie. She was the daughter of Pierre Breau and Marie-Josèphe Bourgeois. She married Pierre Aucoin, son of Martin Aucoin and Marie Gaudet, around 1716.  Marie passed away betweenAugu
2 CONC st 1717 and July 1718.≤ref>Stephen A. White, Patrice Gallant, Hector-J. Hébert, [http://www.umoncton.ca/umcm-ceaac/node/38 ''Dictionnaire Généalogique des Familles Acadiennes''] (Moncton, N.-B.: Centre D'études Acadiennes, Univers
2 CONC ité De Moncton, 1999) p. 274≤/ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
