2 CONT == Biography =='''Isabelle Breaux''' was born 16 Feb 1712. She was the daughter of [[Breau-27|Pierre Breau]] and [[LeBlanc-353|Anne LeBlanc]]. She was baptized 17 April 1712 at Saint Charles des Mines. Her godparents were Bernard 
2 CONC Leblanc and Marie Coste.<ref>http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1870/70?r=0&s=5</ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT Nicolas dit Deslauriers Babineau to Marguerite Babineau
2 CONT
2 CONT 1   Nicolas dit Deslauriers Babineau b: 1653 in France  d: November 17, 1723..  +Marie-Marguerite Granger b: 1668  d: 1719 in Annapolis Royal, Nova Scotia
2 CONT ..... 2   Jean-Pierre Babineau b: February 10, 1708/09   .........  +Isabelle Breau  b. Feb. 16, 1712  ............ 3   Jean Babineau b: 1747 in Terre-Rouge, Petitcodiac, Acadia  d: December 1796 in Petitcodiac, NB ...............
2 CONC .  +Anne Bastarache b: Abt. 1752  ................... 4   Marguerite Babineau b: 1782  d: 1823 in Saint Louis, Kent Co., NB ...................     +Joseph Richard b: 1778  d: 1805 Per: http://worldconnect.rootsweb.com/cgi-bin/igm
2 CONC .cgi?op=GET&db=wdartez&id=I2234  "Nicolas Babineau was enumerated in the census for Penobscot, Maine in1693. It is possible that he came to Canada as a soldier given his dit name of Deslauriers. He married Marie-Marguerite Granger
2 CONC  abt 1687, d/o Laurent Granger and Marie Landry. In 1701, Nicolas and Marie-Marguerite moved to Port-Royal, where their son Jean was born on February 10, 1709. He married Isabelle Breau abt 1730. She was the d/o Pierre Breau and A
2 CONC nne LeBlanc. With his spouse, Jean settled at Terre-Rouge, on the Petitcoudiac River, within the limits of what is now the city of Moncton. This family escaped the Deportation by going to Cocagne. When the Acadians signed their su
2 CONC bmission/allegiance in 1759 and 1760, theyreturned to the Petitcodiac. Members of this family were imprisoned at Fort Beauséjour in 1763.
2 CONT * WikiTree profile Breau-16 created through the import of Richard Roberts Family Tree.ged on Aug 13, 2011 by [[X-4095 | Irene x]]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT <references />http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~mcwilliamstevenson/nicholas_babineau.html http://worldconnect.rootsweb.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=wdartez&id=I2234  http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~mcwilliamsteven
2 CONC son/nicholas_babineau.html
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.nosorigines.qc.ca/GenealogieQuebec.aspx?pid=709176
2 CONT
2 CONT
