1 NOTE Possibly the Abraham shown on page 311 of Tanguay Vol IV that married Marie Bro aka Breau(x) (bur. 20 Dec 1742 at St Francois du Sud) and shows family with 3 children; "Genealogie de l'ancienne Acadie" [G-K] pg 4 shows family with
2 CONC  4 children.
2 CONT Tanguay Vol IV pg 310 shows a mar. of a Abraham Godet to Agnes Giroir at Ste Anne, Acadia, Canada with 3 children.
2 CONT "Généalogie de L'ancienne Acadie" (from the internet) shows Abraham married to Marie Breau (Bro) with 4 children: Pierre, Anne, Marie, Paul.  NOTE: these children were born way after he died in 1728.
2 CONT <http://www.genealogie.com/dgaa/index.html> Add'l info (copy filed L-14-16).
2 CONT Hebert Genealogy from the internet (copy filed L-14-4 & L-14-15).
2 CONT Hebert Genealogy from the internet (copy filed L-14-4) shows married 1701 to Agnes Girouard at Acadia, Canada with a family of 6 children; remarried 1714 to Marie (aka Breau) Brault at Acadia, Canada with a family of 5 children.
2 CONT Individual record of self (copy filed L-14-4) shows both of th above marriages.
2 CONT Individual record of Marie Breaux (copy filed L-14-4).
2 CONT Individual record of Agnes Girouard (copy filed L-14-4).
2 CONT <http:www.geocities.com/ronald_gaudet2001/wga1.html> (copy filed L-14-4) shows him with two families, wives unknown, with 4+5 children.  Names of children with dates of birth and death are listed.
2 CONT "Généalogie de L'ancienne Acadie" [G-K] pg 2
2 CONT "Histoire et Généalogie des Acadiens"-Arsenault Vol I pg 351-352; 407-408.
