2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT Jean-Simon was born in 1747. Jean-Simon Savoy. He was said to be 68 years old when he died in 1815.
2 CONT He passed away in 1815. ≤ref>IGD: Registres du Fonds Drouin: Acadie: Neguac (Northumberland) 1815 [https://www.genealogiequebec.com/membership/voir.aspx?id=H%3a%2fRegistres%2fAcadie%2fLieux+de+A+%C3%A0+W%2fN%C3%A9guac+(Northumberl
2 CONC and)%2f1810%2f1815%2fd1p_31051073.jpg Burial Registration]≤/ref>
2 CONT == Research Note==The Jean Simon Savoie, born about 1747, who married Marie Arseneau would be the son of Jean Baptiste [[Savoie-368]] and Marguerite [[Blanchard-819]]. ≤ref>Généalogie des Landry à travers le monde [http://mwlandry
2 CONC .ca/genealog/getperson.php?personID=I4004&tree=03 Jean Simon dit Michel Savoie]≤/ref>
2 CONT == Sources ==
