2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT == Biography == 
2 CONT == Birth ==Anne was born in May of 1732 to Abraham Arssenau and Marie Joseph Sanoye (Savoye)( spelling of each from baptismal record card info).<ref>Library and Archives Canada Fonds des Archives départementales de la Charente-Mar
2 CONC itime [La Rochelle, France] : C-1207 Registres de Beaubassin- reel_c1207 MG 6 A 2 (Image 33) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1207/33?r=0&s=6</ref><ref>Nova Scotia Births and Baptisms, 1702-1896; Document Informa
2 CONC tion: Indexing Project (Batch) Number: C51000-1; System Origin: Nova_Scotia-ODM; GS Film number: unknown; Citing this Record:<blockquote>"Nova Scotia Births and Baptisms, 1702-1896," database, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.or
2 CONC g/ark:/61903/1:1:XL5S-PXR : 10 February 2018), Marie Joseph Sanoye in entry for Anne Arssenau, 06 May 1732; citing ; FHL microfilm unknown.</blockquote></ref> 
2 CONT
2 CONT == Baptism ==Anne was Christened on Jun 15, 1732, as Roman Catholic.<ref>Nova Scotia Births and Baptisms, 1702-1896<br>
2 CONT &emsp;Document Information: Indexing Project (Batch) Number: C51000-1; System Origin: Nova_Scotia-ODM; GS Film number: unknown; Citing this Record:<blockquote>"Nova Scotia Births and Baptisms, 1702-1896," database, FamilySearch (h
2 CONC ttps://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:XL5S-PXR : 10 February 2018), Marie Joseph Sanoye in entry for Anne Arssenau, 06 May 1732; citing ; FHL microfilm unknown.</blockquote></ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT == Death ==She died and was buried at 83 years of age. Recorded as:<br>
2 CONT Nathalie Arsenault Or Bernard<br>
2 CONT &emsp;Death: 21 Jun 1821<br>
2 CONT &emsp;Prince EdwardIsland, Canada<br>
2 CONT &emsp;Age 83<br>
2 CONT &emsp;Estimated birth year: 1738<ref>"Prince Edward Island Death Card Index, 1721-1905," database with images, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:939X-3SLY-3?cc=1827236&wc=MXMS-JZ9%3A161358401 : 20 September 201
2 CONC 5), Abbot - Blanchard > image 887 of 994; Public Archives, Charlottetown. St. JacquesRoman Catholic Church, Egmont Bay, Book 2</ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes::Death record only gives an estimated date of birth, stating her age to be 83, since we don't know who gave this information from the death record card seen online, we cannot know how accurate the person givingher age was, t
2 CONC his leads to the possibility that her age was closer to90 at the time of death, and is plausible that she may have been bornin 1732. So far no Record is found for a "Anathalie, Nathalie, Natalie, born within years closer to 1738
2 CONT
