2 CONT
2 CONT Simon Savoie was born in Chipoudy parish, Acadia (today it is known as Nova Scotia)
2 CONT
2 CONT His first Savoie ancestor came to Acadia in 1643.
2 CONT
2 CONT Simon must have been part of the Great Expulsion (1755-1763) as he relocated to Louiseville around 1760.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a wheel wright in 1809.
