2 CONT Marie Anne Hache (Gallant) (Larche) b. abt 1715, at Beaubassin, Acadia, dau of Michel and Magdeleine Le Blanc, at Beaubassin, Acadia, 11 aug 1734. Married Jean-Baptiste Savoie, son of Francois Savoie and Marie Richard, at Port Roy
2 CONC ale, Acadia, in 1737. Known children: 1. Pierre, married M.Louise Paquin, dau of Louis and M.Josephte Le Sieur, at St-Cuthbert, Berthier, Quebec, 2 mar 1772. 2. Jean-Baptiste, married Genevieve Lebeau-Bonfils, dau of Pierre and Ge
2 CONC nevieve Brissette, at Ile Dupas, Quebec, 24 jun 1771.
