2 CONT '''Pierre Savoie''' was born ABT 1752 in St Cuthbert, Berthier, Quebec, Canada , and died 29 MAY 1830 in age 94, St Barthelemy, Berthier, Quebec, Canada . He was buried 31 MAY 1830 in St Barthélemy, Berthier, Quebec, Canada. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Louise Paquin on 2 MAR 1772 in St Cuthbert, Berthier, Quebec, Canada . 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Jean Baptiste Savoie and Marie Hache . 
2 CONT
