2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Babineau-838
2 CONT
2 CONT Marguerite Babineau was born around 1752 in Acadie. Her parents were Charles Babineau and Cecile Comeau. [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Charles Doucet on October 18, 1773 at Pointe-du-Lac, Province of Quebec. [2][3]
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on March 30, 1828 in Yamachiche, Bas-Canada. [1]
2 CONT
