2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Angelique'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Angelique Babineau was born on 17 May 1768, in Saint-Charles-Borromée, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, her father, Charles Babineau, was 45 and her mother, Cecile Comeau, was 38. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Etienne Dumont dit Lafleur on 10 October 1791, in Bécancour, Nicolet, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 3 sons. 
2 CONT Jean-Baptiste Dumont 1793–1880
2 CONT Pierre Dumont 1795–
2 CONT Grégoire Dumont 1800–1875
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 8 May 1801, at the age of 32.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Babineau-153
2 CONT
2 CONT >Etienne Dumond, widower, husband of the late Marie Anne Levasseur, married Angelique Babineaux, daughter of the late Charles Babineaux and the late Cecile Comhaut, on 10 Oct 1791 in Nativité-de-Notre-Dame-de-Bécancour. 
2 CONT
