1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Pierre Lord was married three times,   His first wife was Anne Emerence Savard whom he married on January 7, 1777 at  Iles aux Coudres, St Louis, Charlevoix, Québec, Canada.  His second wife was Marguerite Louise L
2 CONC ajuste  whome he married on August  22,1791, St Roch des Aulnaies, , L'Islet, Québec, Canada,  His third and last wife was Marie Louise Dubé who he married on August 13, 1792 at, St Roch des Aulnaies, , L'Islet, Québec, Canada.   
2 CONC It appears he may have been married originally to Marie Tremblay and had three children with her.
