1 NAME Marguerite /Blanchard/
2 GIVN Marguerite
2 SURN Blanchard
2 _MARNM Blanchard
2 NICK Margarita Blanchard
2 NICK Marguerite Blanchard
1 NAME /Blanchard/
2 GIVN
2 SURN Blanchard
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 19 DEC 1738
2 ADDR
3 CITY Grand Pré
3 STAE Acadie
3 CTRY British Colony
1 BURI
2 DATE 17 FEB 1795
2 PLAC "at Vermilion--having gone to confession"
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 17 FEB 1795
2 ADDR
3 CITY Attakapas Post
3 STAE La Luisiana
3 CTRY New Spain
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.acadiansingray.com/Appendices-ATLAL-BLANCHARD.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Marguerite Blanchard, age 14, and her brother Victor, age 13, came as orphans.  Marguerite married Simon, son of fellow Acadian Alexandre Broussard dit Beausoleil, at Cabanocé/St.-Jacques in April 1768 and followed her husband bac
2 CONC k to the Bayou Teche valley.  After he married at Ascension, on the river above Cabanocé/St.-Jacques, in February 1773, Victor followed his sister to the Attakapas District and settled in what became St. Martin Parish, but he and 
2 CONC his wife were that rare Acadian couple who had no children.  
2 CONT
2 CONT born c1751, NS; daughter of René BLANCHARD & Isabelle COMEAUX; sister of Victor; arrived LA 1765, age 14; married, age 17, Simon of Attakapas, son of Alexandre BROUSSARD dit Beausoleil & Marguerite THIBODEAUX of Petitcoudiac & Att
2 CONC akapas, 11 Apr 1768, Cabanocé; followed husband to Attakapas District; in Attakapas census, 1769, unnamed, with husband, "A new-born infant," & Freme BRANO [Firmin dit Ephrem dit Freme ROBICHAUX]; in Attakapas census, 1771, unname
2 CONC d, age 21, with husband, no children, & Étienne BRUNO(?)[Freme ROBICHAUX]; in Attakapas census, 1774, unnamed, with husband & 2 unnamed children; in Attakapas census, 1777, age 25, with husband, 2 sons, & 2 daughters; in Attakapas
2 CONC  census, 1781, unnamed, with husband & 5 unnamed others; died "at Vermilion--having gone to confession," buried 17 Feb 1795, age 44
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT *'''Sources:'''
2 CONT **"Acadian Immigrants to Cabanocé/Cabahannocer, 1765" - http://www.acadiansingray.com
2 CONT ***Attakapas, La Luisiana census, 1769, unnamed
2 CONT ***Attakapas, La Luisiana census, 1771, unnamed, age 21
2 CONT ***Attakapas, La Luisiana census, 1774, unnamed
2 CONT ***Attakapas, La Luisiana census, 1777, age 25
2 CONT ***Attakapas, La Luisiana census, 1781, unnamed
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Notes:'''
2 CONT **Arrived in current day Louisiana in 1765, age 14
2 CONT ----
