2 CONT "Our French Canadian Forefathers" (copy filed 60-2) shows the following about Marguerite Crevier:
2 CONT
2 CONT Marguerite: b. 1645 in La Rouchelle, France; 1?m. 14 May 1657 (TR) to Jacques Fournier, Sieur de la Ville, son of Michel Fournier and Michelle Croyer; 2?m. 10 October 1661 contract Ameau, to Michel Gamelin and Francoise Belanger; 
2 CONC 3?m. 21 August 1683 Boucherville, to Francois Renou and Marie Serle. This Marguerite Crevier never married Pierre Groston dit St. Onge, as noted in Tanguays dictionary.
2 CONT ------------------------------------------------
