2 CONT The following was acquired from:  <http://www5.familytreemaker.com/users/r/u/s/Mary-B-Russell/GENE1-0050.html>.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marguerite Crevier, born 1643 in La Rochelle, St-Sauveur, Char Mar, France. She was the daughter of Christophe Crevier, Sieur de La Melee and Jeanne Evard-Enard.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Marguerite Crevier:
2 CONT Burial: June 07, 1707, Montreal, Montreal, Quebec, Canada
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Michel Gamelin-LaFontaine and Marguerite Crevier are:
2 CONT i.   Ignace Gamelin, born Abt. 1664.
2 CONT ii.   Marguerite Gamelin, born 1665; married (1) Leger Hebert-Lenoir November 17, 1681 in Montreal, Montreal, Quebec, Canada; married (2) Paul Petit February 12, 1724/25 in Varennes, Vercheres, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT iii.   Pierre Gamelin-Chateauvieux, born Abt. 1667; married Jeanne Maugras January 08, 1689/90 in St-Francois-du-Lac, Quebec; born Abt. 1670 in Trois-Rivieres, Quebec.
2 CONT iv.   Jean-Baptiste Gamelin, born Abt. 1670; died Bef. 1705; married Marguerite Maugras March 19, 1698/99 in St-Francois-du-Lac, Quebec; born August 22, 1674 in Trois-Rivieres, Quebec.
2 CONT v.   Marie-Francoise Gamelin, born Abt. 1672; married Claude Pinard October 10, 1694 in Contract Notaire Pottier; born 1666.
2 CONT vi.   Michel Gamelin, born Abt. 1673.
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------
