2 CONT The following was acquired from:  <http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/h/o/s/Jackie--Hostage/GENE19-0026.html>.
2 CONT
2 CONT Nicholas (Bellerive) Crevier, born 1641 in Rouen, France; died Aft. 1709 in Cap-de-la-Madeleine, Champlain, Quebec. He was the son of Christophe Crevier, Sieur de La Melee and  Jeanne (Enard) Evard. He married 219. Louise (Leloutr
2 CONC e) Lecoutre Abt. 1665 in Cap-de-La-Madeleine, Champlain, Quebec.
2 CONT
2 CONT Louise (Leloutre) Lecoutre, born 1648 in Origin Unknown; died Aft. 1689.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Nicholas (Bellerive) Crevier:
2 CONT # of children: 11
2 CONT Occupation: Sieur de Bellerive
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Louise (Leloutre) Lecoutre:
2 CONT Emigrated: 1665, Arrived Canada as Fille du Roi (daughter of the King)
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Nicholas Crevier and Louise Lecoutre:
2 CONT Marriage: Abt. 1665, Cap-de-La-Madeleine, Champlain, Quebec
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Nicholas Crevier and Louise Lecoutre are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i.   Madeleine Crevier, born Aft. 1665 in Quebec; died 26 June 1746 in Riviere-de-Loup (Louiseville), Quebec; married Charles Lemaitre 11 October 1689 in Montreal, Quebec; born 15 April 1666 in St-Jean-du-Perrot de LaRochelle, Fra
2 CONC bce.
2 CONT More About Charles Lemaitre and Madeleine Crevier:
2 CONT Marriage: 11 October 1689, Montreal, Quebec
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ii.   Marguerite-Louise Crevier, born Bef. 1667 in Quebec; married Laurent Baudet 16 May 1684 in CT: Ameau (Cap-de-la-Madeleine); born Abt. 1661 in St-Nicolas, LaRochelle, Aunis, France; died Bef. 05 November 1687 in Cap-de-la-Mad
2 CONC eleine, Quebec.
2 CONT More About Laurent Baudet and Marguerite-Louise Crevier:
2 CONT Marriage: 16 May 1684, CT: Ameau (Cap-de-la-Madeleine)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT iii.   Claude Crevier, born Bef. 1668 in Quebec; died 05 February 1730 in Trois-Rivieres, St-Maurice, Quebec; married (1) Marie-Jeanne (Bruneau) Petit 07 January 1706 in Trois-Rivieres, St-Maurice, Quebec; born 12 July 1680 in Tro
2 CONC is-Rivieres, St-Maurice, Quebec; died 14 March 1710 in Maskinonge, Quebec; married (2) Catherine Jutras 26 November 1711 in Trois-Rivieres, St-Maurice, Quebec; born 24 September 1671 in Trois-Rivieres, St-Maurice, Quebec.
2 CONT More About Claude Crevier and Marie-Jeanne Petit:
2 CONT Marriage: 07 January 1706, Trois-Rivieres, St-Maurice, Quebec2778
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT iv.   Marie-Catherine (Bellerive) Crevier, born Bef. 1678; died 24 April 1727 in Maskinonge, Quebec; married (1) Michael Serre 1702; married (2) Jean-Baptiste (Papineau-Testard) Forville 04 February 1715 in La Riviere du Loup, Lou
2 CONC iseville, Maskinonge, Quebec.
2 CONT v.   Michel Crevier, born 15 February 1680 in Bastican, Quebec; died 19 January 1760 in Cap-de-la-Madeleine, Quebec; married Marie-Angelique Masse 03 June 1709 in Cap-de-la-Madeleine, Quebec.
2 CONT More About Michel Crevier and Marie-Angelique Masse:
2 CONT Marriage: 03 June 1709, Cap-de-la-Madeleine, Quebec
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------
