1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Notes'''
2 CONT * Location info: [https://www.geni.com/projects/Perche-France/24550 Perche, France] (birth), [https://www.geni.com/projects/Qu%C3%A9bec-Qu%C3%A9bec-Canada/23941 Québec] (marriage), [https://www.geni.com/projects/Ch%C3%A2teau-Riche
2 CONC r-Qu%C3%A9bec-Canada/23888 Château-Richer] (death)
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/projects/Pioneers-of-Canada-Quebec/17839 Pionnière de la Nouvelle-France]. Arrive au Québec le 4 juin 1634 à bord du [https://www.geni.com/projects/Passagers-du-Navire-de-Nesl%C3%A9-1634/24863 « Navire de N
2 CONC eslé »] avec ses parents et quatre frères et sœurs, Madeleine, Pierre, Nicolas et Marie.
2 CONT * Elle est confirmée à Quebec par [http://www.geni.com/people/Saint-Fran%C3%A7ois-de-Laval-MEP/6000000026189988815 Mgr Laval] le 10 août 1659 à l'âge de 28 ans.
2 CONT * Contrat de mariage entre Toussaint Toupin et Marguerite Boucher le 25 déc 1645 par [http://www.geni.com/people/Guillaume-Audouart-dit-St-Germain/6000000031485028002 notaire Audouart]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''More Notes'''
2 CONT
2 CONT pp7190-7191
2 CONT
2 CONT possibly different year of birth? 1621? place of death also different.. Montreal
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT She was baptized in Mortagne, Perche, France.
2 CONT
2 CONT She came to New France in 1634, with her parents. Her Date of Death is between  20-03-1668  and  03-06-1669. Seven  siblings were baptized in Mortagne-au-Perche (Notre-Dame) :  1- Charles,  baptized 07-04-1620 ;  2- Antoinette,  b
2 CONC aptized 06-08-1621 ;  3- Pierre, baptized 01-08-1622 ; 4- Nicolas, baptized le 09-09-1625 ;  5-Charles (homonyme),  baptized 04-03-1628  6- Marie baptized  le 22-01-1629 et  7- Madeleine vers 1633. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Her paternal grandsparents were Jacques Boucher and Françoise Paigne.  Her maternal grandsparents were  Nicolas Lemaire and Marie Castrie.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married in Trois-Rivières (contrat Audouart). The date of marriage may refer to the date of the marriage contract. The actual marriage would have taken after signing the contract. Her husband was Toussaint Toupin dit Dussault.
2 CONC
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.fichierorigine.com/detail.php?numero=240489
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT pp7190-7191
2 CONT
2 CONT husbands other last name Toussaut Toupin
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Magdalene is a duplicate relative ... see parents of Guillaume BEAUDRY DESBUTTES (1656 - 1723) for lineage & details.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Soeur de Pierre Boucher, gouverneur des Trois-Rivières.
