1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Notes'''
2 CONT * Location info: [https://www.geni.com/projects/Perche-France/24550 Perche, France] (birth), [https://www.geni.com/projects/Trois-Rivi%C3%A8res-Qu%C3%A9bec-Canada/24574 Trois-Rivières] (marriage,death)
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/projects/Pioneers-of-Canada-Quebec/17839 Pionnière de la Nouvelle-France].
2 CONT * NOTE about date and place of birth: Madeleine's baptism records have never been found, neither in Perche or Québec. It is possible that she was born on the ship during the Atlantic crossing; she is listed as a passenger. Therefo
2 CONC re, and until we find a better source, we will assume she was born circa May 1634.
2 CONT * Madeleine est listée comme passager du [https://www.geni.com/projects/Passagers-du-Navire-de-Nesl%C3%A9-1634/24863 « Navire de Neslé »] qui arriva à Québec le 4 juin 1634.
2 CONT * Contrat de mariage entre Urbain Beaudy et Madeleine Boucher le 18 novembre 1647, et déposé le 29 mai 1650, par [http://www.geni.com/people/N-N-Audouart-dit-St-Germain/6000000031485028002 notaire Audouart].
