1 NAME Francoise Clare Boucher(born Charest)
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 4 MAR 1674
2 PLAC Québec, Québec, Canada
2 ADDR
1 BAPM
2 DATE 11 MAR 1674
2 PLAC 16 Rue Buade
2 ADDR
3 CITY Quebec City
3 STAE QC
3 CTRY Canada
1 DEAT
2 DATE 19 DEC 1725
