1 NOTE Married 10 Feb 1710 Jean-Baptiste Boucher (bap. 10 Dec 1673 at Boucherville, son of Pierre & Jeanne Crevier [#689]) at Chambly; sources: (ct Adhémar); family (12 children) is listed in Jette pg 140; Hertel genealogy page (filed 23
2 CONC -2); Tanguay Vol II pg 377 shows family with 14 children; Tanguay Vol I pg 71 shows family with 16 children.
2 CONT Gordon genealogy from the internet (filed 23-2) shows date of death as 4 May 1732 at Boucherville, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT Tanguay Vol I pg 305 & Vol IV pg 497.
2 CONT ---------------------------------------------------
2 CONT The following was acquired from:  <http://myweb.cableone.net/moocows1/familytree/kevin/f32.htm>.
