1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/KFY7-JCN
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Marguerite'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Marguerite Boucher dit De Niverville was born on 9 November 1726, in Boucherville, Chambly, Quebec, Canada, her father, Jean Baptiste Boucher, was 52 and her mother, Therese Marguerite Hertel, was 36. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Louis Marie Marchand on 26 February 1753, in Sainte-Famille, Boucherville, Chambly, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 8 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 18 September 1798, in Verchères, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 71, and was buried in Quebec, Canada.
