1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Cook - Everett Gasper Cook, Age 90, Died On Satur- Day, July 21, 2001 At 4:45 Pm. Beloved Hus- Band Of The Late Mary 'Mamie' Meyers Cook. Father Of Evelyn C. Schenck And Everett G. Cook, Jr. Son Of The Late Carolin
2 CONC e Smith And Robert Cook. Grandfather Of Debbie S. Maiaro, Louis, Gary And Michael Schenck And Yvette C. Earl And Everett, Urban And Eric Cook. Father-In-Law Of Louis J. Schenck And Rita T. Cook. Brother Of Edward Cook, Sr. And The
2 CONC  Late Adam Cook, Robert Cook, Annie C. Edgecomb, Hazel C. Magash, Antoinette C. Letinich And James Cook. Also Survived By 8 Great Grandchildren And One Great Great Grandchild. Mr. Cook Was A Native Of Booth- Sville, La. And A Resi
2 CONC dent Of St. Bernard Manor In Meraux, La. Relatives And Friends Of The Family, Also Staff And Residents Of St. Bernard Manor Are Invited To Attend The Funeral Services From St. Ber- Nard Memorial Funeral Home, 701 W. Virtue Street,
2 CONC  Chalmette, La. On Tuesday, July 23, 2001 At 11:00 Am. Interment In St. Bernard Memorial Gardens. Visitation From 6:00 Pm Until 10:00 Pm Monday And After 9:00 Am Until 11:00 Am On Tuesday. Rev. Forrest Hall, Officiating.
