2 CONT William Theodore de Valcourt Sr, son of Joseph William dit Willie de Valcourt and Stella Olivia dit Birdie Smith He was born on 12 Jan 1900 in Sunset, La. He died on 19 Feb 1985 in New Orleans, La..
2 CONT
2 CONT He was buried on 21 Feb 1985 in Garden of Memories Cemetery, Jefferson Parish, LA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Information provided by Bill de Valcourt Jr.
2 CONT
2 CONT  DEATHS 
2 CONT
2 CONT de Valcourt  W. T. de Valcourt, Sr. on Tuesday February 19, 1985 at 6:38 PM. Beloved husband of the late Vivian Gillette de Valcourt; father of W.T. Jr., Robert V. Sr., and C. Charles de Valcourt; brother of Mrs. Carrie Elmer of P
2 CONC ort Arthur, Tx., Mrs. Hazel Mc Manus, Mrs. Philomena Bourg, John Alexander de Valcourt, Theodore de Valcourt of Port Arthur, Tx., and Herman (Steve) de Valcourt of Lafayette, La., and the late Estelle de Valcourt, Mrs. Ethel Daile
2 CONC y, Tom, Robert, Joe, Woodrow (Woody) de Valcourt; also survived by numerous grand children and great-grandchildren.  Age 85 years, A native of Sunset, La. and a resident of Jefferson Parish for the past 44 years. Relatives and fri
2 CONC ends of the family also employees of Southern Pacific Railroad, and officers and members of A. A. R. P. and Camp Salmen Counselor and Staff Reunion are invited to attend the funeral services from the Metairie funeral home of Laman
2 CONC a-Panno-Fallo 1717 Veterans Memorial Blvd. at Bonnabel Blvd. on Thursday February 21, 1985 at 1 o'clock p.m. Mass of Christian Burial in the chapel.  Interment Greenwood Cemetery. (Information 831-9901)
2 CONT
