1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Thursday evening March-15-1973
2 CONT
2 CONT Dear Stephen Louise & family, We got back OK -at 4- o'clock Monday evening. And we want to thank you again for everything you gave us. Hardy was operated on Monday morning and getting along OK. I am sending you these papers we tol
2 CONC d you about. I am sending you two so if you should happen to see Woodrow give him one of them, but don't go out of your way to do so. We are getting along just fine. I just talked to Patty and they are OK also. John was at Mildred
2 CONC 's when we got there and said he would stay until Thursday that is today and go back. Saw Joe this morning he is OK. When we got to Mildred's Sunday night Raymond and Linda & boys were there and Paul, Audrey & boys also were there
2 CONC  so we saw all of them. They are all OK.-and they had caught some crayfish 40 lbs. and they just had the first tub of them cooked so we got in on all of them they sure were good. By By - Robert & Ivis
2 CONT
2 CONT This letter is posted by request of Greg de Valcourt (#48099568) and by consent of Robert's son.
