2 CONT Custom Fact • 
2 CONT dna
2 CONT DNA: Unknown wife of Jean GAUDET has mtDNA results of Haplogroup X, HRV1 variations from the Cambridge Reference Sequence of: 145A,189C, 223T, 278T, 301T, 519C. Probably of European origin. 
