1 NOTE Possibly his first wife; much confusion concerning his first wife.
2 CONT Their is much confusion concerning his wives.
2 CONT Read the message lines of #2005 for more on this topic.
2 CONT <http://geocities.com/ronald_gaudet2001/wga12.html> (copy filed L-14-16).
2 CONT <http://home.attbi.com/~sodapop68/webtree/pafg54.htm> (copy filed L-14-16).
2 CONT <http://membres.lycos.fr/ancetre/gaudet.htm> (copy filed L-14-16 also in her spouse's internal textfile).
2 CONT <http://jason.gaudet.com/gaudet/gaudet_gen1.htm> (copy filed L-14-16).
2 CONT A short bio of Jehan Gaudet acquired from the internet (copy filed L-14-16).
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------
2 CONT The following was acquired from:  <http://72.14.203.104/search?q=cache:ADvSv_MKmzMJ:www.delmars.com/family/perrault/2355.htm+%22marie+daussy%22&hl=en&gl=us&ct=clnk&cd=33> and shows a third child born of this marriage.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie Daussy
2 CONT Family 1: Jehan (Jean) Gaudet
2 CONT Marriage: 1598, MartaizŽ,Vienne,France
2 CONT
2 CONT Francoise Gaudet
2 CONT Denis Gaudet
2 CONT Marie Gaudet
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------
2 CONT The following was acquired from:  <http://www.acadian.org/hebert.html> and shows info on Marie's marriage.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anthoine was apparently married before his departure and came to Port Royal with his wife.  Estienne married within a year of his arrival to Marie Gaudet, the daughter of Jehan Gaudet and Francoise Marie Daussy.  They were two of 
2 CONC the earliest Acadian settlers.
2 CONT
2 CONT Estienne and Marie Gaudet had 10 children, five boys and five girls.
2 CONT The five girls in order of their birth were:
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie (born 1650, married 1666 Michel DeForest)
2 CONT Marguerite (born 1652, married 1670, Jacques Nicolas LePrince)
2 CONT Francoise (born 1661, married 1679, Jean Commeau)
2 CONT Catherine (born 1663, married 1679 Philippe Pinet dit Bellefeuille)
2 CONT Martine (born 1665, married 1682, Nicolas Barrilot (Barrileaux)
2 CONT
2 CONT The five boys were:
2 CONT
2 CONT twins Emmanuel (born 1653, married 1679, Andree Brun) and
2 CONT Estienne (born 1653, married 1678, Jeanne Commeaux)
2 CONT Jehan (Jean) (born 1658, married 1691, Jeanne Douaron)
2 CONT Michel (born 1666, married 1691, Isabelle Pellerin)
2 CONT Anthoine (born 1670, married 1690, Jeanne Corporon, married 1737 Anne
2 CONT Orillon dit Champagne)
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------
2 CONT The following was acquired from:  <http://perso.wanadoo.fr/froux/familles/godet/godet2.htm>.
2 CONT
2 CONT The wives of Jean GODET
2 CONT
2 CONT Everybody believes that Jean GODET in had 2 wives.
2 CONT The name of second is known thanks to various censuses, her name was Nicole COLLESON whom he married by 1652
2 CONT However, there seems to be  a problem.
2 CONT In  his "Great Classification of Acadieans in Quebec"  Father Adrien Bergeron states that Jean's first wife's name was Marie DAUSSY..
2 CONT In his genealogical dictionary,  Stephen White researches the source of this error further and he quotes Novia Francia's article of 1927 in which one speaks > about some Jean GAUDET of Abbeville ( Picardy) who was 59 years old in 
2 CONC 1727, who would have been born about 1668 and who was the son of Jean GAUDET and Marie DAUSSY.
2 CONT Genealogists made the connection that this was the same Jean GAUDET of Acadie. This is totally impossible because in 1668, in Jean GAUDET's birth, son of Jean GAUDET and  Marie DAUSSY, our Jean GAUDET the Acadian, was in Port Roya
2 CONC l married with Nicole  COLLESON.
2 CONT
2 CONT Nevertheless the name DAUSSY always appears always in numerous Acadian genealogies. Father  Bergeron himself  even admitted to have been mistaken on this point.  (Article appeared in French Canadian Genealogical Society). Vol. 40,
2 CONC  * 4, p. 299.)
2 CONT Some authors think that his first wife was Micmac but this is not very easy to prove. In the work " A feudal colony in America " Edme Rameau hinted in a note at a Metis branch that would have been a part of this family.
2 CONT
2 CONT When did Jean Godet  arrive in Acadia?
2 CONT
2 CONT Father Léopold Lanctot, o.m.i., claims that he would  have arrived in Acadia very early,  by 1610 , with Charles de Biencourt.  Were that so, the original statement evoked in  the hypothesis N?1 would not be true. On the other han
2 CONC d if he arrived with Razilly by 1634, his first children were born in France and his first wife would not be of MicMac origin.
2 CONT Others think that Jean GODET, arrived in Acadie by 1610, or even with Champlain in 1604, would have returned to France to look there for his family. This version is more reconcilable with the tenants of those who believe that he m
2 CONC ight have left by 1634.
2 CONT
2 CONT Censuses.
2 CONT Jean Godet was listed only once in Acadie, in 1671:
2 CONT
2 CONT Laboureur - JEHAN GAUDET aagé de quatre vingt et
2 CONT seize ans, sa femme Nicolle Colleson aagée de soixante
2 CONT et quattre ans. Leurs enfans Jehan aagé 18 ans, Leur
2 CONT terre en labour trois arpans en deux places, Leurs bestes
2 CONT a Cornes six piéces. Leurs brebis trois  piéces.
2 CONT
2 CONT If this information are exact, he would have been born by 1575 and would have had a child, Jean, at the age of 78 ??
2 CONT Personally I think that the age is a little exaggerated in this census, especially if one thinks at which age he had his first 3 children, he was 48 years old when Françoise was born, 50 for Denis' birth and 58 years at Marie's bi
2 CONC rth.
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------
2 CONT The following was acquired from:  <http://www.gregor.ca/Acadia/Gaudet/gaudet-gen2.htm>.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2nd Generation
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Francoise Gaudet: b. abt 1623 (SW); d. abt 1700 (SW).
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: abt 1644 to unknown Mercier.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 2nd: abt 1650 (SW), Port Royal, Acadia, to Daniel LeBlanc: b. abt 1626 (SW), France; d. bet 1693-1698 (SW), Port Royal, Acadia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: Jacques, Francoise-Marie, Étienne, René, André, Antoine and Pierre.
2 CONT ----------------------------------
2 CONT 2. Denis Gaudet: b. abt 1625 (SW); d. Oct. 11, 1709, Port Royal (SW), Acadia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: abt 1645 (SW) to Martine Gauthier: b. abt 1619 (SW); d. aft 1678 (SW).
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: Anne, Marie, Pierre l'aîné, Pierre le jeune and Marie.
2 CONT -----------------------------------
2 CONT 3. Marie Gaudet: b. abt 1633 (SW); d. July 30, 1710, Port Royal (SW), Acadia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 1st: abt 1650 (SW) to Étienne Hébert.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child:
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 2nd: abt 1676 (SW), Port Royal, Acadia, to Dominqiue Gareau.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------
