2 CONC ting common origin in France); p37-38 (d'Aulnay Seigneurie in France where Gaudet surname is found; also mentioned p47-48
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. ↑ Genevieve Massignon's article " La seigneurie de Charles de Menou d'Aulnay, gouverneur de l'Acadie, 1635-1650", published in 1963 in French.Gaudet Genealogy
2 CONT
