2 CONT Francoise was born in about 1623. She is the daughter of Jean Gaudet and unknown mother. She married (1) unknown Mercier in 1644, in Acadie, New France. They are the parents of at least the following:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Marie (1645-) md (a) Antoine Babin and (b) Guillaume Lejuge
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT She married (2) Daniel LeBlanc in 1650, in Port Royal. She was baptized in Port-Royal in 1671, when she was 48 years old. According to the 1671 census, she says she is 48 years, her husband Daniel is 45 and that: "... their cattle
2 CONC  has 18 horns and 26 sheep, 10 labour their land arpans in two places." They are the parents of the following:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Jacques (abt 1651-aft 1731) md Catherine Hebert
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Françoise (abt 1653-bef 1687) md Martin Blanchard
2 CONT
2 CONT 3) *Etienne (abt 1656-bef 1686)
2 CONT
2 CONT 4) Rene (abt 1657-1734) md Anne Bourgeois
2 CONT
2 CONT 5) Andre (abt 1659-1743) md Marie Dugas
2 CONT
2 CONT 6) Antoine (abt 1662-bef 1730) md Marie Bourgeois
2 CONT
2 CONT 7) Pierre (abt 1664-abt 1717) md (a) Marie Theriot and (b) Madeleine Bourg
2 CONT
2 CONT *Etienne is believed to have been a navigator who sailed away at a young age and was never heard from again.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in about 1699.
2 CONT
