0 @I6000000004122090479@ INDI
1 NAME Pierre /Vincent/
2 GIVN Pierre
2 SURN Vincent
2 _MARNM Vincent
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1631
2 ADDR
3 CTRY France
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1677
2 ADDR
3 CITY Port-Royal
3 STAE Acadie
3 CTRY La Nouvelle-France [French Colonial North America]
1 OCCU Laboureur, He was a day labourer in France When he immigrated to Acadia, he was a soldier fighting the English and farmer
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *Sources:'''
2 CONT **1671 Acadie Census - shown to be 40 years old which estimates birth c.1631
2 CONT **http://www.francogene.com/genealogie-quebec-genealogy/087/087503.php
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT VINCENT, Pierre (..), laboureur/ploughman, né/born vers/about 1631 (rec. 1671) Martaizé (Vienne ), France
2 CONT
2 CONT Origin : would be from Martaizé (860149) (nom existe), but records are missing and there is no trace of that person
2 CONT
2 CONT * mariés/married vers/about 1663, de/from Port-Royal (Acadie)
2 CONT
2 CONT GAUDET, Anne (Denis & Martine GAUTHIER ), née/born vers/about 1644 ou/or 1646 (rec. 1671)
2 CONT
2 CONT       1) Clément, marié/married vers/about 1698 Madeleine LEVRON
2 CONT
2 CONT       2) Huguette, mariée/married vers/about 1684 Jean BASTARACHE dit LE BASQUE
2 CONT
2 CONT       3) Madeleine, née/born vers/about 1668 (rec. 1698), mariée/married vers/about 1685 François MOÏSE dit LATREILLE
2 CONT
2 CONT       4) Michel, né/born vers/about 1668 (rec. 1671), marié/married vers/about 1689 Marie Josèphe RICHARD, marié/married Pisiguit (Acadie) 1709 ou/or 1710 Anne Marie DOIRON
2 CONT
2 CONT       5) Pierre, marié/married vers/about 1692 Jeanne TRAHAN
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Plusieurs de ses descendants portent le nom de ''Clément''.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Arrive en acadie vers 1654. En 1686, ses fils Michel, Pierre et Thomas demeurent à Port-Royal. Leurs parents sont vraisemblablement décédés. Au recensement de 1671, n'avaient que 4 enfants: Huguette 7, Thomas 6, Michel 3 et Pierre
2 CONC  2.  (Arrived in Acadia to 1654. In 1686, his son Michel, Pierre and Thomas remained at Port Royal. Their parents have likely died. In the Census of 1671, had only 4 children: Huguette 7, Thomas 6, 3 Michel and Pierre 2.)
2 CONT --------------------
