2 CONT [[Category:Port-Royal, Acadie]]
2 CONT {{Acadian}} 
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT Thomas was born about 1665 in Port Royal, Nova Scotia. He is the son of [[Vincent-2896|Pierre Vincent]] and [[Gaudet-835|Anne Gaudet]]. ≤ref>White, Stephen A., Patrice Gallant, and Hector-J Hébert. [[Space:Dictionnaire_généalogiqu
2 CONC e_des_familles_acadiennes|''Dictionnaire Généalogique Des Familles Acadiennes.'']] Moncton, N.-B.: Centre D'étudesAcadiennes, Université De Moncton, 1999, Print, p. 1575 (cites "Rc PR 1671 6a, 1678 13a, 1686 20a").≤/ref>
2 CONT He passed away after 1686 since he was counted in the Port-Royal census that year and he did not appear in any official record after that.
2 CONT
