2 CONT Claude Theriot married Marie Gautrot around 1661 in Port Royal.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie Gautrot born around 1645 daughter of Francois Gautrot and Edmee Lejeune she died in Port Royal Nov 29 burried Nov 30th 1732 age around 90.
2 CONT
2 CONT Stephen White DGFA page 1484
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT AKAN: Marie-Louise 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT according to the Acadian parish records,  she was a habitant of Pozemun Koardis, and was a Passamaquoddy Native. She may have been of mixed blood though. 
2 CONT
