2 CONT ===Biography===:Clement Vincent, son of Pierre Vincent and Anne Gaudet, was born about 1674 in Port-Royal, Acadie. ≤ref>Source: [[#DGFA]] :Text: Born around 1674, son of Pierre VINCENT & Anne GAUDET.≤/ref>Clement had died before  
2 CONC 8 May 1752 when his son married.≤ref>Title: Acadian Church Records, Port LaJoye, Ile St. Jean, 1749-1758; Author: Hebert, Tim, trans. & ed.; Publication: Houma, LA, Acadian-Cajun Genealogy& History, 2000; Parish records of St. Jea
2 CONC n l'Evangeliste Parish; p. 33. Source published by Karen Theriot Reader, Rootsweb.com.:Text: When son Pierre VINCENT married on 8 May 1752 at Port Lajoie toRose BARILLO, the groom's parents were listed as Clement VINCENT (d.[eceas
2 CONC ed]) of Pleziguit [sic] & Magdelaine LEVRON (d.) of Pleziguit.≤/ref> He married Madeleine Levron about 1698 in Acadie. ≤ref>Source: [[#DGFA]] ≤/ref>   
2 CONT
