2 CONT
2 CONT Olivier Daigre who married Jeanne Blanchard was the son of Oliver Daigre and Marie Gaudet. He was born abt 1674 and was buried 22 Sept 1709 in Port-Royal at the age of 40. His wife Jeanne Blanchard was born abt 1681 and married a 
2 CONC second time to Jean Leprince on 30 Jan 1715 at Port-Royal.
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in Port-Royal according to the Déclarations de Belle-Ile-en-Mer.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT   OLIVIER2 DAIGRE (OLIVIER1) was born Abt. 16747, and died Abt. September 22, 17097.  He married JEANNE BLANCHARD Abt. 16997, daughter of GUILLAUME BLANCHARD and HUGUETTE GOUGEON.  She was born Abt. 16818, and died in Port Royal, 
2 CONC Acadia, Canada9.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of OLIVIER DAIGRE and JEANNE BLANCHARD is:
2 CONT
2 CONT 7.                i.    JEANNE3 DAIGRE, b. February 01, 1706; d. June 1757, Liverpool, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Olivier and Jeannine decided to remain in the Port Royal region and brought up there seven children there.
2 CONT --------------------
