2 CONC s stepfather and mother.]
2 CONT * [[1693 Acadian Census]] at Port-Royal: Jean FREDELLE 50, Marie GODEThis wife 42, Louis 20, '''Olivier 19''', Marie 15, Anne 14, Jean 12; 10 cattle, 20 sheep, 8 hogs, 20 arpents, 3 guns.
