2 CONT Olivier (DAIGRE) DAIGLE was born1 1643 in Aigre, Poitou France. He died about 1686 in Port Royal, Acadia.<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT Olivier married Marie GAUDET, daughter of Denis GAUDET and Martine GAUTHIER, on 1666 in Port Royal, Acadia. Marie was born2 1651 in Port Royal, Acadia. She died 2 May 1734 in Port Royal, Acadia and was buried 3 May 1734 in Port Ro
2 CONC yal, Acadia.<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:<br/>
2 CONT  ix.      Anne DAIGLE was born 1679 in Port Royal, Acadia. She died 13 Dec 1758 in At Sea enroute to France - ship la Violet.<br/>
2 CONT  x.      Pierre DAIGLE was born 1681.<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT Pierre DAIGLE (Olivier) was born 1681 in Port Royal, Acadia.<br/>
2 CONT Pierre married Madeleine GAUTEROT on 1710.<br/>
2 CONT They had the following children:<br/>
2 CONT i.       Anne DAIGLE was born 6 Dec 1708 in Pisiquit, Acadia.<br/>
