2 CONT Anne Blanchard-[500] 1
2 CONT Born: Abt 1645, Port Royal, Acadia 150
2 CONT Married (1): 1658, Port Royal, Acadia
2 CONT Married (2): Abt 1672, Port Royal, Acadia 147
2 CONT Died: After 1714, Beaubassin, Acadia 151
2 CONT
2 CONT Events:
2 CONT
2 CONT Fact: Widow of François Guérin. 34
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne married François Guérin-[2098] [MRIN:344], son of Jérôme Guérin-[2389] and Marie Blanchard-[2390], in 1658 in Port Royal, Acadia. (François Guérin-[2098] was born about 1635 in Martaizé (In Vienne), France 152 and died before
2 CONC  1672 8.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne also married Pierre the elder Gaudet-[499] [MRIN:298], son of Denis Gaudet-[582] and Anne Martine Gauthier-[583], about 1672 in Port Royal, Acadia.147 (Pierre the elder Gaudet-[499] was born about 1650 in Port Royal, Acadia 1
2 CONC 48, died on 8 Dec 1741 in Beaubassin, Acadia 34,149 and was buried in Beaubassin, Acadia 1.)
