2 CONT
2 CONT Descendants of Guillaume Blanchard and Huguette Poirier
2 CONT
2 CONT Generation No. 3
2 CONT
2 CONT 5.  ANNE3 BLANCHARD (JEAN2, GUILLAUME1) was born 1645 in Port Royale, l'Acadie., and died December 08, 1741 in Port Royale, Nouvelle Ecosse, Canada..  She married (1) FRANCOIS GUERIN Abt. 1659 in Port Royale, l'Acadie., son of JER
2 CONC OME GUERIN and MARIE BLANCHARD.  He was born November 1635 in Beaubassin, l'Acadie, and died Abt. 1670 in Port Royale, l'Acadie..  She married (2) PIERRE GAUDET, aka L'AINE 1672 in Port Royale, l'Acadie, son of DENIS GAUDET and AN
2 CONC NE-MARTINE GAUTHIER.  He was born Abt. 1652 in Port Royale, l'Acadie, and died 1709 in Beaubassin, l'Acadie.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ANNE BLANCHARD and FRANCOIS GUERIN are:
2 CONT i. ANNE4 GUEREN, b. Abt. 1659, Port Royale, l'Acadie.; d. January 18, 1717, St. Antoine, Tilly, Lotbiniere, Nouvelle-France.; m. LAURENT GODIN, aka BEAUSEJOUR ET CHATILLION, 1674, Beaubassin, l'Acadie.; b. August 10, 1655, Montrea
2 CONC l, I'ile de Montreal, Quebec, New-France.; d. May 01, 1737, Riviere des Prairies, Quebec, New France..
2 CONT 18. ii. MARIE GUERIN, b. 1662, Port Royale, l'Acadie; d. Unknown.
2 CONT iii. FRIVOLINE GUEREN, b. 1664, Prob. Port Royale, l'Acadie.; d. Unknown.
2 CONT iv. JEROME GUERIN, b. 1664, Port Royale, l'Acadie.; d. Unknown; m. ISABELLE AUCOIN, Abt. 1697, Baie-des-Mines, Grande Pre, l'Acadie.; b. 1679, Beaubassin, l'Acadie.; d. Unknown, Prob. l'ile Saint-Jean..
2 CONT 19. v. HUGUETTE-RADEGONDE GUERIN, b. Abt. 1666; d. Unknown.
2 CONT vi. FRANCOIS GUEREN, b. 1669, Prob. Port Royale, l'Acadie.; d. Unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ANNE BLANCHARD and PIERRE GAUDET are:
2 CONT 20. vii. BERNARD4 GAUDET, aka LE VIEUX, b. 1673, Port Royale, l'Acadie.; d. March 17, 1751, Port Royale (Anappolis Royale), New Ecosse, Canada..
2 CONT 21. viii. PIERRE GAUDET, b. 1675, Port Royale, l'Acadie.; d. Bet. 1707 - 1708, possibly, Beaubassin, l'Acadie..
2 CONT 22. ix. CLAUDE GAUDET, b. 1677, Port Royale, l'Acadie.; d. Unknown.
2 CONT 23. x. ABRAHAM GAUDET, b. 1679, Port Royale, l'Acadie.; d. Abt. November 26, 1728, Berthier-sur-Mer, Quebec, New France..
2 CONT 24. xi. MADELEINE GAUDET, b. Bet. 1681 - 1682, Prob. Port Royale, l'Acadie.; d. November 25, 1757, Quebec, New France..
2 CONT xii. MARIE GAUDET, b. Bet. 1681 - 1682, Port Royale, l'Acadie.; d. Abt. January 08, 1739, La Baleine & Lorembec, l'Acadie.; m. (1) JOSEPH MIRANDE, Abt. 1704, possibly, Beaubassin, l'Acadie.; b. October 10, 1680, Beaubassin, l'Acad
2 CONC ie.; d. Bet. 1726 - July 01 1732; m. (2) PIERRE LAVIELLE, August 23, 1735, La Baleine & Lorembec, New Ecosse, Canada.; b. Abt. 1681; d. Unknown.
2 CONT 25. xiii. JEANNE GAUDET, b. 1684, possibly, Beaubassin, l'Acadie.; d. Bef. July 28, 1732.
2 CONT 26. xiv. AUGUSTIN GAUDET, b. Bet. 1685 - 1686, Beaubassin, l'Acadie.; d. Unknown.
2 CONT xv. JEAN GAUDET, b. Abt. 1690, Port Royale, l'Acadie.; d. Unknown; m. MARIE BRAULT, Abt. 1729; b. Abt. 1704, possibly, Port Royale, l'Acadie.; d. Unknown.
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------
