2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT [[Category: Port-Royal, Acadie]]
2 CONT
2 CONT == Biography ==:Pierre Gaudet, son of Pierre l'ainé Gaudet & Anne Blanchard, was born about 1675 in Port Royal estimated from census records. Pierre Gaudet and Cecile Mignot were married about 1700 in Acadia. He died between1707 &
2 CONC  1708 perhaps in Beaubassin as he did appear on the censuses ofBeaubassin in 1698 & 1700.≤ref> Title: Dictionnaire Généalogique des Familles Acadiennes; Author: Stephen A. White; Publication: 2 vols; Moncton, NB: Centre d'Études A
2 CONC cadiennes, 1999; p. 1188.:Text: Born about 1675, married before the 1700 census to Cecile Mignot dit Aubin (Jean-Aubin & Anne Dugas); d. between 1707 & 1708.[note: no explanation given for choosing death date, no location of death
2 CONC  given]≤/ref>
2 CONT
