2 CONT "dit Lami" is his nickname Lami (Larry)
2 CONT
2 CONT Jean Boudrot dit Lami was born in 1710 in Acadia, Canada.1 He was the son of Claude Boudrot and Catherine Meunier.1,2 On 14 October 1731 in Port-Royal, Acadia, Canada, Jean married Agathe Thibodeau, the daughter of Antoine and Mar
2 CONC ie (Préjean) Thibodeau.2 He died before 21 May 1763.2 Citations Bergeron, Adrien. Le Grand Arrangement des Acadiens au Québec. volume 2. Montreal, Canada: Éditions Élysée, 1981). White, Stephen A. Dictionnaire Généalogique des Fam
2 CONC illies Acadiennes. volume I. Monction, Canada: Centre d'Études Acadiennes, Université de Moncton, 1999).
2 CONT
