2 CONT '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/94VD-9DW
2 CONT Brief Life History of Pierre'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Pierre Duon was born on 28 March 1720, in Annapolis Royal, Annapolis, Nova Scotia, Canada, his father, Jean Baptiste Duon dit lyonnaisse, was 35 and his mother, Agnes Hebert, was 27. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Angelique Aucoin on 15 November 1745, in Acadia, New France. They were the parents of at least 5 daughters. 
2 CONT Marguerite Duon 1749–
2 CONT Marie Duon 1753–
2 CONT Female Child Duon 1755–1755 (died in infancy)
2 CONT Fleurine Duon 1755–
2 CONT Marie Claire DUON 1755–1813
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived in Jersey in 1773 and Pomquet, Antigonish, Nova Scotia, Canada in 1789. He died in 1793, in Antigonish, Nova Scotia, Canada, at the age of 73.
