2 CONT {{Acadian}} 
2 CONT == Biography ==Pierre's year of birth is estimated by other researchers as about 1703. He was the son of [[Comeau-5|Jean Comeau]] and [[Babin-3|Catherine Babin]]. He married Marguerite Aucoin, daughter of Martin Aucoin and Catheri
2 CONC ne Terriot 10 Oct 1729 at Saint Charles des Mines, Grand Pre. ≤ref>http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1870/640?r=0&s=5≤/ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT ≤references />* Diocese of Baton Rouge Catholic Church Records: Acadian Records 1707-1748 (Baton Rouge, LA, Diocese of Baton Rouge, 1999), Personal Collection, Marriage of Pierre Comot and Marguerite Aucoin, p.52: "Pierre Comot (J
2 CONC ean Comot and Catherenne Babin) m. 10 Oct 1729 Margueritte Aucoin (Martin Aucoin and Catherenne Terriot) wit. Jean Commaux (s); MartinAucoin (s); Pierre Doucet (s); {+} Jean Baptiste Comot; {+} Julien Aubois; {+} Claude Benoit; si
2 CONC g. {+} Pierre Comot; {+} Catherine Aucoin (SGA-2, 224-225)"
