2 CONT **"Acadian Immigrants to Bayou des Écores, New Feliciana, 1785-86" - http://www.acadiansingray.com
2 CONT ***Exiled to Province of Virginia 1755, age 20
2 CONT ***Deported to England 1756, age 21
2 CONT ***Repatriated to France aboard La Dorothée, arrived St.-Malo 23 May 1763, age 28
2 CONT ***At St.-Servan-sur-Mer, France, 1763-72
2 CONT ***In Poitou, France, 1773-75
2 CONT ***In Third Convoy from Châtellerault to Nantes, France, Dec 1775
2 CONT ***Returned to St.-Malo
2 CONT ***On list of Acadians at St.-Malo, Sep 1784, listed as Margueritte Commau
2 CONT ***Sailed to la Luisiana on ''La Ville d'Archangel'', age 50
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Notes:'''
2 CONT **Arrived in current day Louisiana Dec 1785
2 CONT ----
