2 CONT **"Acadian Immigrants to Bayou des Écores, New Feliciana, 1785-86" - http://www.acadiansingray.com
2 CONT ***At Baie-de-Mordienne, Île Royale, Apr 1752, age 22, with parents & siblings
2 CONT ***Deported from Île Royale to St.-Malo, France, aboard Queen of Spain 1758, arrived St.-Malo 17 Nov 1758, lsited as Marie Terriot, fille de Françoise Guerrin, veuve Pierre-Marie[sic] Terriot, no age given
2 CONT ***Moved to Rochefort, France, 8 Mar 1759
2 CONT ***Evidently returned to St.-Malo
2 CONT ***Sailed to la Luisiana on ''La Ville d'Archangel'', age 52[sic]
2 CONT ***Moved to Baton Rouge District?
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Notes:'''
2 CONT **Arrived in current day Louisiana Dec 1785
2 CONT **Likely never married
2 CONT ----
