2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Th%C3%A9riot-167 WikiTree Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Feb 28 2018, 22:52:14 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT Married to 3 men.1 unknown Landry, ca 17292 Pierre Melanson, ca 17343 Pierre Gautro ca 1752 Elisabeth (Isabelle) THERIOT, born at Cobeguit 22 Jul, baptized as Isabelle (Grand Pré Register) 14 Aug 1710, daughter of Pierre & Marie B
2 CONC OURG. Sponsors: Antoine BREAU & Marguerite GUILBEAU. She married 1st (according to A. GODBOUT) around 1729 to a ---LANDRY, son of Pierre & Madeleine BROUSSARD. She married 2nd around 1734 to Pierre MELANSON, son of Pierre & Marie 
2 CONC BLANCHARD. She married 3rd before the census of 1752 to Pierre GAUTROT, son of Francois & Louise AUCOIN (widower of Agnes LeBLANC). She was on the 1752 (LaRoque) census, age 42 years ; on 1767 census at Miquelon, age 56 years. On 
2 CONC 1770 census at Rochefort, age 61 years, a widow.
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Th%25C3%25A9riot-167 WikiTree Genealogy] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Feb 28 2018, 22:55:46 UTC''
