2 CONT ***Exiled to Province of Virginia 1755, age 19
2 CONT ***Deported to England 1756
2 CONT ***Repatriated to France aboard La Dorothée, arrived St.-Malo 23 May 1763, age 27, a widower
2 CONT ***At St.-Servan-sur-Mer, France, 1763-65
2 CONT ***At Locmaria, Belle-Île-en-Mer, France, 1765-early 1780s
2 CONT ***Sailed to la Luisiana on ''La Caroline'', age 49
2 CONT ***Valenzuela, la Luisiana census, 1788, listed as Charles Gautreaut, age 50
2 CONT ***Valenzuela, la Luisiana census, 1791, listed as Charles Gautereau, age 54
2 CONT ----
