1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/KP9B-CP6
2 CONT Brief Life History of Elizabeth Isabelle'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Elizabeth Isabelle Landry was born in 1747, in Grand-Pré, Kings, Nova Scotia, Canada, her father, Pierre Landry, was 47 and her mother, Anne Thériot, was 43. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Olivier Barriault on 24 April 1768, in Pleudihen, Côtes-d'Armor, France. They were the parents of at least 7 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 26 February 1828, in Carleton-Saint-Omer, Avignon, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 81.
