1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/MJ9T-TDJ
2 CONT Brief Life History of Elisabeth'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Elisabeth Jeanson/Janson/Johnson was born on 14 May 1770, in Saint Mary, Kent, New Brunswick, Canada, her father, Guillaume Jamson Jeanson, was 47 and her mother, Marie Josephe Aucoin, was 49. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Luc Leblanc on 19 October 1790, in Carleton, Bonaventure, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 8 sons and 5 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 29 September 1849, in Carleton, Bonaventure, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 79, and was buried in Saint-Joseph-de-Carleton, Carleton, Bonaventure, Canada East, British North America.
