2 CONC ly Trees] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jan 8 2019, 20:13:17 UTC
2 CONT
2 CONT As per familysearch:  Alexis married Madeleine Bergeron on Jan 15, 1748, Roman Catholic , Beaubassin, Cumberland County, NS. "Acadie".
