1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Gregoire married three times: (1) Marie Aucoin in 1745 in Grand Pre. (2) Marie-Madeleine Pitre 8/5/1760 in Plouer, France (3) Anne LeBlance 8/5/1766 ini Plouer France.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gregoire moved to France after the Deportation from 1761 to 1771.  After his third marriage, he and his wife returend to Acadia around 1772 and settle ini Petit-Etang, on Cape Breton.  He is the ancestors of the Maillets in the Ch
2 CONC eticamp area.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Il était à Plouer, France, de 1761 à 1771; il revint en Acadie vers 1772, et il s'est établi au Cap-Breton.
