2 CONT ***Sailed to la Luisiana on Le ''St.-Rémi'', age 30
2 CONT ***Valenzuela, la Luisiana census, 1788, listed as Michelle, age 32
2 CONT ***Valenzuela, la Luisiana census, 1791, age 35
2 CONT ----
