2 CONT == Biography ==:Jean Comeau was born on December 14, 1712 in Grand Pre, Acadia.  His parents were [[Comeau-5|Jean Comeau]] and [[Babin-3|Catherine Babin]].≤ref>Diocese of Baton Rouge Catholic Church Records: Acadian Records 1707-1
