2 CONC hirurgien des Mines, and Francoise Commeaux (SGA-1,32)
2 CONT ≤/ref>:Jean married about 1740, Acadia, to Marie AUCOIN 1723≤ref name="DGFA">"Dictionnaire Généalogique des Familles Acadiennes"; Stephen A. White; 2 vols., Moncton, New Brunswick: Centre d'Études Acadiennes, 1999; p. 379:COMEAU #
2 CONC 5 n - Jean-Baptiste (33) COMEAU, son of Jean (5) COMEAU & Catherine BABIN, married around 1740 Marie AUCOIN [no parents given].≤/ref>
2 CONT #Simon COMEAU ca 1741-1818
