2 CONT :He died between Sep 1755 and 1756 in Bristol, England during the timeof the deportations.≤ref>"Dictionnaire généalogique des familles acadiennes", [http://www.umoncton.ca/umcm-ceaac/files/umcm-ceaac/wf/wf/pdf/cor-dict.pdf "Ajouts
