2 CONC 75-) md Rene GrangerJean was buried on 9 May 1710.They are the grandparents of Antoine Landry and Charles Landry, sons of Rene Landry and Anne Terriot/Theriault. :: https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/140888066/jeanne-boudreau#add
