2 CONC r 10, Claude 8, Francois 5; cattle 5, sheep 12.
2 CONT * [[1678 Acadian Census]] at Port Royal: Bonaventure Térriot, Jeanne Boudrot, 1 acre, 7 cattle, 1 gun, 3 girls: 10, 1668; 5, 1673; 3, 1675.
