2 CONT Marie-Elisabeth Gautreaux (Theriot) is not related to my Mother, Ethel Boudreaux Prestridge.  This is shown as the line going from my Mother, Ethel, to Lucille Morvant.  Lucille Morvant was Ethel's stepmother and Hamilton Joseph's
2 CONC  second wife.  Ethel's birth mother was Catherine Hogan, daughter of Mary Daley and Patrick Hogan and died when Ethel was very young.  Ethel had to siblings, Margaret and Edward.  All deceased, of course.
2 CONT
2 CONT My name is JoAnn Prestridge Branch and I am Ethel's youngest daughter.  My e-address is jodi4060@gmail.com
2 CONT
2 CONT It would be appreciated if all this line was corrected and I notice several other places showing the same line that need correction.  
2 CONT
2 CONT If you have questiions, please contact me at the above e address.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thank you.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sincerely,
2 CONT
2 CONT JoAnn Prestridge Branch 
