2 CONT !CHRISTENING-CENSUS-MARRIAGES-DEATH-BURIAL: E-mail posting at <ACADIAN-CAJUN-L@rootsweb.com> #151 on 23 Sep 1998 by Kenneth BREAU (breauk @umoncton.ca). Andre'e BRUN, daughter of Vincent & Renée BREAU, baptized at La Chaussee [Poi
2 CONC t ou, France] on 21 Aug 1646. Sponsors: Étienne BARANGIT & Andrée CAILLAND. On the 1671 censu s at Port Royal, Acadia she was 24 years old (on her father's entry) and 25 years with her hu sband's household. In 1686 she was age 40;
2 CONC  1693 age 46; 1698 age 52; 1700, age 53; 1701, ag e 55 years. She married 1st around 1668 to Germain THÉRIOT, son of Jean & Perrine RAU. She married 2 nd around 1680 to Emmanuel HÉBERT, son of Étienne & Marie GAUDET. She died and 
2 CONC was buried o n 25 Jul 1727, at around age 80 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT !BIRTH-MARRIAGES: Arsenault, H&G, p. 474 (Port Royal).
2 CONT
2 CONT !CENSUS: 1671, Port Royal, Acadia, age 24 in parents' entry [p. 6], where she is listed as ma rried. Also has own entry [on p. 5], age 25, living with first husband Germain TERRIAU and th eir son age 2.
2 CONT
2 CONT !CENSUS: 1686, Port Royal, Acadia, age 40, name given as Andree' BRO, with second husband Ema nuel HEBERT age 30, and their 5 children ages 1 month to 6 years, plus the 3 children of he r former marriage, now age 12 to 18.
2 CONT
2 CONT !CENSUS: 1693, Port Royal, Acadia, age 46, living with 2nd husband Emmanuel HE'BERT, 40, thei r son Guille age 12, Jean 9, Jacques 8, Alexandre 7, Martin 6, Catherine [THERRIOT] age 22. T hey have 20 cattle, 15 pigs, on 30 arpents
2 CONC  with 1 gun.
2 CONT
2 CONT !CENSUS: 1698, Port Royal, Acadia, age 52, living with 2nd husband and 6 children, oldest fro m her first marriage.
2 CONT
