2 CONT !BIRTH-PARENTS-MARRIAGE-DEATH: Southwest Louisiana Genealogical Society, ANCESTOR CHARTS AN D TABLES; 1600-1900; vol. V, Lake Charles, LA, Society, 1997; member #33; own copy.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Birth: 	Aug. 21, 1646 La Chaussee Departement de la Vienne Poitou-Charentes, France Death: 	Jul. 25, 1727 Port Royal Annapolis County Nova Scotia, Canada
2 CONT
2 CONT Andree was the daughter of Vincent Brun and Renee Brault. She was born and died in Port-Royal, NS, Canada. The above is her christening date, rather than birth date. She married 1st Germain Terriault in 1668 in Port Royal. He died
2 CONC  in 1678. They are the parents of the following: 1) Germain Theriault (1669-1750)md Anne Pellerin 2) Pierre Theriault (1671-) md Marie Bourg 3) Catherine Theriault (1673-) md Martin Aucon
2 CONT
2 CONT Andree married 2nd Emmanuel Hebert in about 1680 in Port-Royal, NS, Canada. They are the parents of the following: 1) Guillaume (1681-) md Marie-Josephe Dupuis 2) Marguerite (1682-1727) md Jean Thibodeau 3) Jean (1683-) md Madelei
2 CONC ne Dugas 4) Jacques (1684-1747) md Marguerite Landry 5) Alexandre (1685-1755) md Marie-Josephe Dupuis 6) Martin (1687-1700)
