2 CONT Finally, by 1714, Emmanuel and Andrée, age about 61 and 68, were living alone.≤ref>Tim Hebert; Transcription of the 1714 Acadian Census, atPort-Royal, Acadie [http://freepages.rootsweb.com/~acadiancajun/genealogy/1714cens.htm 1714
