2 CONT Andrée died 25 Jul 1727 in Port-Royal and was buried there the next day. She was around 80 years old. Witnessed by Jean Duon and Denios Petitot who both signed.≤ref>[https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=1599 Buri
