2 CONT Germain was the oldest son of Claude Thériot & Marie Gautrot.
2 CONT He married at Port Royal in l'Acadie to Anne Richard,
2 CONT daughter of Michel Richard dit Sansoucy & Madeleine Blanchard. They had eleven children.
