2 CONT !INFORMATION: was taken from Historire ET Généalogie Des Acadiens by Bona ARSENAULT, Tome1 page 516. THERIAULT et THERIOT aussi: TERRIAULT, TERRIO, TERRIOT, THERRIO, THERRIOT. Claude TERRIOT né en 1637, fils de Jean et de Perrine 
2 CONC BOURG, marié vers 1661, a Marie GAUTEROT, fille de Francois et d'Edmée LEJEUNE. ENFANTS: Germain 1662; Marie 1665; Marguerite 1667; Jean 1670; Anne 1672; Jeanne 1674; Claude 1678; Marie 1679; Madeleine 1681; Pierre 1684; Elizabeth
2 CONC  1685; Joseph 1687; Marie 1691. Claude TERRIOT a été inhumé à Port Royal, le 17 Se 1725 et Marie GAUTEROT, sa veuve, a été inhumé, le 30 Nov1732. !INFORMATION: was taken from Historire ET Généalogie Des Acadiens by Bona ARSENAULT,
2 CONC  Tome1 page 517. THERIAULT et THERIOT aussi: TERRIAULT, TERRIO, TERRIOT, THERRIO, THERRIOT. Germain TERRIOT né en 1662; Jean TERRIOT, né en 1670 et Claude TERRIOT, né en 1678, fils de Claude et de Marie GAUTEROT, se sont établis à
2 CONC  Grand Pré, paroisse de Saint Joseph de la rivière aux Canards.
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT GERMAIN TERRIOT b. 1662 son of Claude Terriot and Marie Gauterot ofPort-Royal. M. 1685 ANNE RICHARD daughter of Michel and MadeleineBlanchard. (Ref. Histoire et Généalogie des Acadien by Bona Arsenault Vol. 3 P. 1293 1671 Census o
2 CONC f Port Royal Germain (born 1665), Marguerite (born 1667), Jean (born 1670), Jeanne(born 1675), Claude (born 1678), Marie (born 1681), Madeleine (born 1681), Pierre (born 1684), Elizabeth(born 1686), Joseph (born 1687), Marie (born
2 CONC  1691), Marguerite (born 1690). JACQUES TERRIOT b. 1691 son of Germain Terriot and Anne Richard, m.Saint-Charles des Mines October 2nd 1713 MARIE LEBLANC daughter of RenéLeBlanc and Anne Bourgeois M2 Port-Royal June 3rd 1726 Marie
2 CONC -MadeleineRobichaud daughter of Prudent Henriette Petitpas. ( Ref. Histoire etGénéalogie des Acadien by Bona Arsenault Vol. 3 P. 1295). ÉTIENNE TTHÉRIAU b. 1725 son of Jacques Terriot and Marie LeBlanc, m.1747 to Hélène Landry ( ?
2 CONC  daughter of René and Marie-Madeleine Melançon)( Ref. Histoire et Généalogie desAcadien by Bona Arsenault Vol. 3 P.1299). I have Germain Theriot (s/o Claude Theriot & Marie Gauterot), married1686 in Grand Pre to Marie Anne Richard
2 CONC , b. 1670 Port Royal, d. May 07,1745. Marie Anne Richard d/o Michel Richard (b. 1630 La Saintonge, France, d.abt 168 Port Royal) and Madeliene Blanchard (b. 1643 France). Sources: Parish of Port Royal census of 1671. Janet Jehn Ac
