2 CONC LOGIE DES ACADIENS, p. 754 (Port Royal, wife's entry), & own entry p. 805, both spelled TERRIOT, says he settled at the parish of the river "aux Canards," at Grand-Pré. Entry on p. 1293 (Grand Pré).::!EDUCATION: He could sign his 
2 CONC name, as on daughter Margueritte's marriage record at Grand Pré in 1726 (SGA-2, 238).
2 CONT ::CHILDREN-MARRIAGE: Witnessed son Germain's marriage in Nov 1734.*[http://www.nosorigines.qc.ca/GenealogieQuebec.aspx?genealogie=Theriault_Germain&pid=973376&lng=fr Nos Origines]
