2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT :'''NOTICES''': This profile is protected by the [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Project:Acadians Acadian Project] because of frequent duplication, variantname spellings and attempts to add unsourced parents. Please contact the Aca
2 CONC dian Project before making any substantive changes. Thanks for helping make WikiTree the best site for accurate information.
2 CONT :This Marguerite has a sister also named Marguerite who was born about1786 and who married on 26 January 1712, at Port Royal, Acadia, Rene Richard dit Beaupre ca 1688-1776.≤ref>Claude TERRIOT 60; Marie GOTROT 53 (wife) 53; Marie 1
2 CONC 8; Claude 17; Magdelaine 15; Pierre 13; Joseph 10; Margueritte 8; 12 cattle, 20 sheep, 12 hogs, 18 arpents, 50 fruit trees, 1 gun≤/ref>
2 CONT ----:'''Marguerite Theriot''', daughter of Claude Theriot and Marie Gautrot, was born around 1666-1667; she was age 4 in 1671, age 12 in 1678, age 20 in 1686
2 CONT :A death date of 28 APR 1777 at Becancour, Quebec, Canada, at age 109-110 was entered but was unsourced and has been removed. Caution is advised. She isn't on the census of 1752 (La Roque).
2 CONT
