2 CONT *Bona Arsenault, HISTOIRE ET GENEALOGIE DES ACADIENS; 1625-1810; Ottawa, Editions Lemeac, 1978, 6 vols.; p. 805 (Port Royal). Name spelled TERRIOT, born 1670, he settled on the Riviere-aux-Canards, at Grand-Pr. On p. 1294 (Grand P
2 CONC ré), name spelled Jean TERRIOT, born 1670, married around 1692 to Jeanne LANDRY; nine children.
