2 CONT == Biography ==:Anne Theriot, daughter of Claude Theriot and Marie Gautrot, was born in Port-Royal around 1670-1672. Her birth year is estimated based on the census of 1678 which calculated her birth year as 1672. Around 1688she m
2 CONC arried Vincent Babin≤ref> ”Dictionnaire Généalogique des Familles Acadiennes”; Stephen A. White; 2 vols., Moncton, New Brunswick: Centre d'Études Acadiennes, 1999. p. 1485≤/ref>Note: Another Anne Theriot with different parents was
2 CONC  born in PR about the same time.
2 CONT :Children≤ref>Karen Theriot Reader's family tree, geneanet.com [https://gw.geneanet.org/katheriot?lang=en&pz=frederick+joseph&nz=theriot&ocz=1&p=anne&n=theriot Anne Theriot]≤/ref>
