2 CONT Only 6 children...Jeanne Theriot and Benard Gaudet
2 CONT Jeanne married Bernard Gaudet in 1693, in Acadie. They are the parents of the following:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Pierre Gaudet (1698-) md Marie Beliveau
2 CONT 2) Agnes Gaudet (1705-) md Charles Beliveau
2 CONT 3) Jeanne Gaudet (1708-) md Pierre Belliveau
2 CONT 4) Madeleine Gaudet (1710-) md Jean Belliveau
2 CONT 5) Claude Gaudet (1713-) md Chaterine-Josephe Forest
2 CONT 6) Isabelle Gaudet (1720-) unmarried
2 CONT
