2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT == Biography ==:'''NOTICE''': this profile is protected by the [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Project:Acadians Acadian Project] because of frequent duplication, variant name spellings and attempts to add unsourced parents. Please 
2 CONC contact the Acadian Project before making any substantive changes. Thanks for helping make WikiTree the best site for accurate information.
2 CONT ----:Jeanne Terriot was born in 1674 in Port-Royal, Acadie. She was 4 years old on the 1678 Port-Royal census. Her parents were [[Thériot-73|Claude Thériot]] and [[Gautrot-20|Marie Gautrot]]. She married [[Gaudet-5|Bernard Gaudet]
2 CONC ] in 1693  ≤ref name="DGFA">"Dictionnaire Généalogique des Familles Acadiennes"; Stephen A. White; 2 vols., Moncton, NewBrunswick: Centre d'Études Acadiennes, 1999; p. 1485.≤/ref> Jeanne, is age 23 and the wife of Bernard Godet, a
2 CONC ge 25 in 1686, Port-Royal census.:Together Jeanne and Bernard had 8 [https://gw.geneanet.org/katheriot?lang=en&pz=frederick+joseph&nz=theriot&ocz=1&p=jeanne&n=theriot children]:
2 CONT # [[Gaudet-528|Pierre]]
2 CONT # [[Gaudet-753|Claude]]
2 CONT # [[Gaudet-1459|Marie]] ca 1702-1720
2 CONT # [[Gaudet-30|Agnès]]
2 CONT # [[Gaudet-6|Jeanne]]
2 CONT # [[Gaudet-743|Marie Madeleine]]
2 CONT # [[Gaudet-753|Claude ]] 1713-/1786
2 CONT # [[Gaudet-578|Isabelle]]
2 CONT :She died on March 21, 1751 in Annapolis Royal (formerly Port-Royal, Acadie renamed in 1710).≤ref>The Registers of St. Jean-Baptiste, Annapolis Royal, 1702-1755, register RG 1 volume 26a page 430; online database with images, [htt
2 CONC ps://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=3255  Jeanne Teriot burial 23 March 1751], accessed March 2020 ≤blockquote>
2 CONT Event	Burial≤br/>Name	Jeanne Teriot died 21 March 1751 , about sixty years old, widow of the late Bernard Godet≤br/>Witnesses	Claude Godet, Pierre Godet, Charles Beliveau≤/blockquote>≤/ref> ≤ref name="DGFA"/>
2 CONT === Recensements/Censuses ===:[http://www.acadian-cajun.com/1678cens.htm 1678 Acadian Census].≤ref>Hebert, Tim. “Recensement 1678, Port-Royal, Acadie.” Edited by Clarence d'Entremont. Acadian-Cajun Genealogy & History. Rootsweb.co
2 CONC m. Accessed October 21, 2019. https://freepages.rootsweb.com/~acadiancajun/genealogy/1678cens.htm.
2 CONT ≤/ref>
