2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT Marie was born about 1691.≤ref>White, Stephen A., Patrice Gallant, andHector-J Hébert. [[Space:Dictionnaire_généalogique_des_familles_acadiennes|''Dictionnaire Généalogique Des Familles Acadiennes.'']] Moncton, N.-B.: Centre D'étu
2 CONC des Acadiennes, Université De Moncton, 1999, Print, p. 1486 (cites "Rc PR 1693 2a, 1700 9a").≤/ref>  She was listed in the 1693 census at age 2 ≤ref>Tim Hebert; Transcription of the 1693 Acadian Census at Port-Royal, Acadie [http:
2 CONC //freepages.rootsweb.com/~acadiancajun/genealogy/1693cens.htm 1693 Census Transcribed]. The original census can be found at [http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c2572/2?r=0&s=1 Acadian Census microfilm C-2572 of the 
2 CONC National Archives of Canada] “Acadie Recensements 1671 – 1752”, Images 62-108≤blockquote> at Port Royal:  Claude TERRIOT 55, Marie GOUTROT 48, Jeanne 18, Claude 15, Marie 12, Madeleine 12, Pierre 9, Elisabeth 7, Joseph 6, Marie 2;
2 CONC  12 cattle, 15 sheep, 7 pigs, 15 arpents, 1 gun  ≤/blockquote>≤/ref> and in 1700 at age 9.≤ref>Tim Hebert; Transcription of the 1700 Acadian Census at Port-Royal, Acadie [http://freepages.rootsweb.com/~acadiancajun/genealogy/1700c
2 CONC ens.htm 1700 Census Transcribed]. The original census can be found at [http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c2572/2?r=0&s=1 Acadian Census microfilm C-2572 of the National Archives of Canada] “Acadie Recensements 1671
2 CONC  –1752”, Images 151-173.≤blockquote>at Port-Royal : Claude TERRIOT 62; Marie GOUTROT (wife) 55; Claude 22; Pierre 16; Joseph 13; Marie 19; Madelaine 17; Elisabeth 14; Marie 9; Marguerite 7; 10 cattle, 13 sheep, 15 arpents 1 gun.≤/
2 CONC blockquote>≤/ref> 
