1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Sources:'''
2 CONT **"Acadian Immigrants to San Gabriel/Manchac, 1785 " - http://www.acadiansingray.com
2 CONT ***At Pointe-à-la-Jeunesse, Île Royale, Mar 1752, called François Ebert, age 38
2 CONT ***Deported from Île Royale to St.-Malo, France, aboard one of the Five Ships 25 Nov 1758
2 CONT ***Arrived St.-Malo 23 Jan 1759, age 44
2 CONT ***At Pleslin, France, a widower, 1759-72
2 CONT ***In Poitou, France, 1773-75
2 CONT ***In Fourth Convoy from Châtellerault to Nantes, France, Mar 1776
2 CONT ***On list of Acadians at Nantes, France, Sep 1784, listed singly
2 CONT ***Sailed to LA on Le Bon Papa, age 72, listed singly
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Notes:'''
2 CONT **Arrived in current day Louisiana 1785
2 CONT ----
