2 CONT
2 CONT Married Madeleine Landry. The family was deported to Massachusetts and eventually they made their way to "Lapraire."
2 CONT
2 CONT There was an "Aman" Landry who was among the 483 men whom Col. Winslow confined on the 10th September, 1755, at Grand Pre. He is listed to be from the village of "Antoine" and was the owner of 4 bullocks, 5 cows, 15 young cattle, 
2 CONC 28 sheep, 18 hogs and 2 horses; one son listed.
2 CONT --------------------
