1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LCX3-Q7T
2 CONT Brief Life History of Pierre'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Pierre Hebert dit Perroche was born about 1707, in Acadia, New France, his father, Pierre Hébert, was 32 and his mother, Elisabeth Landry, was 23. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Madeleine Gaudet about 1723, in Beaubassin, Nova Scotia, British North America. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 6 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 15 December 1757, in Quebec, Canada, at the age of 51.
