1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Augustin LeBlanc (1724-1786) was born in Grand Pre. He married Francoise Hebert in 1752. She was the daughter of Jean Batiste Hebert and Elizabeth Granger. They were also caught up in the Great Expulsion and sent t
2 CONC o Massachusetts.  Their son, Pierre, was born in Worchester. Augustin requested to be sent to a French Territory on August 14, 1763; he requested to be sent to St Dominque on December 1, 1765. Finally, after the June 2, 1766, requ
2 CONC est to be transferred to Canada, it was granted. They returned to Quebec in 1767. Francoise died March 3, 1769, at Yamachiche, Quebec. Augustin died July 13, 1786, also in Yamachiche. 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Source ===
