2 CONT
2 CONT Husband: Jean LANDRY (L536)    Born: 1698             at: Riviere-aux-Vieux-Habitants, Acadia, Canada  1  
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: 1719    at: Grand Pre, Acadia, Canada    
2 CONT *  Father:Antoine LANDRY
2 CONT *  Mother:Marie THIBODEAU
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife: Madeleine MELANSON 1 (M452)    Born: ABT 1697  at: Acadia, Canada     Died: 1769 at: Yamachiche, Quebec, Canada  
2 CONT *  Father:Philippe Charles MELANSON
2 CONT *  Mother:Marie Catherine DUGAS
2 CONT
2 CONT CHILDREN
2 CONT # Antoine LANDRY 1    Born: 1720             at: St-Charles des Mines, Grand Pre, Acadia, Canada   
2 CONT # Honore LANDRY 1   Born: 1721             at:    
2 CONT # Marie-Madeleine LANDRY 1   Born: 1722             at: St-Charles des Mines, Grand Pre, Acadia, Canada   
2 CONT # Marguerite LANDRY 1   Born: 1724             at: St-Charles des Mines, Grand Pre, Acadia, Canada   
2 CONT # Marie LANDRY 1   Born: 1725             at: St-Charles des Mines, Grand Pre, Acadia, Canada   
2 CONT # Marie-Josephe LANDRY 1   Born: 2 DEC 1726       at: Grande Pre, Acadia, Canada;  Married: 8 NOV 1745 at: St-Charles aux Mines, Grand, Acadia, Canada;   Died: 1755  at: Virginia 1; Spouses: Jean-Baptiste LEBLANC   
2 CONT # Jean LANDRY 1   Born: 1728   at: St-Charles des Mines, Grand Pre, Acadia, Canada     Died:  at: St-Malo, Bretagne, France   
2 CONT # Anne-Osithee LANDRY 1   Born: 1730             at: St-Charles des Mines, Grand Pre, Acadia, Canada   
2 CONT # Rene LANDRY 1   Born: 1732             at:    
2 CONT # Joseph LANDRY 1   Born: 1733 at: St-Charles des Mines, Grand Pre, Acadia, Canada     Died: 1787  at:    
2 CONT # Paul LANDRY 1   Born: 1735             at: St-Charles des Mines, Grand Pre, Acadia, Canada   
2 CONT # Charles LANDRY 1   Born: 1738             at: St-Charles des Mines, Grand Pre, Acadia, Canada   
2 CONT # Simon-Pierre LANDRY 1   Born: 1740             at: St-Charles des Mines, Grand Pre, Acadia, Canada   
