1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/KC1Z-5RY
2 CONT Brief Life History of Joseph'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Joseph Landry was born on 20 March 1733, in Acadia, New France, his father, Jean Baptiste Landry, was 35 and his mother, Madeleine Melanson, was 37. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He had at least 7 sons and 7 daughters with Marie Madeleine Doiron. 
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Landry 1755–1811
2 CONT Joseph Landry 1756–
2 CONT Madeleine Landry 1758–
2 CONT Joseph Landry 1760–1849
2 CONT Marie Landry 1761–
2 CONT Paul Landry 1767–1783
2 CONT Marguerite Landry 1767–1797
2 CONT Pierre Landry 1767–
2 CONT Madeleine Landry 1767–1788
2 CONT Marie Josephe Landry 1769–
2 CONT Antoine Louis Isaac Landry 1772–1791
2 CONT Simon Landry 1775–1827
2 CONT Mary Landry 1775–
2 CONT Marie Louise Landry 1779–1843
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 21 March 1787, in Sainte-Anne-d'Yamachiche, Montreal, Quebec, British North America, at the age of 54.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Sources:'''
