1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Sources:'''
2 CONT **Drouin Institute (Archived marriage record - see attached in Media tab)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/GQHW-41L
2 CONT Brief Life History of Augustin'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Augustin LeJeune was born in 1726, in Pisiguit, Nova Scotia, British North America, his father, Pierre LeJeune/Landry, was 36 and his mother, Jeanne Benoît, was 35. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Josèphe Chenet on 23 November 1750, in Isle St-Jean, Acadia, New France. They were the parents of at least 1 daughter. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 13 December 1758, in At Sea, at the age of 32.
