1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Sources:'''
2 CONT **Drouin Institute (Archived marriage record - see attached in Media tab)
2 CONT
2 CONT https://mnoc.ca/english/who-we-are/metis-ancestors/
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/166823807/jean-baptiste-roy
2 CONT
2 CONT Jean-Baptiste was born in about 1691, as he was 21 on the Grand-Pré marriage register. He is the son of Jean dit Laliberte de Roy and Marie-Christine Aubois (Amerindienne). He married (1) Jeanne Lejeune on 3 October 1712, in Grand
2 CONC -Pré, Acadie, per S. White. They are the parents of at least the following:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Prosper (1716-1730)
2 CONT
2 CONT He married (2) Francoise Corporon prior to 31 December 1747, per PRDH. They are believed to be the parents of the following:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Marie-Cecile (1751-1805) md Jacques-Christophe Fausberg Montagne
2 CONT 2) Francoise-Elisabeth (1767-) md Jean-Baptiste Bergeron
2 CONT 3) Madeleine (1767-) md Henri-Fredric King
