2 CONT **Passenger List for Le Bon Papa - May 10, 1785 - July 29, 1785 - France to New Orleans (age: 52)
2 CONT
2 CONT **"Acadian Immigrants to San Gabriel/Manchac, 1785 " - http://www.acadiansingray.com
2 CONT ***At Baie-des-Espagnols, Île Royale, Apr 1752, age 20
2 CONT ***Deported from Île Royale to St.-Malo, France, aboard one of the Five Ships 25 Nov 1758
2 CONT ***Arrived St.-Malo 23 Jan 1759, age 26
2 CONT ***At St.-Suliac, France, 1759-64
2 CONT ***At St.-Servan-sur-Mer, France, 1764-72
2 CONT ***In Poitou, France, 1773-75
2 CONT ***In Third Convoy from Châtellerault to Nantes, France, Dec 1775
2 CONT ***Sailed to la Luisiana on Le Bon Papa, age 52
2 CONT ***On list of Acadians at Baton Rouge, 1788, listed as Eustaquio Lejene
2 CONT ***On list of inhabitants of Baton Rouge, Nov 1792, listed as Eustache Lejeune
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Notes:'''
2 CONT **Arrived in current day Louisiana 1785
2 CONT ----
