2 CONT **Passenger List for Le Bon Papa - May 10, 1785 - July 29, 1785 - France to New Orleans (age: 45)
2 CONT
2 CONT **"Acadian Immigrants to San Gabriel/Manchac, 1785 " - http://www.acadiansingray.com
2 CONT ***At Baie-des-Espagnois, Île Royale, Apr 1752, age 15
2 CONT ***Deported from Île Royale to St.-Malo, France, 25 Nov 1758 aboard Supply
2 CONT ***Arrived St.-Malo 9 Mar 1759, age 22
2 CONT ***Settled near his brother at Châteanneuf, France, where he worked as a sailor
2 CONT ***Embarked on corsair L'Hercules from St.-Malo 20 Apr 1760, captured by the Royal Navy & held as a prisoner of war in England until early 1763
2 CONT ***Returned to St.-Malo
2 CONT ***In Poitou, France, 1773-75
2 CONT ***In Third Convoy from Châtellerault to Nantes, France, Dec 1775
2 CONT ***On list of Acadians at Nantes, Sep 1784
2 CONT ***Sailed to la Luisiana on Le Bon Papa, age 45[sic]
2 CONT ***On list of Acadians at Baton Rouge, 1788, listed as Gregorio LeJoune
2 CONT ----
