2 CONT Jean Robichaud dit Cadit and Marie Leger dit Rosette were married on November 23, 1717 in Port-Royal, Acadia (Nova Scotia).Their children born in Cobequid (Truro) Nova Scotia.Joseph Robichaud born September 29, 1718.Jean Robichaud
2 CONC  born about 1721.Jean Rene Robichaud born about 1726.Madeleine Robichaud born about 1728.Pierre Robichaud born about 1730.Francois Robichaud born about 1734.Marie Josephe Robichaud born about 1736.Anne Robichaud born about 1739.
