1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.genealogy.com/ftm/r/o/b/Kenneth-W-Robichau/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-0545.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Pierre Robichaux (son of Jean Robichaud and Marie Leger) was born 1730 in Cobequid, Acadia, Nova Scotia, and died August 23, 1783 in Nantes, France.He married (1) Anne Marie Blanchard on 1758.He married (2) Anne Hebert on November
2 CONC  17, 1761 in St Suliac, France, daughter of Jean Hebert and Marie Magdeliene Doirion.
2 CONT  Includes NotesNotes for Pierre Robichaux:
2 CONT
2 CONT Homes: Pierre and first wife, Anne Marie Blanchard, were part of the groupdeported from Acadia after the capture of Louisbourg.They were transportedon one of the 'five ships' and arrived at St Malo, France on January 23,1759. Anne
2 CONC  Marie was about four months pregnant when they arrived.She and thebaby died several days after the birth. He resided with his family in St SuliacParish from 1759 to 1772. Pierre and his second wife Anne Hebert and threechildren w
2 CONC ere in the 4th convoy leaving Chatellerault for Nantes from March 6to March 13, 1776. He resided in Nantes until his death in 1783. His widow,Anne Hebert, and four children, including Joseph, were aboard the St Remi whenit sailed 
2 CONC for Louisiana June 20, 1785.
2 CONT
2 CONT Work: Day laborer.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: Witnesses Jean Hebert, father of bride, Pierre Dugas, FrancoisBlanchart, Pierre Harseman, Jean Baptiste Hebert and Jean Huet. More About Pierre Robichaux and Anne Marie Blanchard: Marriage: 1758
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Pierre Robichaux and Anne Hebert: Marriage: November 17, 1761, St Suliac, France.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Pierre Robichaux and Anne Marie Blanchard are:
2 CONT # Francoise Marguerite Robichaux, b. May 19, 1759, St Suliac, Ille Et Vilaine, France, d. May 22, 1759, St Suliac, Ille Et Vilaine, France.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Pierre Robichaux and Anne Hebert are:
2 CONT # Elizabeth Robichaux, d. March 26, 1783, St Nicholas, Nantes, France.
2 CONT # Jean Pierre Robichaux, b. March 08, 1763, St Suliac, Ille Et Vilaine, France, d. April 02, 1773, St Suliac, Ille Et Vilaine, France.
2 CONT # Joseph Francois Robichaux, b. September 05, 1764, St Suliac, Ille Et Vilaine, France, d. December 13, 1771, St Suliac, Ille Et Vilaine, France.
2 CONT # Laurant Xavier Robichaux, b. April 24, 1766, St Suliac, Ille Et Vilaine, France, d. date unknown.
2 CONT # Marie Josephe Robichaux, b. February 15, 1768, St Suliac, Ille Et Vilaine, France, d. date unknown.
2 CONT # Anne Theotiste Robichaux, b. March 04, 1770, St Suliac, Ille Et Vilaine, France, d. date unknown.
2 CONT # +Joseph Gervais Robichaux, b. June 19, 1772, St Suliac, Ille Et Vilaine, France, d. July 19, 1858, Paincourtville, Assumption, Louisiana.
2 CONT # Magdaleine Anne Robichaux, b. July 28, 1774, Leigne-Les-Bois, Vienne, France, d. date unknown.
2 CONT # Jean Baptist Robichaux, b. March 01, 1775, St Jaques, Vienne, France, d. date unknown.
2 CONT # Jean Pierre Robichaux, b. 1783, St Malo, Nantes, France, d. date unknown.
2 CONT
