2 CONT Louis Amirault in 1762 at Connecticut and the marriage was
2 CONT rehabilitated
2 CONT at Assomption in 1767.4 children by louis.Marie listed as daughter on
2 CONT mariage
2 CONT record of Joseph Richard et Marie-Josephe Comeau par Bona
2 CONT Arseneau,Histoire
2 CONT et Genealogy des Acadiens pg.1058.
