1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT [[Category:Acadians]]
2 CONT [[Category: Grand-Pré, Acadie]]
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT :Marie-Cecile LeBlanc was born in Grand Pré, Acadie about 1686. She died May 1731 in Grand-Pré and was buried there 26 May 1731. ≤ref>Title: Catholic Church Records, vol. 1a: Acadian Records, 1707-1748
2 CONT Author: Diocese of Baton Rouge
2 CONT Publication: Diocese, 1999,Note: The Registers of St. Charles aux Mines in Acadia, from Grand Pr, carried into exile to St. Gabriel Church of Iberville, LA.
2 CONT p. 125:Text: Age ca. 25, wife of Michel BOUDROT, daughter of Jacque LEBLANC (SGA-2, 109)≤/ref> Marie-Cecile LeBlanc and Michel Boudrot were married about 1708 in Grand-Pré. The couple had 11 children.≤ref>  Stephen A. White, DICTI
2 CONC ONNAIRE GENEALOGIQUE DES FAMILLES ACADIENNES; 1636-1714; Moncton, New Brunswick, Centre d'Etudes Acadiennes, 1999, 2 vols.; pp. 207 & 986; own copy. :Ce'cile LE BLANC, daughter of Jacques & Catherine HE'BERT, born probably after t
2 CONC he 1686 census. On the 1693 census at Les Mines she was listed as Genevieve, age 9 years (sic). She married around 1708 to MichelBOUDROT, son of Claude & Anne-Marie THIBODEAU. She was buried (Grand Pré Register) 26 May 1731, age 4
2 CONC 5 years. Present was Jacques LeBLANC,her father.≤/ref>
2 CONT [http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=katheriot&id=I2670 Children]
2 CONT # Michel BOUDROT b: Abt 1707 in Acadia# Anne Marie BOUDROT b: 5 Mar 1709 in Grand Pré, Acadia c: 5 Mar 1709in Grand Pré, Acadia# Francois (dit Lami) BOUDROT b: 10 Aug 1710 in Grand Pré, Acadia c: 10 Aug 1710 in Grand Pré, Acadia# 
2 CONC Francoise BOUDROT b: 14 Jan 1712 in Grand Pré, Acadia c: 15 Jan 1712 in Grand Pré, Acadia
2 CONT # Cecile BOUDROT b: Abt 1714 in Grand Pré, Acadia
2 CONT # Jean Baptiste BOUDROT b: Abt 1715 in Grand Pré, Acadia# Rene BOUDROT b: Aug 1717 in Grand Pré, Acadia c: 15 Aug 1717 in Grand Pré, Acadia# Pierre BOUDROT b: 16 Dec 1720 in Grand Pré, Acadia c: 16 Dec 1720 in Grand Pré, Acadia# H
2 CONC onore BOUDROT b: 17 Jan 1724 in  Acadia c: 19 Mar 1724 in Grand Pr, Acadia# Marguerite BOUDROT b: 12 Oct 1725 in GGrand Pré, Acadia c: 13 Oct 1725 in Grand Pré, Acadia# Olivier BOUDROT b: 20 May 1728 in Grand Pré, Acadia c: 20 May
2 CONC  1728 in Grand Pré, Acadia
