2 CONC  GEDmatch  M695728 and [[Lajiness-24| Kevin Lajiness]] GEDmatch M658673 sharing a 10.8 cM segment on chromosome 1 from232938635 - 236793313 (10.394 cM), 232938635 - 236788800 Overlap withprevious match
