2 CONT == Biography =='''Francoise Boudrot''' was born 14 Jan 1712. She was the daughter of [[Boudrot-1|Michel Boudrot]] and [[LeBlanc-3|Marie-Cécile LeBlanc]]. She was baptized the day after her birth at Saint Charles des Mines. Her god
2 CONC parents were Bernard Leblanc and Anne Boudrot.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Charles-des-Mines (Grand-Pré, N.-É.) - 1869;  Canadiana, Heritage, Parish registers:Nova Scotia : C-1869 (Image 
2 CONC 62): http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1870/62?r=0&s=5≤/ref>
2 CONT At age 20 she married Charles Prejeant age 27, son of Jean Prejeant and Andree Savoye 18 Aug 1732 at Saint Charles des Mines, Grand-Pré, Acadia. ≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Charles-des-M
2 CONC ines (Grand-Pré, N.-É.) - 1869;  Canadiana, Heritage, Parish registers: Nova Scotia : C-1869 (Image 666): http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1870/666?r=0&s=5≤/ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT : Husband:  [[Prejean-99|Charles Prejean]]
2 CONT : Wife:  [[Boudrot-185|Francoise Boudrot]]
