2 CONT == Biography =='''Pierre Boudrot''' was born 16 Dec 1720. He was the son of [[Boudrot-1|Michel Boudrot]] and [[LeBlanc-3|Marie-Cécile LeBlanc]].  He was baptized the same day he was born at Saint Charles des Mines, Grand-Pr, Acadi
2 CONC a. His godparents were Estienne Boudrot and Marie Bourg.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Charles-des-Mines (Grand-Pré, N.-É.) - 1869;  Canadiana, Heritage, Parish registers: Nova Scotia : C-1
2 CONC 869 (Image 136): http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1870/136?r=0&s=4≤/ref>
