2 CONT == Biography =='''Honore Boudrot''' was born 17 Jan 1724. He was the son of [[Boudrot-1|Michel Boudrot]] and [[LeBlanc-3|Marie-Cécile LeBlanc]]. He was baptized 19 Mar 1724 at Saint Charles des Mines, Grand-Pré, Acadia. Hisgodpare
2 CONC nts were Paul Boudrot and Marie LeBlanc.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Charles-des-Mines (Grand-Pré, N.-É.) - 1869;  Canadiana, Heritage, Parish registers: Nova Scotia : C-1869 (Image 197):
