2 CONT **"Acadian Immigrants to Cabanocé/Cabahannocer, 1765" - http://www.acadiansingray.com
2 CONT ***At Restigouche Oct 1760, listed as Olivier Boudreau
2 CONT ***At Fort Edward, formerly Pigiguit, 9 Aug 1762, listed as Olivier Boudro
2 CONT ***Cabanocé, La Luisiana census, 1766, listed as Ollivie & Ollivier Boudrau, age 29[sic]
2 CONT ***Cabanocé, La Luisiana census, 1769, listed as Ollivier Boudreau, age 43[sic]
