2 CONC aux and Catherine Babin) m. 27 July 172 Joseph Boudrot (Claude Boudrot and decd. Anne Tibeaudo) wit. Claude Boudrot (s); Joseph Dugas (s); sig. {+} Joseph Boudrot; {+} Francoise Commeaux (SGA-1, 12)."
