1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/9HMR-9PD
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Marguerite'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Marguerite Hébert was born on 3 February 1712, in Saint-Charles-des-Mines, Grand-Pré, Acadia, New France, her father, Joseph Hébert, was 26 and her mother, Marie Anne Boudrot, was 23. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Pierre Arseneau about 1728, in Beaubassin, Acadia, New France. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 3 daughters.
2 CONT Marie Marguerite Arseneau 1732–1752
2 CONT Anne Marie Arsenault 1734–1764
2 CONT Marie Madeleine Arsenault 1741–1763
2 CONT Tranquille Arsenault 1743–
2 CONT
2 CONT
