2 CONT
2 CONT Charles married (1) Marguerite Leblanc on 12 January 1739, in Grand-Pre, Acadie.  He married (2) Ursule Forest (Laforest) in 1745 and they are the parents of the following:1) Marie-Josephe (1746-) unmarried2) Madeleine (1747-1770)
2 CONC  unmarried3) Agathe (1751-) unmarried4) Simon-Pierre (1753-1821) md (1) Marie-Rose Couture and (2) Marie-Louise Monbleau5) Paul-Olivier (1755-1830) md (1) Marie-Anne Granger and (2) Felicite Lanoue6) Jacques (1759-1783) unmarried7
2 CONC ) Mathurin (1762-1837) md Marie-Josephe Theriaque8) Jean-Baptiste (1764-1829) md (1) Nathalie Lanoue and (2) Elisabeth Manseau9) Firmin (1768-) md Marie-Anne Guerin10) Charles (1768-) md Julie HubertHe was buried on 3 January 1770
