2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT [[Category:Port-Royal, Acadie]]
2 CONT == Biography ==LRené LeBlanc was born in December 1685 in Port Royal, Acadia. His parents were [[LeBlanc-70|Jacques LeBlanc]] and [[Hébert-3425|CatherineHébert]]. He married [[Landry-1672|Jeanne Anne Landry]] around 1708.≤ref name
2 CONC ="DGFA>"Dictionnaire Généalogique des Familles Acadiennes";Stephen A. White; 2 vols., Moncton, New Brunswick: Centre d'Études Acadiennes, 1999; p. 986.≤/ref>Together they had 12 children:
2 CONT # [[LeBlanc-7484|Claire LeBlanc]]
2 CONT # [[LeBlanc-7311|Claude LeBlanc]]
2 CONT # [[LeBlanc-7774|Jean Baptiste LeBlanc]]
2 CONT # [[LeBlanc-7520|Marie Magdeleine LeBlanc]]
2 CONT # [[LeBlanc-2451|Jean Baptiste LeBlanc]]
2 CONT # [[LeBlanc-2806|Charles LeBlanc]]
2 CONT # [[LeBlanc-2804|Pierre LeBlanc]]
2 CONT # [[LeBlanc-5867|Marguerite LeBlanc]]
2 CONT # [[Leblanc-3073|Rene Leblanc]]
2 CONT # [[LeBlanc-7536|Olivier LeBlanc]]
2 CONT # [[LeBlanc-7776|Joseph LeBlanc]]
2 CONT # [[LeBlanc-7775|Madeleine LeBlanc]]
2 CONT # [[LeBlanc-1422|Joseph LeBlanc]]
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT ≤references />
2 CONT * BIRTH-MARRIAGE-CHILDREN-RESIDENCES: Bona Arsenault, HISTOIRE ET GENEALOGIE DES ACADIENS; 162 5-1810; Ottawa, Editions Lemeac, 1978, 6 vols.; pp. 1217-1218 (Grand Pré). Rene' LE BLANC, born 1686, son of Jacques & Catherine HE'BER
2 CONC T, married around 1708 to Jeanne LANDRY, daughterof Claude & Catherine [sic, should be Anne (Marie)] THIBODEAU; thirteen children. Rene' lived at Saint-Charles-des-Mines.
2 CONT * CENSUS: 1686, Port Royal, Acadia, age "0.1 mois" [one month]. [Was there a twin that died?]
