2 CONT **Arrived in current day Louisiana 1785
2 CONT **Went from Liverpool to Morlaix, settling at Kerlédan (Sauzon) on the island.  He was in Quimper in 1773.  Some of his family went to New Orleans with he and his wife on the La Bon Papa.
