1 NAME Honoré /Landry/
2 GIVN Honoré
2 SURN Landry
2 _MARNM Landry
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1714
2 ADDR
3 CITY Charles des Mines
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Honore's first marriage, November 26, 1742, was to Helene LeBlanc; his second marriage, on 15th May 1747, was to Magdelaine Gautrot (b.1723); both marriages took place at Saint-Charles-des-Mines.
2 CONT
2 CONT  As of 1752 they had the following children with them: Anselme (b.1743), Honore (b.c.1747), Madelaine (b.1750), & Joseph (b.1752).
2 CONT
2 CONT  According to Arsenault (p. 1207) Jean-Baptiste (b.1744) was the second son born to Helene, but he was not with the family in 1752; another child, Bibiane was born in 1755.
2 CONT
2 CONT Honore immigrated to P.E.I.
