2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT Madeleine Doucet was born about 1693.≤ref>Karen Theriot Reader [https://gw.geneanet.org/katheriot?lang=en&pz=frederick+joseph&nz=theriot&ocz=1&p=madeleine&n=doucet&oc=2 Madeleine Doucet] citing :1. Stephen A. White, DICTIONNAIRE G
2 CONC ENEALOGIQUE DES FAMILLES ACADIENNES; 1636-1714; Moncton, New Brunswick, Centre d'Etudes Acadiennes, 1999, 2 vols.; p. 538; own copy. She married (Grand Pré Register) 8 Feb 1712 to Claude LANDRY, son of Claude & Catherine THIBODEAU
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT :2. CENSUS: 1693, Les Mines, Acadia, age 4 months.
2 CONT :3. Arsenault, Histoire et Genealogie, p. 1153 (Grand Pre). Name givenjust Madeleine ≤/ref>
2 CONT Magdeleine Doucet (Jean Doucet and Francoise Blanchard, habitants de la Grand Pree) married 8 Feb 1712 Claude Landry (Claude Landry and Catherine Tibeaudo, habitans de Mines) wit. Claude Landry; Abraham Landry;Pierre Leblanc; Germ
2 CONC ain Landry; Jacques Leblanc ≤ref>http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1870/558?r=0&s=5≤/ref>(SGA-1, 53)
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT ≤references />* http://www.nosorigines.qc.ca/GenealogieQuebec.aspx?genealogy=Madeleine-Marguerite_Doucet&pid=19172&lng=en
