2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT Marie Josephete Landry was born 11 Nov 1712. She was the daughter of [[Landry-979|Claude Landry]] and [[Doucet-58|Madeleine Doucet]]. She was baptized the same day as her birth at Saint Charles des Mines. Her godparents were Claud
2 CONC e Landry and Francoise Blanchard.≤ref>http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1870/77?r=0&s=5≤/ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT ≤references />*Diocese of Baton Rouge Catholic Church Records: Acadian Records 1707-1748 (Baton Rouge, LA, Diocese of Baton Rouge, 1999), Personal Collection, Marriage of Estienne Comot and Marie Joseph Landry, p.50: "Estienne Com
