2 CONT == Biography =='''Vincent Landry''' was born 1 Nov 1719. He was the son of  [[Landry-979|Claude Landry]] and [[Doucet-58|Madeleine Doucet]]. He was baptized the same day as his birth at Saint Charles des Mines, Grand-Pré, Acadia. 
2 CONC His godparents were Claude Leblanc and Marie Babin.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Charles-des-Mines (Grand-Pré, N.-É.) - 1869;  Canadiana, Heritage, Parish registers: Nova Scotia : C-1869 (
2 CONC Image 122): http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1870/122?r=0&s=4≤/ref>
2 CONT
