2 CONT == Biography =='''Judith Landry''' was born about 1722. She was the daughter of [[Landry-979|Claude Landry]] and [[Doucet-58|Madeleine Doucet]]. She was baptized 20 July 1722 but no birth date was given. Her godparents were Claude
2 CONC  Landry and Isabelle Boudrot. ≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Charles-des-Mines (Grand-Pré, N.-É.) - 1869;  Canadiana, Heritage, Parish registers: Nova Scotia : C-1869 (Image 163): http://he
2 CONC ritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1870/163?r=0&s=4≤/ref>
2 CONT When she was 26, she married Claude Boudrot, age 40, son of Claude Boudrot and Catherine Landry 1 Dec 1747 at Saint Charles des Mines, Grand-Pré, Acadia. ≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Char
2 CONC les-des-Mines (Grand-Pré, N.-É.) - 1869;  Canadiana, Heritage, Parish registers: Nova Scotia : C-1869 (Image 800): http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1870/800?r=0&s=4≤/ref>
2 CONT
