2 CONT :Birth: 20 Jul 1722 in Grand Pré, Acadia 1
2 CONT :Christening: 20 Jul 1722 Grand Pré, Acadia
2 CONT :Death: 22 Sep 1810 in Pointe de l'Eglise, Nova Scotia, Canada 2
2 CONT
2 CONT :Father: Claude LANDRY II b: ABT 1689 in Mines, Acadia 
2 CONT :Mother: Madeleine DOUCET b: ABT 1693 in Grand Pré, Acadia
