2 CONT :Claire LeBlanc, daughter of [[LeBlanc-78|Rene LeBlanc]] and [[Bourgeois-24|Anne Bourgeois]], was born about 1700 in Grand-Pré, Acadie.≤refname="DGFA">Stephen A. White, "DICTIONNAIRE GENEALOGIQUE DES FAMILLESACADIENNES"; 1636-1714
