2 CONT ALEXIS4 LANDRY (CLAIRE3 LEBLANC, RENÉ2, DANIEL1) was born 25 August 
2 CONT 1721 in Grand-Pré, Acadia, and died 06 March 1798.  He married MARIE 
2 CONT THÉRIAULT 1744, daughter of JEAN THÉRIAULT and MADELEINE BOURQUE. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for MARIE THÉRIAULT: 
2 CONT Widow of Jean-Baptiste Cormier 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ALEXIS LANDRY and MARIE THÉRIAULT are: 
2 CONT i. THADÉE5 LANDRY, m. MARIE-ANNE CORMIER, 22 November 1808, Caraquet, New 
2 CONT Brunswick, Canada; b. 22 November 1762, L'Islet; d. 19 March 1817, 
2 CONT Pokemouche, New Brunswick, Canada. 
2 CONT ii. PIERRE LANDRY, m. MARGUERITE ALLAIN, Abt. 1770, Caraquet, New 
2 CONT Brunswick, Canada; b. Abt. 1750; d. 26 April 1825.
2 CONT
