2 CONT == Biography ==Marie Landry was born 30 Nov 1717. She was the daughter of [[Landry-36|Jean Landry]] and [[LeBlanc-68|Claire LeBlanc]]. She was baptized thesame day as her birth at Saint Charles des Mines. Her godparents wereClaude
2 CONC  Landry and Catherine Landry.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Charles-des-Mines (Grand-Pré, N.-É.) - 1869;  Canadiana, Heritage, Parish registers: Nova Scotia : C-1869 (Image 90):  http://her
2 CONC itage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1870/90?r=0&s=5≤/ref>
2 CONT At age 24 she married Louis LaBauve, age 24, son of Francois LaBauve and Madeleine Blou 24 Oct 1740 at Beaubassin.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada Fonds des Archives départementales de la Charente-Maritime [LaRochelle, France] : C
2 CONC -1207 Registres de Beaubassin - reel_c1207 MG 6 A 2 (Image 72) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1207/72?r=0&s=6≤/ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:Amand LABAUVE b: 25 Aug 1741 in Beaubassin, , , Acadia c: 25 Aug 1741in Beaubassin, , , Acadia:Marie Madeleine LABAUVE b: 20 Oct 1742 in Beaubassin, , , Acadia c: 20 Oct 1742 in Beaubassin, , , Acadia
2 CONT :Basile LABAUVE b: Abt 1744 in , , , Acadia:Helene LABAUVE b: 9 Mar 1748 in Beaubassin, , , Acadia c: 9 Mar 1748 in Beaubassin, , , Acadia
2 CONT :Etienne LABAUVE b: Abt 1750 in , Isle St. Jean, , Acadia:Toussaints LABAUVE b: 26 Nov 1753 in , Isle St. Jean, , Acadia c: 26 Nov 1753 in Port Lajoie, Isle St. Jean, , Acadia
2 CONT
