2 CONT **"Acadian Immigrants to Lafourche des Chitimachas/Valenzuéla, 1785-86" - http://www.acadiansingray.com
2 CONT ***Exiled to Province of Virginia 1755, age 16
2 CONT ***Deported to England 1756, age 17
2 CONT ***Repatriated to France aboard L'Ambition, arrived St.-Malo 23 May 1763, age 24
2 CONT ***At St.-Servan-sur-Mer, France, 1763-72
2 CONT ***Probably in Poitou, France, 1773-80
2 CONT ***At Cenan & Archigny, Poitou, 1779-80
2 CONT ***On list of Acadians at Nantes, France, Sep 1784, listed as Anastasie Boudrau
2 CONT ***Sailed to la Luisiana on ''Le St.-Rémi'', age 45
2 CONT ***Valenzuela, la Luisiana census, 1788, listed as Anastasie widow Comeau, age 47[sic]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
