2 CONT In 1752, Jean Daigle, Marie Anne Braud, his second wife, and their children: Jean, Charles, Paul, Francoise, Catherine, Felicite, Rose, Marie, Ursule, Marguerite, Anne Josephe, and Elizabeth Daigle were residents of Riviere-du-Mou
2 CONC lin-a-Scie on Ile St Jean. On 23 January 1759, Jean Daigle, widower, and his children, Paul, Marie, Ursule, Marguerite, Anne Josephe, and Jean disembarked at St Malo fromone of the "Five Ships." The Acadian Exiles in St Malo Robic
2 CONC haux
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
