2 CONT
2 CONT * married about 1689, from Port-Royal (Acadie)
2 CONT
2 CONT RICHARD, Marie Josèphe (Michel RICHARD dit SANSOUCY & Marie Madeleine BLANCHARD [44814])
2 CONT
2 CONT       1) Agnès, married about 1709 Denis BOUDREAU
2 CONT
2 CONT       2) Anne, born about 1693 (sép. 1757), died 1757-12-16, buried 1757-12-17 Saint-Charles (Bellechasse) (Qc), married about 1718 Jean DUBOIS
2 CONT
2 CONT       3) Antoine, married Grand-Pré (Saint-Charles-des-Mines) (Acadie) 1729-10-17 Madeleine LANDRY
2 CONT
2 CONT       4) Claire, married Grand-Pré (Saint-Charles-des-Mines) (Acadie) 1731-07-02 Jacques FOREST
2 CONT
2 CONT       5) Isabelle, married about 1715 Philippe THIBODEAU
2 CONT
2 CONT       6) Marguerite, married Grand-Pré (Saint-Charles-des-Mines) (Acadie) 1717-11-22 Jean SEMER
2 CONT
2 CONT       7) Marie, married Grand-Pré (Saint-Charles-des-Mines) (Acadie) 1709-10-07 François GAUTREAU
2 CONT
2 CONT       8) Pierre, married Beaubassin (Acadie) 1733-06-25 (classé 1733-10) Anne COMEAU
