2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT [[Category: Great Upheaval]]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT '''Elizabeth (Isabelle) Vincent''' was born about 1694. the 5th child of Michel Vincent and Marie Josephe Richard.
2 CONT She married Philippe Thibodeau (son of Pierre Thibodeau and Anne MarieBourg) in 1715.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had 10 children between 1716 and 1734.
2 CONT [http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=katheriot&id=I6426 Children]
2 CONT # Emilie THIBODEAU b: Abt 1716 in Pisiguit, Acadia
2 CONT # Angelique THIBODEAU b: Abt 1716 in Acadia
2 CONT # Francois THIBODEAU b: 1717 in Pisiguit, Acadia
2 CONT # Pierre THIBODEAU b: in Village-des-Thibodeau, Pigiguit, Acadia
2 CONT # Anne THIBODEAU b: Abt 1721 in Pisiguit, Acadia# Charles (dit Charlie) THIBODEAU b: Abt 1723 in Village-des-Thibodeau, Pisiguit, , Acadia
2 CONT # Theotiste THIBODEAU b: 1725 in Acadia
2 CONT # Amand THIBODEAU b: Abt 1727 in Pisiguit, Acadia
2 CONT # Elisabeth THIBODEAU b: Abt 1726 in Chipoudy, Acadia
2 CONT # Germain THIBODEAU b: Abt 1734 in Acadia
2 CONT
2 CONT She was deported to Boston Massachusetts around 1758.
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
