2 CONT == Biography =='''Emilienne Tibaudaux''' was born about 1716. She was the daughter of[[Thibeaudeau-17|Philippe Thibeaudeau]] and [[Vincent-414|Elisabeth Vincent]]. She married Paul Doueron, son of Noel Doueron and Marie Henry 23 S
2 CONC ept 1732 at Saint Charles des Mines, Grand-Pré, Acadia.≤ref>Library and Archives Canada, Fonds de la paroisse catholique Saint-Charles-des-Mines (Grand-Pré, N.-É.) - 1869;  Canadiana, Heritage, Parish registers: Nova Scotia : C-18
