2 CONC ght children. In 1752 he and wife and daughter Helene were residents of Riviere-Ouest on Isle St. Jean. On 23 Jan 1759 he and wife disembarked [alone]at St. Malo from one of the "Five ships." They resided at Pleurtuit 1759-1764 & 
2 CONC 1765-1772; at St. Servan 176 4-1765.
