2 CONT == Biography =='''Marie Joseph  Boudrot''' was born about 1698. She was the daughter of [[Boudrot-22|Charles Boudrot]] and [[Corporon-19|Marie Corporon]]. She married Pierre Tibodeau, son of Pierre Tibodeau and Anne Bourg 2 Oct 17
2 CONC 19 in Saint Charles des Mines.≤ref>http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1870/602?r=0&s=5≤/ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT === Name ===: Name:  Marie Josephte /BOUDREAU/≤ref>Source: [[#S1]]  Page:  Database online. Data:   Text:  Record for Charles Boudreau CONT http://trees.ancestry.com/pt/AMTCitationRedir.aspx?tid=0&pid=1586140356≤/ref>
