1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Pierre Lanoue (1706-1772) Born 4 January in Port-Royal. In 1730 in Mines, first marriage to Françoise Thibodeau, daughter of 
2 CONT
2 CONT Pierre and Anne-Marie Bourg in Pissiquit. Born 26 September 1708. On 4 November 1737 in Port Royal 2o marriage with Anne 
2 CONT
2 CONT Béliveau, daughter of Charles and Marie Melançon, born 3 June 1717. Deceased 29 February 1752. As widower was deported to
2 CONT
2 CONT New England in 1755. He arrived in Assomption, Quebec, in 1767. Passed away suddenly in St-Jacques de l'Achigan, Quebec 
2 CONT
2 CONT where he had settled after his exile. Present: Pierre Lanoue and Marin Granger. 
2 CONT
