2 CONT Taken from the following sources: 1. Pedigree Chart of: Joseph F. Brow 711 E. Osceola Ave. Lake Wales, FL 33853 (1994) 2. The French Canadian History by Gerard J. Brault; University Press of New England 3. La Famille Des Brault (w
2 CONC ritten in French) pgs 133 - 140 4. Marriage record from Loiselle Marriage Index (film#543,747) shows parents of both bride & groom, as well as date. 5. #145--"A Breau Genealogy" by Clarence T. Breaux & Robert Brault "After marriag
2 CONC e, Joseph settled at Petitcoudiac until 1739 when he moved to Riviere aux Canards. He and his family were deported to Massachusetts in 1755.On 25 Apr 1757 he is listed at Braintree MA as Joseph Braux without wife but with children
2 CONC  Joseph Jr., Aman, John Saml. and Margaret. In1760 he is listed as Joseph Brow Senr., sent from Hingham to Boston. With him was Elizabeth Pecot. It is not known if she was a second wife or whether she was a relative of his son Jos
2 CONC eph's wife. Also with him in 1760 were his father, Pierre, and his mother, Anne. The 14 Aug 1763 list of Acadians in Massachusetts shows Joseph Broux (Senior) with two sons. He was at L'Assomption, Assomption, Quebec, in 1767. the
2 CONC  only children of Jospeh and Isabelle are the four listed above."
2 CONT
