2 CONT
2 CONT When Jean Baptiste Cormier was born on 2 March 1733, in Beaubassin, Nova Scotia, British Colonial America, his father, Jean Pierre Cormier, was 38 and his mother, Marie Anne Cyr, was 35. He married Marie Madeleine Landry on 5 July
2 CONC  1762, in Kamouraska, Canada, New France. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 8 daughters. He died on 14 February 1822, in New Brunswick, British Colonial America, at the age of 88, and was buried in Saint Basile Cemetery
2 CONC , Edmundston, Madawaska, New Brunswick, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT No son Joseph listed.
2 CONT ----
