2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-40001-64071502/jean-baptiste-cormier-in-familysearch-family-tree FamilySearch Family Tree] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 7 2018, 3:47:07
2 CONC  UTC''
