2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT [[Category:Great Upheaval]] [[Category:Beaubassin, Acadie]]
2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT == Biography =='''Jean Baptiste Cormier''' was born 2 Mar 1734. He was the son of [[Cormier-77|Pierre Cormier]] and [[Thibodeau-22|Cecile Thibodeau]]. He was baptized 5 Apr 1734 at Beaubassin. His godparents were Pierre Tibaudaut 
2 CONC and Hermine Cormier.<ref>Library and Archives Canada Fonds des Archives départementales de la Charente-Maritime [La Rochelle, France] : C-1207 Registres de Beaubassin - reel_c1207 MG 6 A 2 (Image 46) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/v
2 CONC iew/oocihm.lac_reel_c1207/46?r=0&s=6</ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT Alternatively: Jean-Baptiste Cormier was born the 2nd of March 1733<ref name="Cormier">White, Stephen A. ''La généalogie des trente-sept familles hôtesses des "Retrouvailles 94"'' [https://www.umoncton.ca/umcm-ceaac/files/umcm-cea
2 CONC ac/wf/wf/pdf/37fam-cormier.pdf Cormier], Les Cahiers, La Société Historique Acadienne, Vol. 25, #2-3, 1994; Université de Moncton, p. 1 .:: Jean-Baptiste CORMIER, son of Pierre & Cécile THIBODEAU, born at Beaubassin on 2 Mar 1733,
2 CONC  married at Kamouraska 5 Jul 1762 to MadeleineLANDRY, daughter of Alexis & Marguerite AUCOIN. He died at St-Basile on 14 Feb 1822.</ref><ref name="Leger">Leger, Yvon, Beloved Acadia of my Ancestors (Translated by Antoine Bugeaud),
2 CONC  Montreal: Fleuve, 1992, Family 152, Pg 316.</ref> in Beaubassin, Acadia to parents Pierre Cormier and Cécile Thibodeau. 
2 CONT He married Madeleine Landry the 5th of July 1762<ref name="Cormier" /><ref name="Leger" /><ref>Quebec, Canada, Vital and Church Records (Drouin Collection), 1621-1968 [https://www.ancestry.com/interactive/1091/d13p_31171065/150036
2 CONC 27?backurl=https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/12463865/person/190090261050/facts/citation/680292979906/edit/record]</ref> in Kamouraska, Quebec, Canada. 
2 CONT
2 CONT PRDH records the following children for this union:
2 CONT
2 CONT :Jean François 1763-1763
2 CONT
2 CONT :Marie Madeleine 1764-1765
2 CONT
2 CONT :Marie Françoise 1766
2 CONT
2 CONT :Roger 1768
2 CONT
2 CONT :Jean François 1772
2 CONT
2 CONT :Pierre 1773
2 CONT
2 CONT :Marie Françoise 1786
2 CONT
2 CONT :Marie Thérèse Esther m. Toussaint Thibodeau 1799
2 CONT Jean-Baptiste died the 14th of February 1822<ref name="Cormier" /> in Saint-Basile, Madawaska County, New Brunswick, Canada at the age of 88-years-old.<ref>Madawaska, Nouveau-Brunswick, Régistre de la paroisseSaint-Basile-de-Madaw
2 CONC aska, catholique, 1792-1830 ( F.M. 9, A 11, vol 7-1), Image 611, [http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c3017/611?r=0&s=2 entry for Jean Baptiste Cormier] Burial 16 February 1822, digital images, Héritage, Genealogy co
2 CONC llection, Library and Archives Canada, reel C-3017, Parish Registers: New Brunswick : C-3017, accessed February 2020. </ref>
2 CONT
