2 CONT Joseph Cormier was born circa 1740 at Acadia.(1),(2) He was the son of Pierre C. Cormier and Cecile Thibodeaux.(2) He married Marguerite Sonnier circa 1760.(3) He married Anne Michel, daughter of Jacques Michel and Jeanne Breaux, 
2 CONC on 25 April 1771 at St. Martin de Tours Catholic Church, St. Martinville, St. Martin Parish, Louisiana.(1) He witnessed the marriage contract of Jean Baptiste Cormier & Anne Blanchard on 2 January 1779 at St. Martin Parish Courtho
2 CONC use, 400 S Main Street, St. Martinville, St. Martin Parish, Louisiana.(4) He witnessed the marriage of Fabien Richard and Francoise Adelaide Thibodeaux on 10 January 1779 at St. Martin de Tours Catholic Church, St. Martinville, St
2 CONC . Martin Parish, Louisiana.(5),(6),(7) He died before 20 June 1818 at Opelousas, St. Landry Parish, Louisiana.(8) He was the subject of a succession filed on 20 June 1818 at St. Landry Parish Courthouse, Opelousas, St. Landry Pari
2 CONC sh, Louisiana.(8)
2 CONT
