2 CONC AMORA (Opel. Ch.: v.1-A, p.39). (2) SWLR - St. Martin de Tours Catholic Church, CORMIER, Joseph de l'Acadie, now of Opelousas (Pierre C., widr. of Marguerite SAUNIER & Cecile THIBAUDEAU) m. 25 April 1771 Anne MICHEL, of Acadie, wi
2 CONC d. of Victor COMMAUT of Attakapa (Jacques & Jeanne BREAUD) Wits: Jean BERARD, J. GAIGNARD, GREVEMBER, MERCIER. Fr. IRENEE (SM Ch.: v.1, p.20). (3) SWLR - St. Martin de Tours Catholic Church, CORMIER, Susanne d'Acadie (Joseph & Mar
2 CONC guerite SONNE [SONNIER]) m. 10 Jan. 1779 Jean Baptiste GRANGE - of Opelousas, d'Acadie (Pierre & Euphrosine GAUTRO, Acadiens) Wits: Joseph GRANGE, Amon PREJEAN, Jean Baptiste CORMIER. Fr. Ange de REVILLA (SM Ch.: v.1, p.66). (4) S
2 CONC WLR - St. Martin Parish Courthouse, BLANCHARD, Anne - native of Acadie; resident of this parish m. contract dated: 2 Jan. 1779 Jean Baptiste CORMIE - native of Acadie; resident of this parish Wits: Joseph GRANGE, Pierre Victor RIC
2 CONC HARD, Joseph CORMIE; Alexandre Chevalier DECLOUET (SM Ct.Hse.: OA-vol.9-2, #67). (5) SWLR - St. Martin de Tours Catholic Church, RICHARD, Fabien (Pierre & Marguerite DUGAST- parishioners of Opelousas) m. 10 Jan. 1779 Francoise TIB
2 CONC ODO (Pierre & Francoise SONIER) Wits: Victor RICHARD, Joseph GRANGE, Joseph CORMIER. Fr. Ange De REVILLA, Cure of Ascension Parish (SM Ch.: Folio B-1). (6) SWLR - St. Martin de Tours Catholic Church, RICHARD, Fabien (Pierre & Marg
2 CONC uerite DUGA) m. 10 Jan. 1779 Francoise THIBAUDO (Pierre & Francoise SONNIER) Wits: Victor RICHARD, Joseph GRANGE, Joseph CORMIER. Fr. Ange de REVILLA (SM Ch.: v.1, p.67). (7) SWLR - St. Landry Catholic Church, RICHARD, Anne Eufras
2 CONC ie (Pierre Placide & Anastasie HEBERT) b. 27 Dec. 1819, bt. 6 July 1820 Pats: Fabien RICHARD & Francoise THIBEAUDAU; Mats: Pierre HEBERT & Anne Eleonore COMEAU; Spons: Antoine LABBE & Anne MARTIN. Fr. Flavius Henri ROSSI (Opel. Ch
2 CONC .: v.2, p.203). (8) SWLR - St. Landry Parish Courthouse, MICHEL, Anne wid. of Joseph CORMIER She had 1 child: Jean COMEAU. He had 3 children: Felice CORMIER m. Joseph BABINEAU; Louison m. dec. THIBODEAUX; Susanne m. Baptiste GRANG
2 CONC ER. Together Joseph and Anne had 3 children: Anaclet; Joseph; dec. wid. of Mr. ARCENEAUX. Succ. dated 20 June 1818 (Opel. Ct.Hse.: Succ.#108). (9) SWLR - St. Landry Catholic Church, CORMIER, Anaclet (Joseph & Anne MICHEL) m. 25 Ju
2 CONC ly 1793 Magdeleine RICHARD (Victor & Marie BRASSEUR) Wits: Dose CORMIER, Victor RICHARD, Francois MILANI. Fr. Pedro de ZAMORA (Opel. Ch.: v.1-A, p.46). 
