2 CONT !MARRIAGE: Magdalina RICHARD (Victor RICHARD & Marie BRASSEUX) married her 1st husband, Don Anacleto CORMIER (Joseph CORMIER & Ana MICHEL) on 25 Jul 1793, recorded at St. Landry Catholic Church, Opelousas, La. (OPEL CH VOL# 1 PAGE
2 CONC  46). She married the 2nd husband, Ursin BIJOT on 25 Aug 1814, recorded at (OPEL CH VOL# 1 PAGE 257) or on 24 Aug 1814, recorded at St. Landry Parish Courthouse, Opelousas, La. (OPEL CT HSE: SUCC # OA - 72). The marriage to Don An
2 CONC acleto CORMIER is listed in "The Opelousas Post" by Gladys DEVILLIER - 976.35 k2 page 37, Don Anacleto CORMIER, legitimate son of Josef CORMIER and Ana MICHAEL - married Magdalina RICHARD, legitimate daughter of Victor RICHARD and
2 CONC  Maria BRASSEUSE, they were married on 21 Jul 1793. The Childern listed were: Elisa, batized 21 Feb 1796, born25 Aug 1794, with Godparents, Pedro JUBERT and Julia RICHARD, her materal Aunt - was burried 12 Feb 1799. Celeste, bapti
2 CONC zed 25 Dec 1797, born 28 Dec 1796, with Godparents, Pedro ARSENAUX and Margarita RICHARD, her materal Aunt. Pablo, baptized 16 Nov 1800, with Godparents, Josef CORMIER and Margarita GUILBEAU. Julia, baptized 20 Nov 1802, at the ag
2 CONC e of 6 months old, with Godparents, Juan CORMIER and Julia RICHARD. Anacleto, burried 29 Jan 1806. Magdalina Magdalen RICHARD married 2nd husband, Ursin BIJOT (BIGEAU) of Atakapas, she is the widow of Anaclet CORMIER (RIN 972) on 
2 CONC 25 Aug 1814, (OPEL CH VOL# 1 PAGE 257) and is listed as the widow of Anaclet CORMIER who died 4 years ago, which was recorded at St. Landry Parish Courthouse, Opelousas, La. (OPEL CT HSE: OA-72) dated 24 Aug 1814. Ann MICHEL widow
2 CONC er of Joseph CORMIER in the succession of Ann MICHEL dated 1 Jul 1820 (LSAR: OPEL: 1820). Anne MICHEL widow of Joseph CORMIER, Anne MICHEL had 1 child; Jean COMEAU. Joseph CORMIER had 3 childern; Felice CORMIER md. Joseph BABINEAU
2 CONC ; Louison CORMIER md. THIBODEAUX; Susanne CORMIER md. Baptiste GRANGER. Anne MICHEL & Joseph CORMIER together had 3 childern; Anaclet; Joseph; a da ughter a widow of Mr. ARCENEAUX as stated in the succsion of Anne MICHEL dated 20 
2 CONC Jun 1818 (OPEL CT HSE SUCC # 108).
