2 CONC 26). Michel CORMIER of Acadie, widow of la fille de Mr. STELLY was married on 10 Feb 1789 to Mrs. Estienne BENOIST, a widow from Acadie & recorded at St. Martin Parish Courthouse, St. Martinville, Louisiana (SM CT HSE OA 7 51).
