2 CONT == Biography =='''Marie Josephe Cormier''' was born on 27 Sep 1742 to parents Pierre Cormier and Cecile Thibodeau.<ref>White, Stephen A. ''La généalogie des trente-sept familles hôtesses des Retrouvailles 94,'' online articles, Le
2 CONC s Cahiers de la Société historique acadienne, vol. 25, nos 2et 3 (1994), [https://www.umoncton.ca/umcm-ceaac/files/umcm-ceaac/wf/wf/pdf/37fam-cormier.pdf CORMIER], page 1-2</ref> She was baptized thesame day at Beaubassin. Her god
2 CONC parents were Jacques Vignaut and MarieCormier.<ref>Library and Archives Canada Fonds des Archives départementales de la Charente-Maritime [La Rochelle, France] : C-1207 Registres de Beaubassin - reel_c1207 MG 6 A 2 (Image 105) htt
2 CONC p://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1207/105?r=0&s=6</ref><ref>Acadian Church Records, vol. II Author: Milton P. and Norma Gaudet Rieder
2 CONT Publication: Metairie, LA: Authors, 1976 Page: 85</ref>
2 CONT The date of her death is unknown.  The date 7 Jan 1825 in Memramcook which was on this profile has been removed since no record was found tosupport this claim and it is the date of her brother François' death.
