2 CONT == Biography =='''Charles Cormier''' was born 26 June 1744. He was the son of [[Cormier-77|Pierre Cormier]] and [[Thibodeau-22|Cecile Thibodeau]].<ref>White, Stephen A. ''La généalogie des trente-sept familles hôtesses desRetrouva
2 CONC illes 94,'' online articles, Les Cahiers de la Société historique acadienne, vol. 25, nos 2 et 3 (1994), [https://www.umoncton.ca/umcm-ceaac/files/umcm-ceaac/wf/wf/pdf/37fam-cormier.pdf CORMIER], page 1-2</ref> He was baptized the
2 CONC  same day at Beaubassin. His godparentswere Joseph Terriot and Madeleine Cormier.<ref>Library and Archives Canada Fonds des Archives départementales de la Charente-Maritime [La Rochelle, France]:C-1207 Registres de Beaubassin-reel
2 CONC _c1207 MG 6 A 2 (Image 115) http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1207/115?r=0&s=6</ref> <ref>Acadian Church Records, vol. II Author: Milton P. and Norma Gaudet Rieder
