2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT == Biography ==:'''Marie-Cécile Cormier''', daughter of Pierre dit ''Palette'' Cormier and Cécile Thibodeau , was born about 1746 in Beaubassin Acadie.<ref>White, Stephen A. ''La généalogie des trente-sept familles hôtesses des Re
2 CONC trouvailles 94,'' online articles, Les Cahiers de la Société historique acadienne, vol. 25, nos 2 et 3 (1994), [https://www.umoncton.ca/umcm-ceaac/files/umcm-ceaac/wf/wf/pdf/37fam-cormier.pdf CORMIER], page 1-2</ref> She married P
2 CONC ierre François Chouinard, son of Eustache & Marie-Madeleine Bérubé on 18 February1765 in Montmagny, Quebec.<ref>"Québec, registres paroissiaux catholiques, 1621-1979," database with images, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/a
2 CONC rk:/61903/3:1:3QS7-L99M-BZ28?cc=1321742&wc=HC2X-7M9%3A16385601%2C16385602%2C13699801: 16 July 2014), Montmagny > Saint-Thomas > Baptêmes, mariages, sépultures 1679-1789 > image 704 of 1388; Archives Nationales du Quebec (National 
2 CONC Archives of Quebec), Montreal.</ref><ref>BIRTH-MARRIAGE: BonaArsenault, HISTOIRE ET GENEALOGIE DES ACADIENS, vols. 1-6; 1630-1775;Quebec, Le Conseil de la Vie Francaise en Amerique, 1965; p. 921; :Born around 1745, Marie Cécile ma
2 CONC rried at Saint-Thomas in Montmagny on 18 Feb 1765 to Pierre-Francois CHOUINARD, .</ref>
2 CONT :'''Sister''' of Jean-Baptiste Cormier; Pierre Dit Pierrot a Nannette Cormier, III; François Cormier; Michel Pierre Cormier, Sr.; Marie-Josephe Cormier; Joseph-Pierre Cormier; Charles Cormier; Armand à PierreCormier; Jacques Cormi
2 CONC er; Étienne Cormier and Marie Cormier" <ref>"MyHeritage Family Trees
2 CONT Site name:Saladino Family Web Site Site manager:Jeannette SaladinoBirth: Feb 18 1744 - Beaubassin, (Acadia), Cumberland, Nova Scotia, Canada Death: Circa 1787 Parents: Pierre Cormier, Cécile Cormier (born Thibodeau)Siblings: ...t 
2 CONC A' Nanette Cormier, Etienne Cormier, Francois Dit Le Rebelle Cormier, Michel Cormier, Joseph Pierre (Twin) Cormier, Marie Or Mary-..[(https://www.geni.com/people/Marie-C%C3%A9cile-Chouinard/6000000007378045491)]</ref> :She passed 
2 CONC away on 6 April 1813 and was interred on the 8th at  Saint-Jean-Port-Joli.<ref>"Québec, registres paroissiaux catholiques, 1621-1979," database with images, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3QS7-L99Q-CFM3?cc=1
2 CONC 321742&wc=HCHW-FM9%3A21199001%2C21199002%2C21199003 : 16 July 2014), Saint-Jean-Port-Joli > Saint-Jean-Port-Joli > Baptêmes, mariages, sépultures 1796-1835 > image 239 of 709;Archives Nationales du Quebec (National Archives of Que
2 CONC bec), Montreal.</ref>
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT <references />
2 CONT See also:*Karen Theriot Reader [https://gw.geneanet.org/katheriot?lang=en&pz=frederick+joseph&nz=theriot&ocz=1&p=marie+cecile&n=cormier Marie CécileCormier] at Geneanet.* Marriage to Pierre-Francois Chouinard: Down loads via inter
2 CONC net from the Centre d'Etudes Acadien, University of Moncton, NB, 1996, printouts, file "Cormier.htm"
2 CONT
