2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT Jacques Cormier was born around 1748 in Beaubassin .<ref>Karen TheriotReader [https://gw.geneanet.org/katheriot?lang=en&pz=frederick+joseph&nz=theriot&ocz=1&p=jacques+dit+jacquot&n=cormier Jacques dit Jacquot Cormier] at Geneanet.
2 CONC </ref>  He married Marie Osite Pothier, daughter of Jean Pothier and Marie Josèphe Hébert, on 24 January 1770 in Ekoupahag (Kingsclear).<ref name=SW94>White, Stephen A. ''La généalogie des trente-sept familles hôtesses des Retrouv
2 CONC ailles 94,'' online articles, Les Cahiers de la Société historique acadienne, vol. 25, nos 2et 3 (1994), [https://www.umoncton.ca/umcm-ceaac/files/umcm-ceaac/wf/wf/pdf/37fam-cormier.pdf CORMIER], page 1-2 <blockquote>13. x. Jacque
2 CONC s, m Ekoupahag (Kingsclear) 24 janv 1770 Marie-Osite POTHIER (Jean & Marie-Josèphe Hébert).</blockquote></ref><ref> Marriage- Registre de l'abbe Charles Francois Bailly (Caraquet) 1768-1773, 1978, Pg. 49, Marriage entry for Jacque
2 CONC s Cormier and Marie Osithe Potier, Transcript under the direction of Stephen A. White, 1978, copy in my possession, Centre d'Etude Acadienne.</ref> <ref>Nova Scotia Church Records - Acadia - Divers registres, 1755-1799, ( M.G. 10,
2 CONC  B11, 2, 1, Vol 1) Image 107,[http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1449/107?r=0&s=4 entry for Jacques Cormier & Marie Osithe Pothier] Marriage 24 January 1770, digital images, Héritage, Genealogy collection, Library 
2 CONC and Archives Canada, Ste-Anne de Restigouche P.Q. Parish register - 1449 , Parish Registers: Nova Scotia : C-1449 accessed February 2020. </ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''<ref name=SW94/><br/>
