2 CONT Brief Life History of Jean
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jean Boudrot was born about 1710, in Grand-Pré, Acadia, New France, his father, Claude Boudrot, was 48 and his mother, Catherine Meunier, was 29. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Agathe Thibodeau on 4 October 1731, in Annapolis Royal, Nova Scotia, British North America. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 21 May 1763, in Port Royal, Nova Scotia, British North America, at the age of 54.
