2 CONT Brief Life History of Anastasie
2 CONT
2 CONT When Anastasie Boudreaux was born on 21 March 1746, in Grand-Pré, Kings, Nova Scotia, Canada, her father, Jean Boudrot, was 37 and her mother, Agathe Thibodeau, was 34. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Olivier Barriault on 9 February 1764, in Ille-et-Vilaine, France. 
2 CONT They were the parents of at least 1 daughter. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 19 February 1766, in Saint-Malo, Brittany, France, at the age of 19, and was buried in Ille-et-Vilaine, France.
