2 CONT ***Exiled to VA 1755, age 16
2 CONT ***Deported to England 1756, age 17
2 CONT ***Repatriated to France aboard L'Ambition, arrived St.-Malo 22 May 1763, age 24; at Plouër-sur-Rance, France, 1763-72; in Poitou, France, 1773-76
2 CONT ***In Fourth Convoy from Châtellerault to Nantes, France, Mar 1776
2 CONT ***On list of Acadians at Nantes, Sep 1784, listed as Marie Boudreau
2 CONT ***Sailed to la Luisiana on ''Le St.-Rémi'', age 50[sic]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Notes:'''
2 CONT **Arrived in current day Louisiana Nov 1785
2 CONT ----
