1 NAME Alexandre /Broussard/
2 GIVN Alexandre
2 SURN Broussard
2 _MARNM Broussard dit Beausoleil
2 NICK Brossard
2 NICK Brosard
2 NICK Alexander
2 NICK Alexandre Dit Beausoleil Broussard
2 NICK Beausoile
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1699
