2 DATE 18 SEP 1765
2 PLAC buried at the last camp below Poste de Attakapas
2 ADDR
3 STAE La Luisiana (Spanish Louisiana)
3 CTRY Viceroyalty of New Spain [Spanish Colonial North America]
1 DEAT
2 DATE ABT 18 SEP 1765
