2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Gregoire "Petite Joe" Broussard was born in 1726. He died on December 20, 1788 in St. Martin Parish, LA Succession listed in ORIGINAL ACTS BOOK 19, #157 FOR 1800, St. Martinville, LA.
2 CONT
2 CONT ____________________
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph-Grégoire dit Petit Jos, eldest surviving son of Joseph Broussard dit Beausoleil and Agnès Thibodeau, born probably at Port-Royal in c1727, married Anastasie, daughter of René LeBlanc and Anne Thériot, probably at Petitcoudi
2 CONC ac in c1750.  They followed his father into exile in present-day southeastern New Brunswick, where Petit Jos served in the Acadian resistance, and to imprisonment in Nova Scotia in 1760.  Petit Jos remarried to Marguerite, daughte
2 CONC r of Charles Savoie, probably at Halifax in c1763.  They followed his parents to Louisiana in 1764-65 and settled on Bayou Teche, where they had more children.  Their daughters married into the Bernard and Broussard families.  Pet
2 CONC it Jos died at Attakapas in December 1788; the priest who recorded the burial, but who did not bother to give any parents' names, said that Joseph, married to Marguerite Savoie, died "at age 62 yrs." of a chest cold or pneumonia. 
2 CONC  His succession record, listing his surviving children, was filed at what became the St. Martinville courthouse, St. Martin Parish, in November 1800.  Only half of his four sons, his oldest and his youngest, continued this family 
2 CONC line.  
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Joseph Gregoire Broussard, son of Alexandre dit (Beausoleil) Broussard and Marguerite Thibodeau, was born 1 April 1725 in Port Royal, Acadia. He was christened there 3 April 1725. [2]Joseph Gregoire died some time before 12 August
2 CONC  1763 in Acadia.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Gregoire married Ursule Trahan about 1749 in Petitcoudiac, Acadia. The couple had three known children, all of whom eventually immigrated to Louisiana with their widowed mother. They settled in the Attakapas area, now St. Martin a
2 CONC nd Lafayette Parishes.
2 CONT
2 CONT # Mathurin BROUSSARD b: Abt 1750 in Acadia
2 CONT # Elisabeth BROUSSARD b: Abt 1752 in Acadia
2 CONT # Joseph Gregoire BROUSSARD b: 10 Apr 1754 in Pisiguit, Acadia c: 4 Jun 1754 in New Brunswick, Canada
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage of Parents: 7 FEB 1724 Port Royal, Acadia[4]
2 CONT
