2 CONC  Godparents - Joseph BROSSARD, son of the late François BROSSARD, & Agnes TIBAUDEAU, daughter of Michel TIBAUDEAU. Priest - Rene Charles de BRESLAY.
2 CONT * ↑ Source: #S243 p. 5. Text: He was deceased by [12] Aug 1763 when his widow and three children are listed as prisoners at Halifax, Nova Scotia (AG E: v.2, #9-4).
2 CONT * ↑ Source: #S14 Page: pp. 285 & 1517
