2 CONT Marguerite Broussard was born about 1738 in Acadia. She died on April, 19, 1821 in St. Martin Parish, LA (SM CH V4 #1446).  Marguerite's age was taken from CENSUS of 1777 for ATTAKAPAS, and showed her age in 1777 as 38 years; her 
2 CONC husband CHARLES DUGAS was 1 year older then Marguerite.  Also, on her death record in 1821, Marguerite's age is listed as being 80 years. 
