2 CONT Francoise Broussard was born in 1751 in Acadia. She was buried on October 9, 1801 in St. Martin Parish, LA. (SM CH V4 #243). Francoise's death record listed her parents as Joseph Broussard and Anne Thibodeau of Acadia, and stated 
2 CONC that Francoise died at age 50 years. 
