2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT [[Category:Port-Royal, Acadie]]
2 CONT {{Acadian}}
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT Anne was born in 20 May 1709 and was baptized 25 May 1709 at Port Royal. She was the daughter of [[Richard-70|Alexandre Richard]] and [[Petitpas-3|Isabelle Petitpas]]. <ref>https://novascotia.ca/archives/acadian/archives.asp?ID=28
2 CONC 3</ref> 
2 CONT She married Michel Tibaudot, son of Michel Tibaudot and Agnes Dugast 18 Sept 1729 at Saint Charles des Mines, Grand Pre.<ref>http://heritage.canadiana.ca/view/oocihm.lac_reel_c1870/638?r=0&s=5</ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT She passed away before 1763. Family of Michel Thibodeau and Anne-Marie Richard is complete with (5 children) according to PRDH. ''No more info is currently available for Anne Richard. Can you add toher biography?''
2 CONT
