2 CONT ***Attakapas, La Luisiana census, 1769, listed as Enselme Tibodeau, age 20
2 CONT ***Attakapas, La Luisiana census, 1771, age 22, listed as Anselme
2 CONT ***On Attakapas militia list, Jan 1773, called Anselme Thibodeau
2 CONT ***Attakapas, La Luisiana census, 1777, listed as Anselme, age 26
2 CONT ***Attakapas, La Luisiana census, 1781, listed as Anselme Tibaudot
2 CONT ***On Attakapas militia list, Aug 1789, called Anselmo Tribodo
2 CONT ***Successions dated 5 Feb & 13 Mar 1822, St. Martin Parish courthouse, & 10 Nov 1823, Lafayette Parish courthouse
2 CONT ----
