2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT :Firmin-Grégoire's birth date is unknown at this time. His mother haddied before June 1752 so he was born before that date. Firmin-Grégoire is the child of [[Thibodeau-430|Benjamin Thibodeau]] and [[Thibodeau-440|Isabelle Thibodea
2 CONC u]].   :FIRMIN-GRÉGOIRE THIBODEAU (à Benjamin à Michel), m ISABELLE BABINEAU.  :Enfants :#François, n v 1781; m v 1803 Marie CORMIER (Amand & Marie-Josèphe Roy); d Barachois 27 août 1838.#Henriette, n v 1784; m Cocagne 25 juil 180
2 CONC 8 Germain GOGUEN (Jean-Baptiste & Marie-Madeleine Thibodeau); d Cocagne 7 mars 1862.#Marc, n v 1787; m Memramcook 30 sept 1811 Marie BOURQUE (Jean-Chrysostôme & Marie Hébert). 
2 CONT
2 CONT :Marriage or Union  :Isabelle at 39 & Firmin-Gregoire to 40 years in 1780
2 CONT
