2 CONT ID: I8833 Name: Pierre LEMIRE Given Name: Pierre Surname: Lemire Name: dit MIRE, MYRE Given Name: dit MIRE, MYRE Surname: Sex: M Birth: Abt 1705 in Paris, , , France Death: Bef 26 Feb 1748 1 Reference Number: LEMIRE 1 _UID: 407749
2 CONC 3C3EEED411AFD90050DA8458AF8A50 Change Date: 6 Oct 2013 at 20:30 Note: !BIRTH-MARRIAGES-CHILDREN-DEATH: Bona Arsenault, HISTOIRE ET GENEALOGIE DES ACADIENS; 1625-1810; Ottawa, Editions Lemeac, 1978, 6 vols.; p. 1419 (Pisiguit); own
2 CONC  copy. Born around 1705, Pierre LEMIRE dit MIRE was originally from Paris. He married 1st around 1726 to Marie-Josephe FOREST (no parents given); two children. Pierre married 2nd at Port Royal on 14 Jul 1738 to Isabelle THIBODEAU;
2 CONC  five children. He died before 1757.
2 CONT
2 CONT !MARRIAGES-CHILDREN: John K. Harrell, "The Family of Pierre LeMIRE: An Acadian of Early Louisiana," in NEW ORLEANS GENESIS, vol. XXXIII, no. 129 (Jan 1994), pp. 1-8. Pierre married 2nd on 13 Jul 1738 at Port Royal, Acadia, to Isab
2 CONC elle THIBADAUT, daughter of Claude & Isabelle COMMAU. He was the widower of Marie-Josephe FOREST, and a resident of Holy Family Parish at Pisiguit (Reference: Rieder, v. 5, p. 81.)
2 CONT
2 CONT DEATH: Pierre died before the wedding of his daughter Petronille on 26 February 1748.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Marie Josephe FOREST b: Abt 1695 in , , , Acadia Married: Abt 1730 in , , , Acadia Change Date: 22 Apr 2014        Marriage 2 Elisabeth THIBODEAU b: 16 Nov 1710 in Port Royal, , , Acadia c: 17 Nov 1710 in Port Royal, , 
2 CONC , Acadia Married: 14 Jul 1738 in Port Royal, , , Acadia 2 Change Date: 22 Apr 2014Sources: Abbrev: Acadian Church Records, vol. II Title: Acadian Church Records, vol. II Author: Milton P. and Norma Gaudet Rieder Publication: Metai
2 CONC rie, LA: Authors, 1976 Note:  Covers year 1712-1748. Also available as microfiche #6087649. Includes transcripts of Beaubassin, Acadia church registers, now at the Archives of the Mayor of La Rochelle, Charente Maritime, France. R
2 CONC epository: Name: Family History Library 35 North West Temple Salt Lake City UT 84150
2 CONT
2 CONT Page: p. 127 Quality: 3 Note: He died before the marriage of his daughter Petronille. Abbrev: Dictionnaire Généalogique des Familles Acadiennes Title: Dictionnaire Généalogique des Familles Acadiennes, Première Partie 1636-1714 Au
2 CONC thor: Stephen A. White Publication: 2 vols., Moncton, New Brunswick: Centre d'Études Acadiennes, 1999 Page: p. 1522 Note: No parents given for groom
2 CONT
