2 CONT Brief Life History of Jean'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jean [Baptiste] Quessy was born in 1736, in New Brunswick, Canada, his father, Jean Quessy, was 34 and his mother, Marie Marguerite Bourgeois, was 28. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Louise Forton on 17 April 1768, in Notre-Dame de Québec, Quebec City, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 6 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 27 December 1786, in Quebec, Canada, at the age of 50.
