2 CONT !INFORMATION: Agnes BRUN is listed as a parent to Celestine THIBODEAUX as stated in the succession of Olivier THIBODEAUX dated 23 Aug 1808 and recorded at St. Martin Parish Courthouse, St. Martinville, La. (SM CT HSE: SUCC # 28). 
2 CONC Also is listed in the LDS IGI file with a Batch #: 7911302, Sheet #: 45, Source Call #: 1260527 and in Batch #: M533281, Source Call #: 976.35 U2H V.1. INFORMATION: WidowOlivier THIBODEAUX, deceased widow Agnes BREAUX with Heirs: 
2 CONC Theodore, Pierre GIROIR, Jean & Cyrille, Nicolas, Joseph SONNIER, Valerie MARTIN for his wife Celestine, Michel MARTIN for his wife Marguerite DUVAL, Placide DUVAL & Cyril DUVAL for their Mother Anne DOUCET - the daughter of the w
2 CONC idow THIBODEAUX as stated in the succession of Olivier THIBODEAUX dated 23 Aug 1808 and recorded at St. Martin Parish Courthouse, St. Martinville, La. (SM CT HSE: SUCC # 28). !MARRIAGE: of Agnes BRUN was married on 30 Sep 1786 to 
2 CONC Oliver THIBAUDO, already married by Father Valentin & was reocrded at St. Martin Parish Courthouse, St. Martinville, La. (SM CT HSE: OA - 4 1/2 - 60), there was no Commandant Present and Olivier THIBODEAUX widow deceased wid. of A
2 CONC gnes BREAUX: HEIRS: Theodore, Pierre GIROIR, Jean& Cyrille, Nicolas, Joseph SONNIER, Valerie MARTIN for his wife Celestine, Michel MARTIN for his wife Marguerite DUVAL. Placide DUVAL & Cyril DUVAL foe their Mother Anne Doucet - da
2 CONC ughter of the widr. THIBODEAUX, Succession dated 23 Aug 1808 and recorded at St. Martin Parish Courthouse, St. Martinville, La. (SM CT HSE: SUCC # 28). Agnes BRUN married Olivier THIBODEAUX & was recorded at St. Martinof the Tours
2 CONC  Catholic Church, St. Martinville, La. (SM CH). !DEATH: of Olivier dit Petion THIBODEAUX (dead Oiliver THIBODEAUX & dead Agnes BRUN) died 16 Sep 1821 at the age 39 years old. Olivier THIBODEAUX died at his Brother's (Cyrille THIBO
2 CONC DEAUX & recorded at St. Martin of the Tours Catholic Church, St. Martinville, La. (SM CH VOL 4 # 1472). Also in the succession of Olivier THIBODEAUX da ted 22 Oct 1821 & recorded at St, Martin Parish Courthouse, St. Martinville, L
2 CONC a. (SM CT HSE SUCC # 421). Agnes BRUN married Olivier THIBODEAUX, had a son named, Cyrille THIBODEAUX. Agnes BRUN died on 25 Oct 1809 at the age 70 years old & recorded at St. Martin of the Tours Catholic Church, St. Martinville, 
2 CONC la. (SM CH VOL 4 # 594).
2 CONT
