2 CONT Brief Life History of Jean Baptiste'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jean Baptiste Côté was born on 5 January 1787, in Saint-Augustin-de-Desmaures, Quebec, Canada, his father, Michel Cote, was 42 and his mother, Birgitte Tibaud, was 33. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 1st wife  Josephte Thibodeau (1782-1810) on 31 January 1809, in Cap-Sante, Hampshire, Lower Canada, British North America. No children on record.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 2nd wife Marie Prospere Marchand (1791–1869)
2 CONT on 12 janvier 1813 in Saint-Charles-des-Grondines, Portneuf, Lower Canada, British Colonial America
2 CONT They had 16 children
2 CONT Marie Prospère Côté 1813–
2 CONT Pierre Cóté 1814–1895
2 CONT Catherine Cote 1816–1900
2 CONT Adelaide Cote 1817–1902
2 CONT Henriette Cote 1820–
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Côté 1822–1903
2 CONT Joseph Cote 1823–1823 (died in infancy)
2 CONT Francois-Xavier Cote 1824–1881
2 CONT Augustin David Coté 1826–1903
2 CONT Louis Cote 1829–1829 (died in infancy)
2 CONT Marie-Anne Cote 1829–1829 (died in infancy)
2 CONT Marcelline Cote 1830–1831 (died in infancy)
2 CONT Angèle Côté 1832–1898
2 CONT Marguerite Cote 1834–1848
2 CONT Charles Cote 1836–1845
2 CONT Marie Rose Délima Côté 1839–1848
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 14 October 1878, in Grondines, Portneuf, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 91, and was buried in Saint-Charles-des-Grondines, Grondines, Portneuf, Canada East, British North America.
