2 CONT Brief Life History of Augustin
2 CONT
2 CONT When Augustin Hardy was born on 5 April 1792, in Cap-Sante, Portneuf, Quebec, Canada, his father, Francois Hardy, was 28 and his mother, Marie Rose Rosalie Gignac, was 33. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 1st wife Marie Leonard Mondor Dubois (1796-1832) on 15 January 1816, in Sainte-Famille, Portneuf, Quebec, Canada. 
2 CONT They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 6 daughters. 
2 CONT Marguerite Anne Hardy 1816–1867
2 CONT Marie Olympe Hardy 1817–
2 CONT Isidore Hardy 1819–
2 CONT Jean Elie Hardy 1820–
2 CONT Marie Rose Hardy 1822–
2 CONT David Hardy 1824–
2 CONT Marie-Louise Hardy 1826–1827
2 CONT Genevieve-Seraphine Hardy 1828–
2 CONT Marie-Solange Hardy 1830–1870
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 2nd wife Euphrasie Thibodeau (1806–1903)
2 CONT on 06 OCT 1835 in Cap-Sante,Portneuf,Quebec
2 CONT They had 1 son and 2 daughters
2 CONT Cléophé Hardy 1836–
2 CONT Rosalie Hardy 1838–1872
2 CONT Misael [Michel?] Hardy 1841–
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived in Cap-Santé, Portneuf, Quebec, Canada in 1861. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 24 October 1861, in Cap-Sante, Portneuf, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 69, and was buried in Cap-Sante, Portneuf, Quebec, Canada.
