2 CONT Joseph Brasseaux - 22 years old born in Iberville Parish and living in Attakapas married Valiene DUGAT on January 22, 1822 who was 15 years old. Joseph was the son of the deceased Joseph Brasseaux and Theodose GAUTRUX. Valiene was
