2 CONT Augustin Braseau was born August 27, 1800 to Joseph Braseau and Thedora Gotro. He was baptized August 27, 1800 with sponsors Joseph LeBlanc and Anrriet Landri. Paternal grandparents were Pedro Braseau and Elizabeth Rixar. Maternal
