2 CONT Julie Trahan was born April 14, 1813 to Pierre Trahan of this Parish and Helene Duplechain of Avoyelles. Paternal grandparents Pierre Trahan and Anna Brasseaux of Acadia and Maternal grandparents Jean Baptiste Duplechain of Point 
