1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Benjamin Ponthieu, Sr. (1826-1879) was a son of Alexander Alexis Ponthieu & Marguerite Jeansonne.
2 CONT
2 CONT Former husband of Lucille Tassin (1859-1933). Married 11/21/1848.
2 CONT
2 CONT ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage to Julie Mayeux on 21 Nov 1848 in Avoyelles, Louisiana, USA
2 CONT Source: Avoyelles Marriage Record: Book B2, Page 167
2 CONT
2 CONT Separation of Benjamin Ponthieu and Julie Mayeux was filed on 03 Oct 1876 in Avoyelles, Louisiana, USA
2 CONT Source: Civil File #5892 - Julia Mayeux requested separation from Benjamin Ponthieu on grounds of verbally & physically beating her repeatedly & adultery he committed with Columbe Dupuis.
2 CONT
2 CONT Benjamin and Julie were divorced on 10 Oct 1876 in Marksville, Avoyelles, Louisiana, USA
2 CONT Source: Civil File #5892: Divorce, custody and guardianship granted to Julia Mayeux.
2 CONT
2 CONT October 22, 1879 is the date the tutorship was filed for in Benjamin Ponthieu's succession and granted to Julia Mayeux Ponthieu for minor daughters Isma Virginie Ponthieu and Ophelia Ponthieu.
2 CONT
2 CONT It is believed that Benjamin Ponthieu fathered two Ponthieu children (Azelina & Belle) with Columbe Dupuis however I have not physically located any document proving such yet 5/10/2020
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
