1 CONT VINCENT Breau, ne en 1631, originaire de La Chaussee, region de Loudun,departement de la Vie nne, France: arrive en Acadie vrs 1652, marie vers1661 a Marie Bourque, fille d'Antoine et d'An toinette Landry.
1 CONT
1 CONT Dallas Public Library, Dallas TX, Sat, 21-Dec-1996
1 CONT (R929.30891 H446A) Acadians in Exile, Rev Donald J Hebert,
1 CONT 1980, Hebert Publications, PO Box A, Cecilia LA 70521 p 468 List of Acadians and Census Repor ts 1671
1 CONT Vincent Brot, farmer, age 40, wife Marie Bour age 26 yr. They have 4 children Marie age 9 yr , Anthoine age 5 yr, Marguerite age 3 yr, Pierre age 2yr. They have 9 horned cattle, 7 sheep , and 4 arpents farm land.
1 CONT
1 CONT !BIRTH-MARRIAGE-CHILDREN-CENSUS-DEATH: Stephen A. White, DICTIONNAIRE GENEALOGIQUE DES FAMILL ES ACADIENNES; 1636-1714; Moncton, New LeBrunswick, Centre d'Etudes Acadiennes, 1999, 2 vols. ; p. 270; own copy. #1: Vincent BREAU (BRO
1 CONC T), born around
1 CONT 1631, a "laboreur," married aroun d 1661 to Marie Bourque, ? of Antoine & Antoinette LANDRY; twelve children. G. MASSIGNO N cites a baptismal sponsor (La Chausse'e, Poitou, France Register) of Vincent BREAU for Made leine LeBrun, 
1 CONC ? of Vincent &
1 CONT Vincende (sic for Rene'e) BREAU on 25 Jan 1645. It is proba bly this man. However, a note explains that (due to dispensations) he could not be the brothe r or nephew of the Rene'e BREAU who was married to Vincent LeBrun. So his pa
1 CONC rents are ? . He
1 CONT died between Nov 1684 and Jan 1686.---aka BROT
1 CONT
1 CONT !PARENTS-CHRISTENING-IMMIGRATION: "The Acadian MICHEL (MITCHEL Family," in ACADIAN GENEALOG Y EXCHANGE; ; vol. 25, nos. 2 & 3 (Apr & Jul 1996); p. 50; own copy. Vincent BREAUX or BRAUL T was baptized 29 May 1629 in St.. Clement Pa
1 CONC rish, St..
1 CONT Jean-de-Sauves, Vienne, France, son o f Rene' Breau & Marie RENAUME. [What document links him to the Vincent in Acadia?] He came t o America [sic] about 1652 among colonists recruited by Charles de MENOU de Charnisay, Lord o f Aul
1 CONC nay, then Royal
1 CONT Governor of Acadia.
1 CONT
1 CONT !BIRTH-IMMIGRATION-MARRIAGE-CHILDREN: Bona Arsenault, HISTOIRE ET GENEALOGIE DES ACADIENS; 16 25-1810; Ottawa, Editions Lemeac, 1978, 6 vols.; pp. 466-467 (Port Royal); own copy. Born i n 1631, name spelled Vincent Breau (also BRE
1 CONC AUX), originally
1 CONT from La Chausse'e in the Loudu n region, department of Vienne, France. He arrived in Acadia around 1652, married around 166 1 to Marie Bourque; eleven children.
1 CONT
1 CONT !BIRTH-PARENTS-MARRIAGE-DEATH: Giselle Gregoire-Rustenburg, GEDCOM file (MAC); 1600-1950; Au g 1995; # 582; sent disk by mail. Vincent (BREAUX) Breau, born 29 May 1629 at St.. Jean de Sa uves, France. Married in 1661 at Port Royal
1 CONC  to Marie
1 CONT Bourque. Died after [sic, should be just b efore] 1686. [Who were parents?]
1 CONT
1 CONT PARENTS-SIBLING: Did he have an older sister name (Marie) Rene'e BRAUD, married to Vincent BR UN ABT 1644? [S.A. WHITE argues against this in his Dictionnaire.] Was their father also name d Vincent? Is there any possibility that t
1 CONC he wife of Jehan
1 CONT TERRIAU (Jean Theriault) was not Per rine RAU, but BREAU or Breau?
1 CONT
1 CONT !CENSUS: 1671, Port Royal, Acadia [p. 10], name spelled BROT. Age 40, ?  with wife Mari e BOUR, 26, and their 4 children. They have 9 cattle, 7 sheep and 4 arpans of land.
1 CONT
1 CONT !CENSUS: 1678, Clarence J. d'Entremont, "Recensement de Port-Royal," in MEMOIRES DE LA SOCIET E GENEALOGIQUE CANADIENNE-FRANCAISE; vol. 22, no. 4; p. 233; sent by PERSI in Jun 1999. On Fo lio 20, first entry: Vincelot BERAUD & Mar
1 CONC ie Bourque, with
1 CONT four boys and two girls. They hav e 3 arpents of land, with 5 head of cattle.
1 CONT
1 CONT CENSUS: 1686, Port Royal, Acadia, not listed, but must have just died, because Marie BOURC "v euve de Vincent BREAU" is listed with her 10 children, the Youngest only 2 months old.[2703197.ged]
1 CONT
1 CONT REFN: 10083
