1 CONT Note: In 1766, Charles and Judith were listed on the left bank of the Mississippi River (Acad ian Coast). Children in the house with them were Marguerite, ? (of the first marriage? ), age 7; Jean, son, age 3; and Basile des Roches
1 CONC , orphan, age12.
1 CONT In the house with Judith i n 1795 on Bayou Lafourche were the children Jean Baptiste Savoie, age 32; Simon Savoie, age 1 8 and Isabel Savoie, age 16. Joseph Savoie, age 25 and his wife Marie Franc'oise Bergeron wer e next door. An
1 CONC other son, Amadeo
1 CONT (age 26) lived nearby with his wife Victoire Bourqueois and t heir two children. In 1795, the family live on Bayou Lafourche but Charles had already died . He was still ?  on November 15, 1784 when he was given as a buyer at an au
