0 @N6000000002801479729@ NOTE Our French-Canadian Ancestors, Vol. 6, by Thomas J. Laforest lists Jean as the Sieur de Monbrun, but other sources, including The Canadian Biographical Dictionary, Vol. III, provide the alternate spelling, "Montbrun."
0 @N6000000002801481356@ NOTE Our French-Canadian Ancestors, Vol. 6, by Thomas J. Laforest states that Jacques was the twin of Jean-Baptiste.  This makes a second pair of twins for Pierre and Jeanne Boucher, the first being Jeanne and Louise, born only three y
1 CONC ears earlier.  A Genealogy and History of Jacques Timothe Boucher De Monbreun and His Ancestors and Descendants backs up this same claim.  The latter reference makes not of his name as "de Montizambert."
