1 CONT
1 CONT Pierre RICHARD, informant, married at the Mines, St. Charles Parish on 16 August 1740 to Marie Josephe LeBLANC, born same place in 1715 of Antoine and Anne LANDRY, sister german to Brigitte LeBLANC, mother to Joseph and Mathurin, 
1 CONC living at Kgoyet in this parish, where the genealogy was made.
