0 @N6000000003087577568@ NOTE Source:
1 CONT Acadian-Cajun Mailing List:
1 CONT Fredrica Givan, (givan@brunnet.net)
1 CONT Carol Thibodeau, (Cajuncolen@aol.com)
1 CONT Karen Theriot Reader, (KATheriot@aol.com),
1 CONT Bona Arsenault, Histoire et Genealogie des Acadiens, Grand Pre, p.1175.
1 CONT "New Orleans Genesis October, 1994, Vol XXXIII", no.132, p.436.
1 CONT
1 CONT Marguerite is daughter of Bonaventure Theriot and Jeanne Boudrot.
