1 CONT
1 CONT From the marriage of Pierre RICHARD and the deceased Marie GIROUARD,
1 CONT married at Port Royal in 1709 were born:
1 CONT (2)     Joseph - born in June 1713, married at Port Royal in 1743 to Marie
1 CONT BLANCHARD, daughter of Antoine and Elisabeth THERIOT, who went
1 CONT to Canada with their family.
