1 CONT From the marriage of Pierre RICHARD and the deceased Marie GIROUARD,
1 CONT married at Port Royal in 1709 were born:
1 CONT (7)     Armand  -       born in 1721, married in Port Royal, to Marguerite BROUSSARD, daughter of Jean and Cecile BABIN, transported with their family to the English colonies.
