0 @N6000000007392136225@ NOTE
1 CONT 1993:Amand settled in La. in a small town along Bayou Vermilion then called Vermilionville. Today, Vermilionville is a living history museum & folklife village in Lafayette, La.(the original Vermilionville). Amand's family home ha
1 CONC s been reconstructed and is an historic landmark furnished with period artifacts.it is located at 1600 Surrey Street; Lafayette, la. Amand BROUSSARD House ca 1790.
0 @N6000000003087554472@ NOTE Source:
1 CONT http://www.erols.com/someday/Richard.html (Steve & Natalie Fleming):
1 CONT Yvon Cyr, "In search of our Acadian roots" CD-ROM: p-hall.ged
