0 @N6000000001744186306@ NOTE Listing for Theophile LeBlanc died 3 January 1877.  Southwest Louisiana Records v. 13 pg. 316.  St. Mary Magdalen Catholic Church, Abbeville, LA. v. 2 pg. 49
0 @N6000000000987225368@ NOTE This family is in the 1840 census of WINSLOW on page 336 as "Gespan Cayo" age 20-30, one female age 20-30, and one male child age under 5. This Thibodeau family also used the "dit" name of Cadien, hence, Cayo. This dit name is als
1 CONC o found spelled as "Kian" and "Kiah." Cadien most likely meant "Acadian" where their earlier roots stemmed. This family returned to St.François from 1842-3 to about 1848-9 and finally settled in Winslow. 
